(1, 'short', NULL, '17229257', 'Majestic 5-bedroom apartment with an outdoor pool, snooker and BBQ  | Ologolo Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1581', 2, 160000.00, 192000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'There\'s convertible snooker board and table tennis.\r\nwater heater blender\r\nnetflix\r\n5 bed early check in for regular stay - 10k per hour\r\n5 bed late check out for regular stay - 10k per hour\r\n\r\n\r\nPeak Period - December 1st - January 8th.\r\nDecember Rate for 5 bed - 180k payout ; minimum of 1 week booking\r\n\r\n\r\nminimum of two days\r\n\r\nAre In built speakers available with bluetooth in your apartment? Yes\r\n\r\nDo you allow Photoshoot? If yes, what is your rate?\r\n\r\n5 bed photo shoot is 243,000 Maximum of 15 people\r\n\r\n\r\nVideo/Movie shoot Price (Payout only)\r\n\r\n5 bed (20 Guests Max) - 270K\r\n\r\n5 bed (30 Guests Max) - 315K\r\n\r\nNo parties. Only get-together allowed with no DJ, BBQ Grilling Machine. I’ve got in built speakers in the house.\r\nNo Parties but I can allow get-together with limit capacity. Please see rates for get together.\r\n\r\nMaximum of 15 people for the 5 bed (#253,000) payout\r\n\r\nMy regular stay rate for the 5 bed is - 160,000 payout; caution fee is 100k , (11/8/23)', '<p>This acre of unadulterated luxury is in Ologolo, along Lekki axis. A beautifully decorated residence, the palace features a big living space with five bedrooms each with its own bathroom for lots of privacy, and a bathtub in the master bedroom to allow you to soak in and enjoy your bath. There is also a separate guest toilet. It also has a balcony for sightseeing, high-speed Internet, Smart TVs in each room and the living room that give high-definition movie images, and a fully furnished kitchen with a toaster, microwave, electric kettle, cutlery, and table wares, to name a few amenities. Iron in a large closet and washing machine. 24/7electricity. This is superb and your best choice.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLuxury Home Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Swimming Pool<br />\r\n*Smart Home<br />\r\n*Automated Windows<br />\r\n*Automated Doors<br />\r\n*PS5<br />\r\n*Pool Table<br />\r\n*Ping Pong / Table Tennis<br />\r\n*Air Hockey Table<br />\r\n*24/7 Power<br />\r\n*24/7 Private Security<br />\r\n*24/7 Estate Security<br />\r\n*Smart TV in all rooms<br />\r\n*Free Internet<br />\r\n*AC<br />\r\n*Compact Plus DSTV<br />\r\n*Netflix<br />\r\n*Youtube<br />\r\n*Fully Fitted Kitchen with Utensils.<br />\r\n*Family Lounge Area<br />\r\n*Clean Water<br />\r\n*Central Water Heating System<br />\r\n*Separate Laundry Room with Washing Machine and Dryer<br />\r\n*Housekeeping<br />\r\n*All rooms en-suite<br />\r\n*In-Built Speakers with Bluetooth &amp; USB Ports.<br />\r\n*Balcony<br />\r\n*No Smoking<br />\r\n*Photo/Video Shoot Allowed based on review.<br />\r\n*Luxury Furnishing &amp; Lightings<br />\r\n*Luxury Dicon Optimum Orthopedic Mattresses.<br />\r\n*Walk-In Closet<br />\r\n*Automated Gate<br />\r\n*Ample Parking Space</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', NULL, 'House 20 close 2, Whitesand Beach Estate, Ologolo Lekki, , Ologolo, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4625958', '3.5449401', 'MAY2023/MC40NTUwNjMwMCAxNjgzMDQzNTE1-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2130, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'A Smart Home', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-02 15:50:06', '2023-08-11 09:04:19'),
(2, 'short', NULL, '44870356', 'Sophisticated 1-bedroom apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1317', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment number is No 5. check in process is get to apartment and let the gateman know you have a reservation for the Apartment\r\n\r\n\r\nPeak periods\r\nOne Bed N50,000(November)\r\nOne Bed N55,000 (December-January)\r\nOne Bed N55,000(February)\r\n\r\nEarly Check in November to February N10,000 3hrs (11am - 2pm) extra is N5,000\r\nLate check Out N10,000 3hrs (12 - 3) extra is N5,000\r\n\r\nI will not be accepting one day booking in December Minimum is 3 days\r\n\r\nOne Bedroom Orange Chair N45000 payout 3/4/2023)\r\n\r\nMonthly rate- 1 bed 5k off payout', '<p>This apartment is beautifully furnished style apartment in the heart of the Lekki phase 1 . It is in close proximity to the entertainment and business districts of Victoria Island and Ikoyi alike. it is located in a serene gated estate which assures you of safety at all times. Modern conveniences include 24/7 hours electricity supported by generator, fitted kitchen, WIFI, Smart TVs amongst others. Everything you need for a great stay can be found at this location.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, '8 Yeye Olofin Street, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4439407', '3.4615134', 'MAY2023/MC42NjgyOTYwMCAxNjgzMDQzMTk0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', 4.3, 3, NULL, 'Book_now', 846, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-02 15:59:54', '2023-09-05 17:24:45'),
(3, 'short', NULL, '24270750', 'Beautiful 2-bedroom apartment | Abule Egba', 'Apartment', NULL, '1366', 2, 40000.00, 48000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'water heater netflix\r\nThe property allows for hosting mini events like bridal shower,game night\r\nInverter AC in all the room, Water Heater, Smart TV, ... luxurious furniture\r\nthe maximum number of people allowed for game nights and mini events(10); 70k payout for party\r\nCar Service\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate : at same normal fee provided apartment is vacant\r\n\r\nLate check out rate : #5k per hour\r\n\r\nDecember daily Rate for your apartment : #29k\r\n\r\nDecember party Rate for your apartment : #80k\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot @ #50k per day\r\n\r\nDj with all equipment not allowed\r\n\r\nNo In-built speakers available\r\n\r\n24/7 electricity\r\nNormal season is #32k payout daily', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This Beautiful 2-Bedroom apartment located in Abule egba is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 24/7 check in by host. The gorgeous apartment features a beautifully organized living room, fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, Boiling kettle, Tableware &amp; Cutleries, and refrigerator. After a long day of exploring, each room provides exceptionally comfortable king size bed and queen size bed each. If serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home. Apartment is pets friendly and allows parties of max 5 persons(no DJ)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nSmart TVs<br />\r\nNetflix subscription<br />\r\nHigh speed Wifi<br />\r\nBalcony</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 35, Abiodun Onitiri Avenue, Abule-Egba, Lagos, , Abule-egba, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.6552807', '3.3029951', 'MAY2023/MC4zMzY1ODUwMCAxNjgzMDQ1OTgy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 3021, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, '24hrs electricity', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-02 16:26:30', '2023-07-03 07:33:15'),
(5, 'short', NULL, '76914863', 'Stunning 2-Bedroom Apartment | Abule Egba', 'Apartment', NULL, '1465', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Payout rate 60,000', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Titilola Bolaji close,off Beckley estate road abulegba, , Abule-egba, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.6589923', '3.2976115', 'MAY2023/MC4wMzk4ODEwMCAxNjgzMDUwMjMy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2122, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-02 17:57:12', '2023-07-05 12:40:25'),
(6, 'short', NULL, '58542553', 'Luxury 2-bedroom Apartment | Gerrard Road Ikoyi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1484', 2, 80000.00, 96000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supply supported with generator\r\n\r\nCleaning is done upon request\r\n\r\nNo pets\r\nNo Smoking indoors\r\n\r\nDo not allow one day booking, Longer nights preferably\r\nHost payout for normal and peak; 135k- promo for a month-80k(8/8/23)', '<p>A Luxurious and spacious 2 Bedroom 2.5 Bath Apartment situated in Ikoyi, Lagos. Exquisitely furnished living room, with dining room as well as a Game room that includes a snooker table and board games to help our guest relax and unwind. Fully equipped kitchen with washing machine for any laundry needs. This apartment includes Smart TVs, cable TV, free WIFI, 24/7 power supply, 24/7 security, swimming pool, gym and ample parking space.<br />\r\nThe space<br />\r\nSpacious rooms with king size beds.<br />\r\nBeautiful and modern furnishing.<br />\r\nOther things to note<br />\r\nSpecial offer for guest:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplimentary bottle of wine for all guest upon check in<br />\r\nFree Housekeeping service during the entire stay<br />\r\nComplimentary Private Chef provided for long stays (15 nights +)<br />\r\nLaundry service provided for long stays (15 nights+)<br />\r\nComplimentary facial at an upscale spa in Lagos for long stays (15 nights +)</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.449999999999999', '3.433333', 'MAY2023/MC41NDM0NTIwMCAxNjgzMTAyMjU0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2119, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'swimming pool', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 08:24:14', '2023-08-08 14:48:21'),
(7, 'short', NULL, '47931574', 'Luxury 4-bedroom duplex | Ologolo, lekki (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1516', 2, 90000.00, 108000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'All ensuite\r\nBoard games\r\nBlender\r\nDaily housekeeping\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nClose to a beach\r\n\r\nYes Bluetooth is available\r\nYes we allow one night booking (same rate)\r\nWe don\'t allow photoshoot\r\nyes we allow smoking December daily rate is 100k\r\nlate check out rate (10k per hr)\r\nEarly check in is free provided apartment is free\r\n\r\ninverters carry 6 a/ c\r\n\r\n90k payout for normal season\r\nmonthly discounted price is 2,325,000 (subject to change in seasons)', '<p>This stunning apartment in Ologolo lekki has 4 bedrooms and has capacity for 8 people. An apartment with a contemporary style is completely manned and magnificently equipped with High End Furniture&rsquo;s which includes a king and queen size bed in the room, durable wardrobes, well finished bedside lockers, beautifully crafted kitchen cabinets e.tc. This property is well organized from living room to all rooms in the property and properly air-conditioned whose 24/7 electricity is supported by inverter. In this home you enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, which includes a blender, microwave, toaster, oven alongside other relevant kitchenware&rsquo;. An open floor layout keeps the space feeling light and airy. This home provides a one-of-a-kind opportunity to enjoy a wonderful holiday while taking in the most breathtaking scenery and natural beauty that nature has to offer.<br />\r\nOther amenities are Water heater in the bathroom,<br />\r\nEnsuite rooms,<br />\r\nSmart TVs in each room and living room,<br />\r\nNetflix, and Wifi connection.<br />\r\nBalcony.<br />\r\nThis is the ideal place to visit for a vacation</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC42NDgxMTcwMCAxNjgzMTAyODA4-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2115, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 08:33:28', '2023-09-06 11:19:25'),
(8, 'short', NULL, '08624674', 'Luxurious 4-bedroom duplex with swimming pool, snooker and pool table | Ologolo, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1581', 2, 130000.00, 156000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'No Parties but I can allow get-together with limit capacity, No DJ, BBQ Grilling Machine. I’ve got in-built speakers in the house. Please see rates for get together.\r\nMaximum of 12 people for the 4 bed. (#260,000) your 20% commission is included\r\n\r\nConvertible snooker board and table tennis available. YouTube, PS 5, Pool Table, Table Tennis, Air Hockey Table\r\nwater heater, blender\r\nnetflix\r\n\r\nSmoking not allowed\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate:\r\n4 bed early check in for regular stay - 10k per hour\r\nLate check out rate\r\n\r\nMy regular stay rate for the 4 bed is - 120, 000 payout only (Minimum of 2 days) (17/0ct/2022); caution fee is 100k; I’ll be offering 5K discount to that price for any long stay request.	\r\n4 bed late checkout for regular stay -10k per hour\r\n\r\nShare your peak period i.e December daily Rate for your apartment\r\nPeak Period - December 1st - January 8th.\r\nDecember Rate for 4 bed - 150,000 (payout only)-minimum of 1 week booking\r\n\r\nI’m not taking one day booking anymore; minimum of two days\r\n\r\n4 bed photo shoot is 216k payout; Maximum of 12 people\r\n\r\nVideo/Movie shoot Price\r\n\r\n4 bed (20 Guests Max) - 243K payout\r\n\r\n4 bed (30 Guests Max) - 288k payout\r\n\r\n24 hours electricity\r\n\r\nMy regular stay rate for the 4 bed is - 130, 000 payout only (Minimum of 2 days) (11/8/2023); caution fee is 100k;', '<p>This acre of unadulterated luxury is in Ologolo, along Lekki axis. A beautifully decorated residence, the palace features a big living space with four bedrooms each with its own bathroom for lots of privacy, and a bathtub in the master bedroom to allow you to soak in and enjoy your bath. There is also a separate guest toilet. It also has a balcony for sightseeing, high-speed Internet, Smart TVs in each room and the living room that give high-definition movie images, and a fully furnished kitchen with a toaster, microwave, electric kettle, cutlery, and table wares, to name a few amenities. Iron in a large closet and washing machine. 24/7electricity. This is superb and your best choice<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLuxury Home Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Swimming Pool<br />\r\n*Smart Home<br />\r\n*Automated Windows<br />\r\n*Automated Doors<br />\r\n*PS5<br />\r\n*Pool Table<br />\r\n*Ping Pong / Table Tennis<br />\r\n*Air Hockey Table<br />\r\n*24/7 Power<br />\r\n*24/7 Private Security<br />\r\n*24/7 Estate Security<br />\r\n*Smart TV in all rooms<br />\r\n*Free Internet<br />\r\n*AC<br />\r\n*Compact Plus DSTV<br />\r\n*Netflix<br />\r\n*Youtube<br />\r\n*Fully Fitted Kitchen with Utensils.<br />\r\n*Family Lounge Area<br />\r\n*Clean Water<br />\r\n*Central Water Heating System<br />\r\n*Separate Laundry Room with Washing Machine and Dryer<br />\r\n*Housekeeping<br />\r\n*All rooms en-suite<br />\r\n*In-Built Speakers with Bluetooth &amp; USB Ports.<br />\r\n*Balcony<br />\r\n*No Smoking<br />\r\n*Photo/Video Shoot Allowed based on review.<br />\r\n*Luxury Furnishing &amp; Lightings<br />\r\n*Luxury Dicon Optimum Orthopedic Mattresses.<br />\r\n*Walk-In Closet<br />\r\n*Automated Gate<br />\r\n*Ample Parking Space</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', NULL, 'House 20 close 2, Whitesand Beach Estate, Ologolo Lekki, , Ologolo, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4625958', '3.5449401', 'MAY2023/MC42OTIwODQwMCAxNjgzMTA0NTE3-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2110, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 09:01:57', '2023-08-11 09:03:37'),
