(18, 'short', NULL, '56435022', 'Lovely 2-Bedroom Apartment | Milverton Estate,Osapa London Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1524', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'December rate for 2 bedroom is 60,000\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate: 3-6 hours before checkin in time 20k\r\n\r\nLate check out rate: 20k up to 5hours after check out ( please note this can only work if theres no scheduled check in )\r\n\r\nNo In built speakers available with bluetooth\r\n\r\nAllows Smoking or Just Shisha only. Smoking is allowed\r\n\r\none night booking @ 60k per night\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot is allowed @ 80k for shoot and has to be done inside the apartment not outside\r\n\r\nNormal season daily payout is 60k', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, 2 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the independent kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Milverton estate, osapa london, lekki, , Osapa London, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4433818', '3.5080419', 'MAY2023/MC43Mjc3MjgwMCAxNjgzMTEzMTY4-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2088, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 11:26:08', '2023-07-10 15:56:32'),
(19, 'short', NULL, '13616797', 'Lovely 3-Bedroom apartment | Langbasa_Ajah', 'House', NULL, '1577', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'HOUSEKEEPING EVERY 2 DAYS\r\n\r\n24 hrs check in and electricity\r\n\r\nEarly check in : 12 noon (no fee if there is no guest; kindly reach out to host)\r\n\r\nLate check out: 2pm (no fee if there is no guest; kindly reach out to host)\r\n\r\nDecember daily rate: 85,000 per night (payout)\r\n\r\nNo smoking please.\r\n\r\nNo in built speaker\r\n\r\nYes, photo shoot is allowed but 150,000\r\n\r\n60k payout rate', '<p>This modern walk-in 3-bedroom apartment features a properly equipped kitchen with main appliances such as a blender, juicer, coffee pot, microwave, oven, and toaster. There is a washing machine and a water heater in the apartment. The accommodation has electricity 24 hours a day, 7 days a week and the check-in process is completely stress-free. Wifi and netflix is available. There is a washing machine and iron to ease out laundry. This is a pleasant place to stay.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>HOUSEKEEPING EVERY 2 DAYS<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Eshinlokun street, Harmony Estate, Langbasa Ajah, , Ajah,