(20, 'short', NULL, '93815382', 'Cute 5-bedroom duplex with snooker | Osapa London, Lekki', 'House', NULL, '1467', 2, 130000.00, 156000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Snooker board 24/7 electricity supply netflix blender\r\nwater heater pets are allowed WiFi is issued based on guest stay duration\r\n\r\nDaily housekeeping\r\n\r\nKindly state the following.\r\nEarly check in rate:10k per booking\r\n\r\nLate check out rate:10k per booking\r\n\r\nDecember daily Rate for your apartment:#140,000\r\n\r\none night booking at same daily rate given\r\n\r\nAllows Smoking and Shisha only: smoking allowed\r\n\r\nIn built speakers are available\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot @ 140,000\r\n\r\n130k payout Party rate is #250,000, caution fee(#200, 000)with other terms; not more than 50 persons for the party, sleep over after the party not more than 20 persons.\r\n\r\nMonthly booking payout is 115k/night', '<p>This Beautiful 5-Bedroom duplex apartment located in Osapa London is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 24/7 check in by host. The gorgeous apartment features a beautifully organized living room, fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, Oven, Boiling kettle, Tableware &amp; Cutleries, Freezer and refrigerator. After a long day of exploring, each room provides exceptionally comfortable king size bed each. If serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home. Apartment is pets friendly and allows parties<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nSmart TVs (5 in total; 1 in each living rooms)<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nNetflix subscription<br />\r\nHigh speed Wifi<br />\r\nSnooker board</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Daily housekeeping<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'Yes', 'No', NULL, 'No 32b Alhaji mudashiru eletu way, cannal west residence, Osapa London Lekki, , Osapa London, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4440982', '3.5089294', 'MAY2023/MC44NTYyMTIwMCAxNjgzMTEzODE5-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2080, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 11:36:59', '2023-09-06 12:42:21'),
