a London, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4433818', '3.5080419', 'MAY2023/MC44MTM5NjEwMCAxNjgzMTE1ODMw-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2043, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'It is a  smart home and has wine bar', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:30', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 12:10:30', '2023-07-03 10:31:03'),
(26, 'short', NULL, '20279874', 'Beautiful 2-Bedroom Apartment | George Adiele Crescent, Ajah', 'Apartment', NULL, '1526', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'The apartment as fan incase guest wants it\r\n\r\n24/7 electricity supply supported with generator\r\n\r\ncleaning is done every 3 days\r\n\r\nNo Pets allowed\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate: Free if it is available\r\n\r\nLate check out rate: Free if it is available\r\n\r\nDecember daily rate@ NGN50,000\r\n\r\none night booking is allowed at same daily rate\r\n\r\nNo Smoking or Shisha allowed\r\n\r\nNo In-built speakers available\r\npayout rate is 45k;', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe property is located 4 m from WhiteHorse Beach Resort sand beach, 4 km from Barracuda Beach Resort sand beach, 4 km from Atican Beach Resort sand beach.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), balcony, air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, mosquito nets throughout the accommodation, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, freezer, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>cleaning is done every 3 days<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festiv