(38, 'short', NULL, '92623591', 'Exquisite 3-bedroom apartment | VGC Extension', 'Apartment', NULL, '1174', 2, 81000.00, 97200.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '81K PAYOUT\r\n\r\n1. Once you get to the traffic light for VGC, make a U-turn.\r\n2. Hayden fuel station would be on your right hand side.\r\n3. Take the immediate right after the Hayden gas station (you’ll see a redeem church of God sign board)\r\n4. Follow the road into that turn into the gate (there’s a bit of construction)\r\n5. Keep driving straight down and take the first turn on your right (you\'ll see an estate gate),\r\n\r\n6. Take the immediate left beside that estate into Adekunle Idowu close)\r\n7. Follow the bend to the end of the road, you’ll see an estate with white buildings on your right .. after some buildings under construction.\r\nThat is the estate.', '<p>The apartment in Lekki has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, bath tub, open-air parking the same building, 1 fan, 4 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the independent kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', NULL, NULL, 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'House 20, Kidscourt 19 estate ADEKUNLE IDowu close, Off Harris drive before Lekki VGC Extension . La, , Victoria garden city, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4660322', '3.5445844', 'MAY2023/MC42MDQwOTAwMCAxNjgzMTI0ODU0-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1848, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 14:40:54', '2023-05-30 05:33:52'),
(39, 'short', NULL, '32733156', 'Luxuriously-styled 2-Bedroom Smart Home| VGC Estate', 'Apartment', NULL, '1570', 2, 95000.00, 114000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 Electricity\r\nNetflix\r\nGreen area for outdoor relaxation\r\n\r\nNo parties\r\n\r\n\"Smart house with Alexa\r\nSpeakers available\r\n\r\nEarly Check in rate: 5k extra per hour\r\n\r\nLate Check out rate: 5k extra per hour\r\n\r\nPeak period: 100k payout\r\n\r\nNo smoking indoors(shisha included),only at the outdoor green area is smoking allowed.\r\n\r\nNo Photoshoot\r\n\r\nOne night booking not allowed\r\n\r\nNormal season daily payout; 95k; (4/8/23)', '<p>This Adorable 2-Bedroom apartment in VGC Estate is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 4 guests and is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a green area for outdoor relaxation, beautifully organized living room with Luxury decors and fittings and a touch of sophisticated lightings, Automated Chairs with fridge and speakers, Ring doorbell with camera, Automated windows, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, blender, toaster, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. Apartment is rooms-ensuite with home having 2 bath and a visitor toilet for convenience. In this home, rooms are furnished with a comfortable king size bed each, all white beddings, and plush duvets to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. All rooms are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment<br />\r\nMulti-level security system<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nDaily housekeeping<br />\r\nCar Rental service<br />\r\nPlay area for kids</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC40MjM1NTgwMCAxNjgzMTI1NjQ2-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'It is a smart home with Alexa and has green area for outdoor relaxation', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 14:54:06', '2023-08-04 12:09:16'),
(40, 'short', NULL, '51597423', 'Standard 1-Bedroom Apartment | Onikoyi road, Aguda Surulere (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1374', 2, 40000.00, 48000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supported with both generator and inverter\r\n\r\n40k payout\r\nPayout rate for December is 45k', '<p>This apartment in Lagos has 1 bedrooms and has capacity for 3 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, garage the same building, TV, tv satellite.<br />\r\nFitted kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine, 24/7 electricity supply supported with inverter and generator, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5243793', '3.3792057', 'MAY2023/MC4zMjA1MjQwMCAxNjgzMTI1NzQx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2967, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 14:55:41', '2023-07-03 11:45:00'),
(41, 'short', NULL, '73205557', 'Adorable 1_Bed Apartment with a Gym | Victoria Island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1549', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'WATER HEATER\r\nblender,netflix\r\n\r\nNo parties\r\nNo smoking\r\n\r\nDecember rate: 70k\r\nPhotoshoot - 80k for half day, 100k for full day\r\nOne night booking-( for weekend) 70k, (week day)-65k\r\nWe have a sound bar\r\nAnd electricity is 24)7, no use of inverter\r\n\r\n65k payout;', '<p>Luxurious 1-Bed room apartment situated in Victoria Island with maximum guest occupancy of 2. If beautiful interiors are your cravings, then look no further as cravings are met, this elegant home is creatively styled to taste with modern amenities; like a gym which brings aerobic exercise right to your doorstep with ease to help boost cardiovascular system and stay healthy. Another is a relaxing balcony, Well-organized artworks that adds elegance to the living room, fully equipped kitchen to satisfy all cravings. This modern apartment is the perfect place for you.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Iconic Towers Flat 1 East Wing, No 1 Adebisi Omotola close behind zenith bank HQ, , Victoria island, Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4291841', '3.4347012', 'MAY2023/MC4wMjcyNDQwMCAxNjgzMTI2NTY3-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oEU1d_j5Eug', 'Reserve', 1696, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 15:09:27', '2023-07-19 13:55:21'),
(42, 'short', NULL, '62944761', 'Admirable 3-bedroom self compound with balcony | Ajah (Inverter)', 'House', NULL, '1375', 2, 80000.00, 96000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Has water heater\r\nHas blender\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter\r\ncleaning schedule: every other day\r\nAccess to netflix\r\nNo parties\r\n\r\ncharge additional fees for early check in/ late check out at 5000/hr\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot allowed @ #30000\r\nNo dj allowed\r\nElectricity is supported by inverter ; 20hrs electricity 4 hrs inverter\r\nAllows Smoking only outdoor smoking, indoor smoking attracts #20000 caution fees\r\nAllow one night booking at same daily rate\r\n\r\nDecember rate is 90k\r\n\r\nnormal PAYOUT @ 80000/night', '<p>You won&#39;t want to miss out on this adorable3-bedroom self-compound in Ajah. This home has a tastefully decorated living room and a fully furnished kitchen with all the necessities, including a microwave, oven, freezer, and refrigerator to give it a homey feel and make cooking simple. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite (Bath shower in all room and a bathtub in the master bedroom) with home having an additional guest toilet available to ensure privacy is not compromised. King-size beds are available in all the rooms that is incredibly comfy. Living room and some bedrooms are furnished with Tvs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided, if serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n20hrs electricity 4 hrs inverter<br />\r\nWater heater,<br />\r\nDSTV subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nSmart TVs in each rooms<br />\r\nNo parties allowed<br />\r\nWashing machine and iron is provided for ease of laundry<br />\r\ncleaning schedule: every day<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nGuest has access to the estate pool</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 10 road 4 Lekki gardens estate phase 1 sangotedo by DKK supermarket Ajah ., , Ajah, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4746261', '3.617533399999999', 'MAY2023/MC45NzE4NTEwMCAxNjgzMTI3NDgx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1905, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 15:24:41', '2023-07-03 11:58:37');
