(43, 'short', NULL, '53262570', 'Fancy 2-bedroom with an open-style kitchen & a balcony | ilasan Lekki (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1437', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'All rooms ensuite\r\nWater heater available\r\n\r\nKitchen has blender\r\nHousekeeping: every other day\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nNo parties , No smoking\r\nMinimum of 2 days booking\r\n\r\n75k per night', '<p>This Adorable 2-Bedroom apartment in Ilasan, Lekki is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 4 guests and is in a private and safe space. The cottage features a beautifully organized living room, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, blender, boiling kettle, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. After a long day of exploring, Room is ensuite with home having bath showers available. In the room is an exceptionally comfortable king size bed each to ensure pleasant rest. Living room and bedroom are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWi-Fi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter- fan is used when inverter is on<br />\r\nOpen style kitchen<br />\r\nCleaning is every day<br />\r\nMinimum of 2 days booking</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'Yes', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC4xMjI4ODEwMCAxNjgzMTI4MjU1-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1879, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 15:37:35', '2023-07-04 19:07:01'),
