(46, 'short', NULL, '56398159', 'Luxury 4-bedroom apartment | Maitama Abuja', 'House', NULL, '1591', 2, 120000.00, 144000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Contact +234 803 085 1866, the facility manager\r\n\r\nOne night booking is at same rate as daily rate given\r\n\r\nWith a caution fee of 100,000\r\n\r\nNo early check in rate but we pay full rate for late checkout\r\n\r\nSame rate for peak period;\r\n\r\nNo smoking of any kind except the guest stay outdoor within the compound as we have a sit out spot.\r\n\r\nWe don\'t allow DJ and if there will be music it has to be low as the apartment is in a residential area. We don\'t have speaker except from TV\r\n\r\nNormal season daily Rate is 120k payout', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Abuja</strong>&nbsp;has 4 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: garden furniture, fenced garden, barbecue, mini bar, iron, internet (Wi-Fi), central heating, air conditioning throughout the house, garage and car park the same building, 6 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English), radio.<br />\r\nIn the gas independent kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils, toaster and kettle are provided.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of bookin