(48, 'short', NULL, '91955359', 'Adorable 4-bedroom PARTY home | Victoria Garden City', 'Apartment', NULL, '1425', 2, 350000.00, 420000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', '4bedroom house-VGC-sweet home it\'s duplex in an estate, access card is given to the guest with 4 access code daily, Contact person is Elebute\r\n(08028984587) minimum guest 8 at a tile, 1 day booking is allowed at initial rate, for any party is 350k, and music must stop by 8:30pm for 3.7,10 days upward 10% is given. Cleaning is done 3 times weekly, 24/7 electricity, smoking not allowed in the house.\r\nMaximum guests is 30\r\n\r\nPayout rate for December is 150k', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>house in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 4 bedrooms and has capacity for 8 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: garden, garden furniture, iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, 5 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, freezer, washing machine, dishes/cutlery and kitchen utensils are provided.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cleaning is done 3 times weekly</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Close 44 House H91 Victoria Garden City, , Victoria garden city, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4647273', '3.5471241', 'MAY2023/MC40NzgwMTEwMCAxNjgzMTA4MTMw-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 30, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1961, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 16:07:48', '2023-07-04 12:19:16'),
(49, 'short', NULL, '88025668', 'Lovely 2-bedroom | Chevron, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1417', 2, 65000.00, 78000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Has water heater\r\nHas blender\r\n24/7 electricity\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nNo we don\'t charge for check in but if check out is delayed for more than two hours it will attract the money for the whole day.\r\n\r\nSame goes for December this can be reviewed considering change in prices of things like fuel etc. And will be duely communicated.\r\n\r\nNo photo shoot but there can be exceptions and it will attract additional charges if allowed.\r\n\r\n24hours electricity and standby generator.\r\nNo parties; No DJ allowed\r\nOnly Shisha is allowed that doesn\'t attract extra charges.......smoking can be outdoor in the compound to avoid casualties\r\n\r\n65,000 normal payout', '<p>This homely 2-bedroom apartment is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Chevron, lekki. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features two bedrooms, with two king size bed each, fully equipped kitchen, two bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 4 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRooms are ensuite; Apartment has a water heater.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHousekeeping schedule ; every three days,<br />\r\nNo parties allowed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nit&rsquo;s 24 hours electricity guaranteed.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '1f Madens flat off northern foreshore estate Chevron Lekki, , Chevron, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4604419', '3.530303', 'MAY2023/MC43NjgyMzUwMCAxNjgzMTMyNTAy-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1968, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-03 16:48:22', '2023-07-04 08:41:54'),
(50, 'short', NULL, '10528379', 'Classic 4-Bedroom PARTY house with private swimming pool | Ajah (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1505', 2, 200000.00, 240000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'No ironing board\r\n24/7/ check in and electricity but supported by inverter\r\nMax party guest number is 20\r\n\r\nDecember rate is same\r\n\r\nPayout rate for regular stay is 108k Payout rate for party for host is 200k guest rate for party is 250k party rate +100k caution', '<p>This modern walk-in duplex that supports parties and mini events (max of 20 guests for events) features a swimming pool and a properly equipped kitchen with main appliances such as a blender, microwave, oven, and toaster. There is a washing machine and a water heater in the apartment. The accommodation has electricity 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, but it is backed by an inverter, and the check-in process is completely stress-free. Wifi is available. There is a paid cab attached to the property. This is a pleasant place to stay.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 18 kolawole Adekunle street (ivy court 1) lekki palm city addo road Ajah, , Ajah, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.474665', '3.5649559', 'MAY2023/M