(51, 'short', NULL, '76680274', 'Dazzling 4-bedroom apartment with Swimming pool, snooker board and PS5 | Salem bus stop. Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1614', 2, 100000.00, 120000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'All rooms ensuite\r\n\r\nVideo games, Snooker, PS5, Lounge area\r\nApartment has a blender\r\n\r\nCleans every other day\r\nNetflix,\r\n\r\nMinimum of 2 days\r\nNo smoking\r\n\r\nInverter is just for change over prior till they turn the standby generator. The generator is available immediately light goes off\r\n\r\n4bed is 100k\r\n3 bed is 90k\r\n2 bed is 80k\r\n\r\nnote:Photoshoot is no longer allowed\r\n100k payout -- parties no longer allowed in this apartment (16/5/2023)', '<p>This is a well-organized 4-bedroom duplex in Salem road. This home has a tastefully decorated living room and a fully furnished kitchen with all the necessities, including a microwave, blender, oven, freezer, and refrigerator to give it a homey feel and make cooking simple. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite (Bath shower in all room and a bathtub in the master bedroom) with home having an additional guest toilet available to ensure privacy is not compromised. 4 King-size beds are available in the duplex home. Living room, and all bedrooms are furnished with TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided, if serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nDSTV subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nSmart TVs available<br />\r\nWashing machine and iron is provided for ease of laundry<br />\r\ncleaning schedule: every day<br />\r\nVideo games, Snooker, PS5, Lounge area</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of