of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Horizon height, bede alugubge street off palm spring road Salem bus stop Lekki, 23401, Salem, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC41OTIwNTAwMCAxNjgzMTkwMjg2-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1768, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Children play area', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 08:51:26', '2023-07-04 11:49:43'),
