(58, 'short', NULL, '95645585', 'Stylish 4-bedroom duplex | Thomas estate Ajah', 'House', NULL, '1569', 2, 90000.00, 108000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Water heater\r\nblender, netflix\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\nNo parties with DJ\r\n\r\nno price for early check in but late check out price; 10k per hr for the first five hours\r\nCheck in time is 10am check out time is 12pm\r\n\r\n\r\nPeak period rate #110,000\r\n\r\nOne night booking is allowed to check out 12pm\r\n\r\nIn built speakers available\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot rate : #130,000\r\n\r\n24/7 electricity\r\n90k payout (16/1/23)\r\n\r\nHost said accommodation is currently unavailable', '<p>Adorable 4-self compound with maximum guest size of 8 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, a fully equipped kitchen well equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, Oven, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, room is well furnished with a comfortable king size bed with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nSmart TVs<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nOutdoor furniture</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 7b Dr Gabriel ivbjaro close, victory estate, Thomas estate Ajah, , Ajah, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.478915', '3.5731015', 'MAY2023/MC42NTIzNDQwMCAxNjgzMTkxMzA0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1700, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2023-05-04 09:08:24', '2023-08-01 17:11:25'),
