(64, 'short', NULL, '21391238', 'Charming 1-bedroom apartment with gym | Ilasan, Lekki (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1635', 2, 40000.00, 48000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment is ensuite\r\nHas water heater\r\n\r\nThe building has a snooker board and it\'s access it not solely for the host.\r\nCleaning schedule; Everyday\r\n\r\nit is 24 hours light. There is electricity, then generator runs for 10 hours a day if there is no electricity, then supported by inverter in between hours.\r\nOnly living room has smart TV\r\n\r\nNo dj and no parties\r\nNo smoking\r\nAllows one day booking\r\n\r\nAdditional 10k for early check in and late check out\r\n\r\nDecember rate is extra 15k\r\nPhotoshoot, no crowd. Extra 20k\r\nOne day booking extra 5k\r\n\r\n50k payout; Currently on a promo for 35k throughout May 2023.', '<p>This homely 1-bedroom apartment is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Ilasan, lekki. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. This home area features one bedroom with king size bed that is super comfy, fully equipped kitchen, bathroom is ensuite with an additional guest toilet. The location is great for a maximum of 3 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and a normal TV in the bedroom, WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRooms are ensuite; Apartment has a water heater.<br />\r\nHousekeeping schedule ; every day,<br />\r\nNo parties allowed.<br />\r\nit&rsquo;s 24 hours electricity guaranteed with inverter; There is electricity, then generator runs for 10 hours a day if there is no electricity, then supported by inverter in between hours.<br />\r\nThe building has a snooker board and it&#39;s access it not solely for the host.<br />\r\nNo smoking<br />\r\nAllows one day booking<br />\r\nDSTV<br />\r\nKitchen has a blender</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 19 Ayo Adeleye drive, ilasan salem bus stop Lekki, , Salem, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.429911700000001', '3.4998099', 'MAY2023/MC4yMjg3MTAwMCAxNjgzMTk0Mjgy-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gXkHGHJODhU', 'Reserve', 483, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 09:58:02', '2023-07-17 13:25:42'),
(65, 'short', NULL, '12527535', 'Executive 3-Bedroom Home with PS5 | Banana Island, Ikoyi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1317', 2, 150000.00, 180000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'Peak periods\r\n3 Bed N170,000( november)\r\n3 Bed N250,000 (December\r\n3 bed N220000 (January)\r\n3 Bed N180,000(February)\r\n\r\nEarly Check in November to February N10,000 3hrs (11am - 2pm) extra is N5,000\r\nLate check Out N10,000 3hrs (12 - 3) extra is N5,000\r\n\r\nI will not be accepting one day booking in December Minimum is 3 days\r\nCaution fee is 100k\r\n\r\nBanana is 165k so please if anyone needs a 3 bed in ikoyi this is the first to send to them if more than 3 days I can do 150k\r\n\r\nCurrently on Promo for 150k 3/4/2023)\r\n\r\nMonthly rates- N20,000 off 3bed', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>house in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 8 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, covered parking the same building, 2 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the gas independent kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, freezer, washing machine, dryer, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', NULL, 'E25A, 322 CLOSE, 3RD AVENUE, BANANA ISLAND, IKOYI,, , Banana Island, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4639041', '3.4578755', 'MAY2023/MC45MTIxNTcwMCAxNjgzMTk0NDQ5-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book_now', 1117, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 10:00:49', '2023-09-05 17:28:26'),
(66, 'short', NULL, '01434809', 'Colourful 1- bedroom apartment with swimming pool and openstyle kitchen | Salem lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1448', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Open style kitchen\r\nAll room ensuite\r\n\r\nHas water heater\r\nHas blender\r\nCleaning is done- every other day\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nyes, Only living room has smart TV\r\nNO DJ\r\nNO SMOKING\r\nONE DAY BOOKING ALLOWED\r\n\r\nGym would be functional at the end of the month\r\nFor monthly request we can sell 40k per day\r\n\r\n45k payout', '<p>Lovely minimalist of your dreams is ready to welcome new guests. This one-bedroom apartment is in Salem lekki with a maximum guest capacity of two. This elegant home is tastefully decorated and equipped living room, and a fully kitted kitchen to satisfy all cravings. Bedroom is ensuite, Wi-Fi access and Netflix available are just a few of the amenities available. This contemporary apartment is ideal for you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOpen style kitchen<br />\r\nCleaning is done- every other day<br />\r\nliving room has smart TV<br />\r\nNO DJ<br />\r\nNO SMOKING<br />\r\nONE DAY BOOKING ALLOWED</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Mijl residence and villa salem bus stop Lekki, , Salem, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4352302', '3.4985608', 'MAY2023/MC4zNzEyOTEwMCAxNjgzMTk1NTQ1-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1001, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 10:19:05', '2023-07-05 10:37:08'),
(67, 'short', NULL, '44425853', 'Enticing 1-bedroom apartment without kitchen | Wuse 2', 'Apartment', NULL, '1591', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Contact +234 803 085 1866 this is the property facility manager\r\n\r\nwater heater\r\n\r\nNotify Guest it is a studio apartment without Kitchen\r\n\r\nThere is a laundry service available\r\nAllows One day booking\r\n24/7 check in and electricity\r\nnetflix\r\n\r\nOne night booking is at same rate as daily rate given (60K)\r\n\r\nNo early check in rate but we pay full rate for late checkout\r\n\r\nFor peak periods we maintain same rates\r\n\r\nSmoking or Shisha is not allowed\r\n\r\nwe don\'t allow DJ or loud music as it\'s a residential area\r\n\r\n60k payout', '<p>Our beautiful 1-bedroom private apartment in Wuse do not have kitchen but has the following features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&bull; High Profile &amp; Secure Neighborhood (a healthy concentration of embassies and diplomatic residencies).<br />\r\n&bull; Strategically located in the city centers for easy commute to engagements.<br />\r\n&bull; Room en-suite.<br />\r\n&bull; 24/7 electricity<br />\r\n&bull; Pets are allowed<br />\r\n&bull; Daily housekeeping<br />\r\n&bull; Apartment is equipped with Smart TV&#39;s and modern fittings.<br />\r\n&bull; Fast free Wi-Fi<br />\r\n&bull; Laundry Services (On Request)<br />\r\n&bull; Car Hire (On Request).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs an additional way of making your experience seamless, we are offering our value-add concierge services which include flight travel agent services, client reminder systems to ensure you are updated on scheduled flights, airport pickups and inter-city logistics, to make sure that your stay is stress-free.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0764785', '7.398574', 'MAY2023/MC43ODk0MjAwMCAxNjgzMTk2MzY1-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2901, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Laundry service available at a cost', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 10:23:52', '2023-07-11 17:56:29'),
(68, 'short', NULL, '94986449', 'Breathtaking 3-Bedroom duplex | Maryland, Ikeja (inverter)', 'House', NULL, '1428', 2, 80000.00, 96000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'water heater , blender\r\nnetflix\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\nNo parties dj not allowed\r\n\r\npayout Rate in December 110,000 daily,\r\n\r\nEarly check-in attract extra 20,000 of about 2 to 3 hours\r\nLate check-out 20,000 of about 2 to 3 hours\r\n\r\nDJ is not allowed with or without equipment, the environment is serene and quiet and fully residential.\r\n\r\nOne night booking is allowed at the same rate.\r\n\r\nThere is no built-in speakers\r\n\r\nYes 24 hours, electricity, generator is on standby, inverter also available as stopgap. Ac doesn\'t work with inverter, inverter is to sustain light ,TV and fan before generator comes up\r\n\r\npayout rate 80,000 daily,', '<p>An opportunity to live in a magnificent 3-bedroom flat on the ground floor of a building in Maryland, Ikeja. You enter a beautifully erected structure with creative decorations in a tranquil setting. A tastefully decorated living area. Each room has a Smart TV with great graphics and a very spacious bedroom with queen size beds that makes you feel at home. This apartment includes a fully equipped kitchen, 24/7 electricity, and Wifi access</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 15 Layi Ogunbambi close off Maryland crescent, Maryland, , Maryland, Ikeja, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5767915', '3.3664627', 'MAY2023/MC4xMTcwMjMwMCAxNjgzMTk2NDcy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2903, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'wifi', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 10:34:32', '2023-08-09 10:56:31'),
(69, 'short', NULL, '02489503', 'Beautiful 3-bedroom apartment | salem bus stop, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1468', 2, 95000.00, 114000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'All ensuite\r\nApartment has a snooker\r\n\r\nHas water heater\r\nCleaning schedule; every 3 days\r\nHave Netflix\r\n\r\nExtra 10,000 for early checkin\r\n\r\nDo you allow Photoshoot? If yes, what is your rate? Yes 180,000\r\n\r\nDo you allow DJ with all equipment? Yes 200,000 party\r\n\r\n24/7 light\r\n\r\nI accept party maximum 20 guests\r\n\r\nSmoking is only allowed in the outdoor area or balcony\r\n\r\n1 night booking additional 5000\r\n.\r\nLate check in additional 5000\r\n\r\n120k for december rate\r\n\r\nnormal PAYOUT without our commission is 95,000', '<p>We each need a place to call home and for comfort, we need a place of safety for good health and for this life to really be good - a heaven rather than a hell. This homely 3-bedroom is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Salem, Lekki. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, all ensuite. Apartment has a fully equipped kitchen and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people. Other features include Netflix with 4 smart TVs in the apartment. Washing machine and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\nBlender is provided<br />\r\nCleaning schedule; every 3 days<br />\r\nSnooker board<br />\r\nHas water heater<br />\r\nHave Netflix<br />\r\n24/7 light<br />\r\nSmoking is only allowed in the outdoor area or balcony</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Block D unit 5, Mijl Residential villa salem bus stop Lekki, , Salem, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4352302', '3.4985608', 'MAY2023/MC4zODUwMTIwMCAxNjgzMTk3MjEy-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1791, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '15:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 10:46:52', '2023-07-05 12:55:11'),
(70, 'short', NULL, '97103481', 'Majestic 3-bedroom Duplex | Ajah Lagos (inverter)', 'House', NULL, '1333', 2, 65000.00, 78000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 check in\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter\r\nParty (max 10 guest)\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate ; Same as Standard Rate  (65k) per night\r\n\r\nLate check out rate ; Same as Standard Rate  (65k) per night\r\n\r\nShare your peak period i.e December daily Rate for your apartment ( Same as Standard Rate (65k) per night\r\n\r\nYes One Night Booking is allowed at Standard Price Rate (65k) per night .\r\n\r\n\r\nNo Smoking allowed ,only Shisha .\r\n\r\nIn built speakers available with bluetooth\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot is allowed ; For only Photoshoot without spending the night, that\'s 40,000.\r\n\r\n65k for daily rate (110k Party payout)', '<p>This comfortable 3-bedroom Duplex in Ajah is an intimately designed home with a maximum occupancy of 5. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with stunning architecture; comfy staircase for walk-in to the gorgeous interior design, subtle colored flowing curtains, a gym for cardiovascular training, a refreshing pool, comfortable mattresses with soft natural linens regularly changed, and a flawless organization throughout! It has fiber optic internet wifi with 24-hour electricity supported by inverter, children&#39;s play area, a BBQ site for food grilling, a balcony for ample light and relaxation, fully equipped kitchen with microwave, blender and oven, and a washing machine to help with laundry. Bedrooms are well furnished with water heater, toiletries- tissue paper, hand soap are generously provided. Housekeeping is done regularly. The parking space is covered, and the automobiles are parked properly. Netflix is an option readily available. Apartment also has air hockey, snooker board and table tennis board. Experience would be of advantage. Try it.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5243793', '3.3792057', 'MAY2023/MC4wNDQ4ODkwMCAxNjgzMTk3NDg2-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 957, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Children play area', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 10:51:26', '2023-07-31 09:00:40'),
