mount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki Gardens phase 3, s18 unit 1 road 1e behind Lagos business school. Ajah, , Ajah, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.464587400000001', '3.5725244', 'MAY2023/MC4xMzEzOTAwMCAxNjgzMTk4ODc5-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7hzZXxJRH4g', 'Reserve', 1293, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 11:14:39', '2023-08-30 14:20:39'),
(73, 'short', NULL, '38295214', 'Gorgeous 3-Bedroom apartment | Lifecamp, FCT(Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1562', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Heater\r\n24/7 CHECK IN & ELECTRICITY SUPPORTED WITH INVERTER & GENERATOR\r\nNETFLIX\r\nBLENDER\r\n\r\n75K', '<p>The Drave flat is a lovely vacation property located in the beautiful Life Camp neighborhood of Abuja. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, two with king beds and one with a queen bed, as well as a huge living room, fully equipped kitchen, three bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people, and there is also a huge terrace and ample parking space. Check-in is available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, and electricity is provided by an inverter and a generator. Other features include Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, a washer and dryer, and WIFI access. A trial will convince</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0764785', '7.398574', 'MAY2023/MC4yMDIzMjMwMCAxNjgzMTk5ODQ0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1792, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 11:28:07', '2023-07-10 13:01:17'),
(75, 'short', NULL, '05150891', 'Majestic 4-bedroom apartment | Guzape Abuja(Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1554', 2, 120000.00, 144000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supported by inverter\r\n24/7 check in\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate : No fee\r\nLate checkin rate : No fee\r\n\r\nPeak period/ weekends/festive periods(December) is the same as given rate (120k payout)\r\n\r\nOne night booking is same rate as daily rate\r\nSmoking/shisha is not allowed\r\n\r\nIn built speakers is available\r\nPhoto shoot is not allowed.\r\n\r\n120k Payout rate', '<p>This lovely 4-bedroom apartment terrace walk-in is located in Guzape, Abuja, and can accommodate up to 8 people. The check-in hours for this home are 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, with a very welcoming host and a simple check-in process. The rooms in this apartment are enormous. This villa is a unique location with excellent air conditioning and a water heater, as well as guaranteed electricity 24 hours a day supported by inverter. For a good night&#39;s sleep, all of the rooms in this apartment are equipped with king-size beds. The kitchen is well-equipped with a blender, toaster, and even a dish washer, making living simple and stress-free throughout the holidays. There are two living areas in this property, each with a smart TV. This house is equipped with wifi and Netflix, allowing for real-time access to information. Added advantage would be Car hire services on request, in-house chef on request and 24hours house keeping services. The most difficult aspect of your vacation may be packing your luggage to return home after a night at GUZAPE! DON&#39;T MISS OUT ON THIS OPPORTUNITY!</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0764785', '7.398574', 'MAY2023/MC40NDYxNTYwMCAxNjgzMjAxMjAz-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1015, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Children play area', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 11:49:16', '2023-07-10 09:52:33'),
(76, 'short', NULL, '57826943', 'Majestic 4-bedroom apartment | Ikota, Lekki', 'House', NULL, '1370', 2, 90000.00, 108000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Snooker Board\r\nwater heater\r\nblender\r\nnetflix\r\nyes, Only masters bedroom and living room has smart tv..\r\n8guest for regular stay 20 -40 for parties (150k for normal season and 150k for december)\r\nHouse Chef\r\n\r\nPeak period (December) 100,000\r\n\r\nEarly check in 10,000 PER HR\r\nLate check in 10,000 Per hour\r\n\r\nOne night allowed at 120,000\r\nSmoking allowed\r\n\r\nSpeaker 🔊 available with Bluetooth\r\nPhotoshoot @ 100,000\r\n \r\n\r\nNormal payout is 90k', '<p>Adorable 4-Bedroom with maximum guest size of 8 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, a fully equipped kitchen well equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, Oven, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, room is well furnished with a comfortable king size bed with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided. Apartment is pets friendly<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nSmart TVs<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nGarden<br />\r\nOutdoor furniture<br />\r\nSound bar in the living room</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC42NzA0MzUwMCAxNjgzMjAxMTE5-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1697, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'House chef at a cost, Alarm, Children play area', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 11:51:59', '2023-07-03 10:46:05'),
(78, 'short', NULL, '96079135', 'Adorable 2-bedroom apartment with a swimming pool | Jabi Abuja (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1352', 2, 90000.00, 108000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supported by inverter', '<p>This stunning private apartment in Jabi, Abuja has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people. An apartment with a contemporary style is completely manned and magnificently equipped with High End Furniture&rsquo;s which includes king size bed in each room, durable wardrobes, well finished bedside lockers, beautifully crafted kitchen cabinets e.tc. This property is well organized from living room to all rooms in the property and properly air-conditioned whose 24/7 electricity is supported by inverter. In this home you enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, which includes a blender, microwave, toaster, oven alongside other relevant kitchenware&rsquo;. An open floor layout keeps the space feeling light and airy. This home provides a one-of-a-kind opportunity to enjoy a wonderful holiday while taking in the most breathtaking scenery and natural beauty that nature has to offer. Accommodation allows mini events for a maximum of 10 guests. Other amenities are Water heater in the bathroom, ensuite rooms, Swimming pool for relaxation, Play area for kids, Daily housekeeping, Barbecue Area, open-air parking the same building, Smart TVs in each rooms and living room, Netflix, and Wifi connection. This is the ideal place to visit for a vacation.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'C1, No 5 Bello Yusuf Street, Jabi, , Jabi, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0740935', '7.4315595', 'MAY2023/MC4xMTIzODMwMCAxNjgzMjAzNzA5-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1679, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Children play area', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 12:22:55', '2023-06-30 14:59:10'),
(79, 'short', NULL, '46068015', 'Attractive 3-bedroom | Banana island estate', 'Apartment', NULL, '1585', 2, 200000.00, 240000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'Rooms are ensuite\r\nSwimming Pool, Swimming pool available but not functioning at the moment\r\n\r\nHave water heater\r\nKitchen has blender\r\nCleaning is done daily\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\n200k payout rate; From August - sept 2023', '<p>This Attractive 3-Bedroom with maximum guest size of 6 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features luxuriously-styled living room, a fully furnished kitchen that is well-equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, oven, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, each room are well furnished with a comfortable King size bed with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided. Home has guest toilet hence privacy is not compromised.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nSmart TVs<br />\r\nHousekeeping is everyday<br />\r\nSwimming pool- Swimming pool available but not functioning at the moment</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '221 close banana Island estate ikoyi Lagos, , Banana Island, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4535798', '3.4614096', 'MAY2023/MC4zMjM2NDkwMCAxNjgzMjAzMzE0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 647, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 12:28:34', '2023-08-10 16:32:43'),
