mart TVs<br />\r\nBBQ<br />\r\nGarden<br />\r\nChildren playarea<br />\r\nBalcony</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 8c Alade close off Alade street Allen Avenue ikeja, , Allen avenue, Ikeja, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.604011', '3.3485719', 'MAY2023/MC45MDUxNDgwMCAxNjgzMTEwODYw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 30, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1491, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'CHILDREN PLAY AREA', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 12:30:29', '2023-07-07 12:10:41'),
(81, 'short', NULL, '24247362', 'Cozy 4-bedroom apartment with balcony | Ikota, GRA', 'Apartment', NULL, '1519', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Rooms are ensuite\r\n\r\nBalcony, Swimming pool under construction\r\nHas water heater\r\nKitchen has a blender\r\n\r\nCleaning schedule: Twice a week\r\nHas Netflix\r\nAllows smoking\r\n\r\nDes not allow one day booking\r\n\r\nparty; 120,000 of max 20 guests normal payout -75,000', '<p>You don&#39;t want to miss out on this adorable4-bedroom duplex at Ikota. This home has a tastefully decorated living room and a fully furnished kitchen with all the necessities, a Microwave, Blender, Oven, Freezer, and Refrigerator to give it a homey feel and make cooking simple. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite (Bath shower in all room) with home having an additional guest toilet available to ensure privacy is not compromised. 2 King-size beds are available and 2 queen size beds to add up for all the 4 rooms this apartment has. Living room and some bedrooms are furnished with TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided, if serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nDSTV subscription<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nSmart TVs<br />\r\nParties allowed<br />\r\nWashing machine and iron is provided for ease of laundry<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nCleaning schedule: Twice a week<br />\r\nAllows smoking<br />\r\nDoes not allow one day booking</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Ikota, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4325591', '3.4734189', 'MAY2023/MC4zNzg0MzUwMCAxNjgzMjAzNjk3-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2882, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 12:34:57', '2023-07-07 22:19:59'),
(82, 'short', NULL, '08020535', 'Beautiful 2-bedroom apartment with swimming pool and gym | Banana island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1500', 2, 100000.00, 120000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'All rooms are ensuite\r\n\r\nWater heater available\r\nKitchen has blender\r\n\r\nHousekeeping schedule is every 3 days\r\nHas Netflix, YouTube, IPTV Smarter player\r\n\r\nAmenities: 5G WiFi internet connection, smart tvs, Washing machine, Dryer, Olympic-size pool, gym, smoke alarm, fire extinguishers, palatial, exquisite quiet serene & private residence. It’s a palatial home away from home.\r\n\r\nDo not allow 1 day booking\r\n\r\n0ne bedroom - 80k\r\nTwo bedroom- 100k\r\n\r\nN 100,000 payout', '<p>Vacation Home Away From Home. (2 bedroom apartments)<br />\r\nAll en/suite.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis stylish apartment are located in the prestigious and most desirable Banana Island Estate. This island represents a peaceful and tranquil atmosphere and houses the most stunning and urban -exclusive enclaves. The apartment itself is residential, peaceful, palatial, and beautiful!<br />\r\nIt offers you a myriad of amenities. The bedrooms have Smart TVs so guests can access YouTube and Netflix.<br />\r\nVery high speed 5G fibre optic internet connection. The Guest will be staying in the 2 bedroom apartment all by themselves and will have access to every area of the apartment and the indoor Pool and Gym<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note: Cleaning is done every 3 days</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '501 close, 5th Avenue, Banana Island Estate, ikoyi, , Banana Island, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4612575', '3.4593042', 'MAY2023/MC40NTM5MzkwMCAxNjgzMjA0NTUw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1929, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, '5G FIBRE OPTIC INTERNET', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 12:49:10', '2023-07-06 16:06:57');
