otice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 32b Alhaji mudashiru eletu way, cannal west residence, Osapa London Lekki, , Osapa London, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4440982', '3.5089294', 'MAY2023/MC44NTYyMTIwMCAxNjgzMTEzODE5-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 50, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1919, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-04 15:52:29', '2023-09-06 12:42:27'),
(99, 'short', NULL, '98755600', 'Stunning 2-bedroom apartment with PS5 | Orchid, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1441', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'PS5, Has water heater\r\n\r\nThere\'s iron but no ironing board , blender\r\nCleaning schedule- every other day\r\n\r\nHave netflix\r\n\r\nIf we have a month booking we can sell at 2 million\r\nNo smoking\r\n\r\n75k payout', '<p>This comfortable 2-bedroom house in Orchid, Lekki is an intimate walk-in designed home with a maximum occupancy of 4. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with stunning architecture to the gorgeous interior design, comfortable mattresses with soft natural linens, flowing curtains, and a flawless organization throughout! It has 24/7 Wi-Fi with 24-hour electricity guaranteed supported by inverter (just for change over), PS5, fully equipped kitchen with blender, microwave and oven, and a washing machine to help with laundry. Netflix is an option readily available. Experience would be of advantage. Try it.<br />\r\nNote;<br />\r\nThere&#39;s iron but no ironing board, blender</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cleaning schedule- every other day<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Flat 1 brumville residence, Victoria crest 2 estate off orchid road, eleganza bus stop, , Lekki, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4329452', '3.5529041', 'MAY2023/MC43MDAxNzUwMCAxNjgzMjc0ODUy-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BLzl8iyq9iI', 'Reserve', 1377, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-05 08:20:52', '2023-07-11 09:17:21'),
(100, 'short', NULL, '32334045', 'Tastefully furnished 3-bedroom apartment | GRA Ikeja', 'Apartment', NULL, '1531', 2, 110000.00, 132000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Parties are not allowed\r\n\r\nProperty is located in an Estate.\r\n▪︎ Early check-in and Late checkout of 1hr max before or after allowed for free. Ample notification time required. After which 1extra 10k would be charged per booking\r\n\r\n▪︎ December Rate is 130k\r\n\r\n▪︎ 1 night booking is allowed at 150k\r\n▪︎ NO Smoking\r\n\r\n▪︎ In built speakers are available with Bluetooth\r\n▪︎ Photoshoot is NOT allowed.\r\n\r\n▪︎ 24/7 Electricity available plus Inverter for generator change-over gap. All appliances work regardless of the inverter.\r\n\r\nHOST PAYOUT 110,000', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: garden furniture, fenced garden, iron, internet (Wi-Fi), tennis court, gym / fitness centre, air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Ikeja, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.601838', '3.3514863', 'MAY2023/MC4yNzM5MDIwMCAxNjgzMjc1MTA3-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1579, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Fenced plot', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-05 08:25:07', '2023-07-10 13:46:33'),
(102, 'short', NULL, '05799458', 'Beautiful 2-bedroom apartment | Magboro', 'Apartment', NULL, '1522', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'The property is a block of 4 apartments in a serene environment. The listed apartments is 2 bedroom fully en suite. There is ample space in the compound to relax with outdoor games. The rooftop is an open space for gym, exercise and small gathering. The entire compound is CCTV monitored. The apartments are in a gated estate (Forthright Gardens Estate) with adequate access control. The estate, as a community, is self sufficient, virtually everything the guests need for a comfortable stay, can be gotten in the estate. The ambience is wonderful and relatively close to nature. It is very quiet home away from the hustle and bustle of Lagos, and about 40mins drive to the Murtala Muhammed International Airport, Ikeja. It is about 20mins to Lagos Secretariat and Ikeja Mall.\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate: (4k extra per booking)\r\n\r\nLate check out rate: (4k extra per booking)\r\n\r\nNO In-built speakers available\r\n\r\nSmoking not allowed inside the apartment, but allowed in the sit out\r\n\r\none night booking allowed at same daily rate given\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot allowed at same rate\r\n\r\n*There is reasonable supply from IKEDC, complemented with solar inverter (ACs & Water heaters are not on inverter). The IKEDC > Inverter > IKEDC is automated. ( note that if there is no power supply from IKEDC between 1700hrs to 0600hrs, we put on the generator despite the fact that solar inverter is always available. With the gen set, our guest are guaranteed of AC and water heaters availability throughout the night.)', '<p>The property is a block of 4 apartments in a serene environment. The listed apartments is 2 bedroom fully en suite. There is ample space in the compound to relax with outdoor games. The rooftop is an open space for gym, exercise and small gathering. The entire compound is CCTV monitored. The apartments are in a gated estate 