(117, 'short', NULL, '93251742', 'Beautiful 4-bedroom duplex with soccer table | Orchid, Lekki (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1341', 2, 70000.00, 84000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Water heater\r\n\"- Modern Steam Jacuzzi with Massage\r\n- Soccer table\r\n- In-house chef at extra fee\r\n\r\nCleaning is every other day\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\nNo parties and smoking\r\nAllows one day booking\r\n\r\nI need at least a 12hrs notice before guests check in to ensure everything is put in place for guests. However, my calendar reflects the true state of availability . 70k as normal daily stay 150,000 as party for 20 persons', '<p>You won&#39;t want to miss out on this adorable 4-bedroom duplex off Orchid Road. A home located in a secured serene location and whose host is available for stress free check in. The cottage has a tastefully decorated living room and a fully furnished kitchen with all the necessities, including a microwave, Deep fryer, oven, freezer, and refrigerator to give it a homey feel and make cooking simple. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite (Bath shower in all room) with home having an additional guest toilet available to ensure privacy is not compromised. Queen-size beds are in the other rooms, and the master bedroom has a king-size bed that is incredibly comfy. Living room and bedroom is furnished with Tv hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided, if serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported with inverter<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nSoccer table available<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nParty house for 20 persons<br />\r\nIn house chef on request<br />\r\nWashing machine and iron is provided for ease of laundry</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC4zNzM1NjQwMCAxNjgzMjgzOTQx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1461, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Modern Steam Jacuzzi with Massage', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-05 10:52:21', '2023-06-30 11:19:49'),
