nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5243793', '3.3792057', 'MAY2023/MC43OTA1NTMwMCAxNjgzMjkyMTQw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nf1RBdU-4D0', 'Reserve', 1868, 'No', NULL, 'Living room, bedrooms and lounge are the position of the TVs', 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Gym fitness', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-05 13:09:00', '2023-09-01 11:35:27'),
(136, 'short', NULL, '01305300', 'Lovely 2-bedroom | Behind Punch Newspaper, Magboro', 'Apartment', NULL, '1522', 2, 70000.00, 84000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'The property is a block of 4 apartments in a serene environment. The listed apartment is 2 bedroom fully en suite. There is ample space in the compound to relax with outdoor games. The rooftop is an open space for gym, exercise and small gathering. The entire compound is CCTV monitored. The apartments are in a gated estate (Forthright Gardens Estate) with adequate access control. The estate, as a community, is self sufficient, virtually everything the guests need for a comfortable stay, can be gotten in the estate. The ambience is wonderful and relatively close to nature. It is very quiet home away from the hustle and bustle of Lagos, and about 40mins drive to the Murtala Muhammed International Airport, Ikeja. It is about 20mins to Lagos Secretariat and Ikeja Mall.\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate: (4k extra per booking)\r\n\r\nLate check out rate: (4k extra per booking)\r\n\r\nNO In-built speakers available\r\n\r\nSmoking not allowed inside the apartment, but allowed in the sit out\r\n\r\none night booking allowed at same daily rate given\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot allowed at same rate\r\n\r\n*There is reasonable supply from IKEDC, complemented with solar inverter (ACs & Water heaters are not on inverter). The IKEDC > Inverter > IKEDC is automated. ( note that if there is no power supply from IKEDC between 1700hrs to 0600hrs, we put on the generator despite the fact that solar inverter is always available. With the gen set, our guest are guaranteed of AC and water heaters availability throughout the night.)', '<p>The property is a block of 4 apartments in a serene environment. The listed apartment is 2 bedroom fully en suite. There is ample space in the compound to relax with outdoor games. The rooftop is an open space for gym, exercise and small gathering. The entire compound is CCTV monitored. The apartments are in a gated estate (Forthright Gardens Estate) with adequate access control. The estate, as a community, is self sufficient, virtually everything the guests need for a comfortable stay, can be gotten in the estate. The ambience is wonderful and relatively close to nature. It is very quiet home away from the hustle and bustle of Lagos, and about 40mins drive to the Murtala Muhammed International Airport, Ikeja. It is about 20mins to Lagos Secretariat and Ikeja Mall.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'House 4, Road B4, Forth right Gardens Estate, Magboro, behind Punch Newspaper along Lagos Ibadan Exp, , Magboro, Ogun, Ogun, Nigeria', '6.702477', '3.413759', 'MAY2023/MC45MTk0ODEwMCAxNjgzMjkyMzIw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1168, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Fenced plot and private staircase', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-05 13:12:00', '2023-07-26 17:55:18'),
