(152, 'short', NULL, '72021441', 'Exquisite 2-bedroom apartment | Chevron, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1587', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Has water heater\r\n\r\nKitchen has a blender\r\nCleaning schedule: every 3 days\r\n\r\nApartment has Netflix\r\n\r\nParties not allowed\r\n\r\n- Early checking in and Late check out depends on the hours before and after. However we charge 50% of the daily rate. (Reach out to host)\r\n- Smoking is not allowed (no form of smoking is allowed)\r\n-we don’t allow 1night booking\r\n\r\n55k payout', '<p>This homely 2-bedroom apartment is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Chevron, lekki. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features two bedrooms, with two king size bed each, fully equipped kitchen, two bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 4 people. Other features include microwave, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nit&rsquo;s 24 hours electricity guaranteed.<br />\r\nHas water heater<br />\r\nKitchen has a blender<br />\r\nCleaning schedule: every 3 days<br />\r\nParties not allowed<br />\r\n- Smoking is not allowed (no form of smoking is allowed)<br />\r\n-we don&rsquo;t allow 1night booking&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Block 1 flat 2b Maben Flats off northern foreshore estate Chevron Lekki, , Chevron, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4604419', '3.530303', 'MAY2023/MC4xMDUxMDMwMCAxNjgzMjk5Njcy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1271, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-05 15:14:32', '2023-07-11 16:50:36'),
(154, 'short', NULL, '67289892', 'Well Furnished 3-bedroom apartment | Life camp, Abuja', 'House', NULL, '1755', 2, 67500.00, 81000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'one night booking is allowed\r\n\r\nSmoking is allowed\r\n\r\nYes we have Bluetooth speaker\r\n\r\nEarly checking ; Extra 5k\r\nLate checkout is Extra 5k per hour\r\n\r\nPeak rate is also 80000\r\n\r\n67500 payout', '<p>This self compound apartment in Abuja has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, garage the same building, 1 fan, 3 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, washing machine, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Block A22w Brains and hammers city life camp Abuja, , Lifecamp, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0853042', '7.351153999999999', 'MAY2023/MC45OTkzODAwMCAxNjgzMjk5ODU1-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 413, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023