(155, 'short', NULL, '84140847', 'Lovely 4-bedroom duplex with PS5 and Video games | Chevron alternative route lekki', 'House', NULL, '1497', 2, 120000.00, 144000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'All rooms are ensuite\r\n\r\nOther amenities are Video games, Ps5 available, Netflix and water heater\r\n\r\nCleaning is done every 3 days\r\nLaundry company is available but on guest request\r\n\r\nNo party allowed\r\nSmoking is allowed at the balcony\r\nMinimum of 2 days\r\n\r\nFestive period is 150k \r\n\r\nregular stay -3/7/2023', '<p>This homely 4-bedroom apartment is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Chevron, lekki. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features four bedrooms that are ensuite, with four king size bed each, fully equipped kitchen, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 8 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Video games, Ps5, Water heater, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and some bedrooms, and WIFI access. A trial will convince</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To note;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Housekeeping schedule ; every three days,<br />\r\nit&rsquo;s 24 hours electricity guaranteed.<br />\r\nLaundry company is available but on guest request at extra fee<br />\r\nSmoking is allowed at the balcony<br />\r\nMinimum of 2 days booking<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '16c Dandelion street opposite Abiola court 10 Chevron alternative route lekki, , Chevron, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC4wMTIwMTgwMCAxNjgzMzAwMjkz-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e_ecu7BC49s', 'Reserve', 1685, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-05 15:24:53', '2023-07-13 10:46:05'),
