(161, 'short', NULL, '18399207', 'Plush - 1 Bedroom apartment with balcony and courtyard  |  Wuse 2', 'Apartment', NULL, '1395', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Host Leneade does not accept children in his apartment and also when trying to get a booking for his apartment, ask guest specific number of guests to be expected so he has that information.\r\n\r\nHOUSEKEEPING FOR GUEST REQUEST; The Ac in the bedroom only works with the inverter,\r\n\r\nWATER HEATER\r\n\r\nOnce a week free cleaning, cleaning any other day extra charge\r\nNETFLIX\r\nOne in the living room (Smart Tv) one in the Room (Not Smart)\r\n\r\nBoard games\r\n\r\n\r\nHalf price for late check out.\r\n\r\nNo photoshoots allowed\r\nNo DJ equipment\r\n\r\nInverter and generator available and they provide 24/7 light. However inverter has limited capacity\r\n\r\nNo smoking inside the building only outside at the designated area.\r\n\r\nNo one night booking. Minimum of 2 nights\r\nDecember rate is same', '<p>A functional and personalized home away experience where privacy and tranquillity are most cherished. You are met with smiles and an easily accessible team.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This Plush styled one-bedroom apartment with a king size bed, has a closed plan kitchen, a sit out balcony and spacious living room.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The &nbsp;property is situated in wuse 2 which is the heart in the city center of Abuja. It is home to the best parks, supermarkets, finest restaurants, hotels and clubs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The property itself comes with a 100 KVA and 8.5 KVA &nbsp;generators, 10 KVA inverter with 16 batteries, Fibre optics internet, intercom units, 24/7 laundry facility, uniformed security, patios, tropical courtyard, lobby with guest toilet, security layers, CCTV, parking, water pressure pump, etc</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0764785', '7.398574', 'MAY2023/MC4zNjI2NDgwMCAxNjgzMzAzODQ3-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MSUvoMUY5oA', 'Reserve', 163, 'Yes', 'outside the property and lobby', 'One in the living room (Smart Tv) one in the Room (Not Smart)', 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Court yard', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '20:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-05 16:24:07', '2023-08-11 11:42:26'),
