(172, 'short', NULL, '45465555', 'Spacious 4-bedroom duplex with a balcony | Sangotedo Ajah', 'House', NULL, '1461', 2, 100000.00, 120000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Blender\r\n\r\nDaily housekeeping, Netflix\r\n\r\nNo Dj\r\n\r\nearly check in/ late check out @ 5K PER HOUR\r\nDecember fees is same as Normal season (100k)\r\nPhotoshoot is free for a guest booked into the apt already\r\n\r\nNO SMOKING. SHISHA ALLOWED\r\n\r\none-night booking at SAME RATE', '<p>This comfortable 4 bedrooms in Ajah that is an intimately designed home with a maximum occupancy of 6. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with stunning architecture to the gorgeous interior design, lovely curtains, contemporary chandeliers for lighting, children play area can allow family holidays that includes the children, comfortable mattresses with soft natural linens, a flawless organization throughout! It has fiber optic internet wifi with 24-hour electricity, a balcony for ample light and relaxation, fully equipped kitchen with microwave, blender and oven, and a washing machine to help with laundry. Housekeeping is done regularly. The parking space is spacious, and the automobiles are parked properly. Netflix is an option readily available. Experience would be of advantage. Try it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Daily housekeeping is provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'gensitra street, peninsula Gardens Estate, sangotedo Ajah, , Ajah, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4655101', '3.6209718', 'MAY2023/MC4yMTc1MzYwMCAxNjgzNDU3NjAw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1702, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Children play area', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-07 11:06:40', '2023-07-05 12:20:42'),
(173, 'short', NULL, '14339921', 'Luxury self compound 2-bedroom penthouse with pool/private cinema | Banana island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1317', 2, 500000.00, 600000.00, NULL, NULL, '500000', 'party Charge payout :- 1,400,000- for 20-30 guests\r\nvideoshoot payout  is 950k\r\nCaution Fee : 500k\r\n\r\nHas cinema and it is self compound\r\nPhotoshoot payout for  4hours- 450k (strictly 9am-12pm ) \r\n\r\n630,000 for payout for 2 days upward, extra 100k for a day booking Party bookings still remains 1,400,000\r\n\r\nMonthly rates- N100,000 off penthouse', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>townhouse in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: garden furniture, terrace, iron, internet (Wi-Fi), balcony, air-conditioned, private swimming pool, open-air parking the same building, 3 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the gas independent kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, freezer, washing machine, dishwasher, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils, coffee machine, frying pan, toaster, kettle and juicer are provided.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'Yes', NULL, 'Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.449999999999999', '3.433333', 'MAY2023/MC4yMTE5OTUwMCAxNjgzNDYwNjU3-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Private', NULL, NULL, 'Private', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', 5.0, 1, NULL, 'Book_now', 231, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Private cinema and bq', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-07 11:57:37', '2023-09-05 17:35:52'),
(174, 'short', NULL, '76580464', 'Beautiful 2-bedroom self compound | VGC', 'House', NULL, '1442', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Cleaning is done daily\r\n\r\nHas water bath and blender in kitchen\r\nNetflix available\r\n\r\nNo parties\r\nAllows smoking\r\nAllows mini events not party\r\n\r\nNew rate is 70,000 naira per night ( from a week upward) \r\nLess than a week (75,000).', '<p>This Adorable 2-Bedroom duplex in VGC Estate is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 4 guests and is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room with nice decors and fittings, ,a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, blender, toaster, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. Apartment is rooms-ensuite with home having 2 bath for convenience. In this home, rooms are furnished with a comfortable king size bed each, all white beddings, and plush duvets to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. All rooms are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment<br />\r\nSelf-compound(Maximum privacy)<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nDaily housekeeping</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Road 3 close 10 vgc estate Ajah, , Victoria garden city, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4618373', '3.5376445', 'MAY2023/MC4zNDMwNDkwMCAxNjgzNDYzNjE0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1484, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Self-compound(Maximum privacy)', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-07 12:46:54', '2023-07-06 15:51:56'),
(175, 'short', NULL, '75789838', 'Comfy studio with convertible snooker and tennis | Oregun ikeja', 'Apartment', NULL, '1553', 2, 25000.00, 30000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Convertible snooker board and table tennis\r\nwater heater blender\r\nnetflix\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\n\r\nEarly check in free\r\n\r\nLate check in free\r\n\r\nPeak season rate ; same rate\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot allow with maximum of 10 people 100k\r\n\r\nNo inbuilt speaker\r\n\r\nWe guarantee 24 /7 power supply uninterrupted\r\n\r\nAll the A/cs are very efficient and working well\r\nopenstyle kitchen\r\n\r\nStudio 20k payout for a month\r\n\r\n25k payout', '<p>Adorable studio apartment situated in Oregun, Ikeja with maximum guest occupancy of 2. Well-organized artworks that adds elegance to the living room, fully equipped kitchen to satisfy all cravings. Apartment amenities include Convertible snooker board and table tennis, water heater, Netflix and a Dstv cable (with selected channels). This modern apartment is the perfect place for you.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 1 oremeta street, oregun ikeja, , Oregun, Ikeja, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.598924299999999', '3.3645975', 'uploads/property/JUN2023/0330815001685718645-property-JUN2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2kkIDYiwMaY', 'Reserve', 1643, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Convertible snooker board and table tennis', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-07 13:18:29', '2023-08-01 12:06:36'),
