a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 5 shonny highway street shonibare estate Maryland Ikeja, , Maryland, Ikeja, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.576958299999999', '3.3627647', 'MAY2023/MC4zNzg3NDMwMCAxNjgzNDY2NjU0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2157, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Gym', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-07 13:37:34', '2023-07-10 15:06:03'),
