(181, 'short', NULL, '41645744', 'Stunning 1-Bedroom apartment with open style kitchen | Ikate, Elegushi (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1515', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Has water heater\r\n\r\nHome cleaning- every other day\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nNo smoking at all\r\nDiscount for long stays\r\nMinimum of 2 days\r\nHas 4 hours for inverter during the day.\r\n\r\nHouse rules (No pets, No illegal substances ,No parties only hangouts, Turn off electricals when you want to go out, take extra care of keys, take care of furnishings and do not rearrange furnitures, Park only in Slot 19 , do not park in shared driveway at any time)\r\n\r\n45k payout', '<p>Sophisticated one-bedroom apartment located in Ikate, Lekki. This apartment uses inverter. This home is a beautifully carved cottage with exquisite organization that screams originality. Has a Queen-size bed, allowing you to stretch out and relax with little body contact for a restful, uninterrupted night&#39;s sleep, Water heater in the bath, A fully equipped American kitchen with a microwave,oven and other appliances creates an ideal environment for efficient cooking. It is a WIFI and Netflix enabled residence, Living room is a proper representation of divine.<br />\r\nApartment rules<br />\r\nHouse cleaning is every other day<br />\r\nNo smoking at all<br />\r\nAllows a day booking&nbsp;<br />\r\nHas 4 hours for inverter during the day.<br />\r\n(No pets, No illegal substances ,No parties only hangouts, Turn off electricals when you want to go out, take extra care of keys, take care of furnishings and do not rearrange furnitures, Park only in Slot 19 , do not park in shared driveway at any time)</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'B19 Lotus apartment 19 abioro street off gbangbala street ikate elgushi Lekki, , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4385512', '3.489784', 'MAY2023/MC43Nzg5ODIwMCAxNjgzNTM0MDI1-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LLlsZPh2MXA', 'Reserve', 1796, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 08:20:25', '2023-09-06 08:54:54'),
(182, 'short', NULL, '23939566', 'Elegantly-styled 3-Bedroom apartment with Gym and a private pool | Ikoyi_Banana Island road', 'Apartment', NULL, '1496', 2, 135000.00, 162000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Facility manager for this property MR Ben- +234 703 486 1524\r\nName of Apartment is Dominion Court. Landmark is Redeem church. 24/7 check in available and electricity\r\n\r\nHosts mini events not party max of 20 people for 275k;with 100k caution fee\r\n\r\npayout rate for December is 170k per night; for a month booking 160k is allowed\r\n\r\npayout rate is 135k per night.;', '<p>The mansion of your dreams is ready to welcome new guests. Luxurious three-bedroom apartment is a flat in an estate in ikoyi with a maximum guest capacity of six. If you&#39;re looking for plenty of space, go no further because your needs will be covered. This magnificent home is tastefully decorated and equipped with modern conveniences, such as a gym that conveniently brings aerobic training to your doorstep to help you maintain a healthy cardiovascular system. An indoor pool to alleviate tension and feel rejuvenated during your stay, a large bathtub to soak in and experience muscle relaxation after a long day, well-organized artworks that adds elegance to the living room, and a fully equipped kitchen to satisfy all cravings, wifi access and netflix avalable are just a few of the amenities available. This contemporary apartment is ideal for you.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.449999999999999', '3.433333', 'MAY2023/MC41MDkwODIwMCAxNjgzNTM0Mjc3-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1804, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Gym/ fitness centre', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 08:24:37', '2023-07-06 17:40:09'),
