s, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Block A flat 1 Royal Court Apartment, chief Charles mba street of gbamgbala street ikate Lekki, , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5046518', '3.3426697', 'MAY2023/MC4zMDE0NTIwMCAxNjgzNTM1Nzk3-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1847, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 08:49:57', '2023-07-11 10:04:26'),
