(194, 'short', NULL, '97243128', 'Charming 2-bedroom apartment with swimming pool and a gym | Ikate Elegushi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1578', 2, 70000.00, 84000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 ELECTRICITY\r\n\r\nLudo, whot, ToD\r\nNetflix\r\nDaily housekeeping\r\nheater, blender\r\n\r\n1 DAY BOOKING HOST PAYOUT = 70K\r\n\r\nEarly checking rate is same,\r\nLate check out rate will be additional cos of 10,000\r\nDecember per night will be N85,000\r\nNo smoking, no shisha\r\nWe have inbuilt speakers\r\nPhoto shoot prices will be confirmed if there won’t be any damages to the wall paints\r\n\r\n70k payout (3/1/2023)', '<p>This Adorable 2-Bedroom apartment with a luxurious swimming pool and a Gym in Ikate-Elegushi is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 4 guests. This home is in a private and safe space. The elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room with modern d&eacute;cor and comfortable sofas and furniture&rsquo;s, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as an oven, electric kettle, blender, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite having bath showers. Guest toilet is available to ensure maximum privacy is not bridged. In this home, rooms are furnished with a comfortable king size bed each to ensure pleasant rest. Living room and bedrooms are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\n24/7 Wifi&nbsp;<br />\r\nChildren play area<br />\r\nLudo, whot, ToD<br />\r\nDstv subscription,&nbsp;<br />\r\nNetflix&nbsp;<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nDaily housekeeping<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the 