f booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 3, salvation road, itedo estate off freedom way ikate lekki lagos, , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4425238', '3.4820374', 'MAY2023/MC45MDYwODEwMCAxNjgzNTM3OTcy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1466, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 09:26:12', '2023-07-11 10:26:18'),
