(200, 'short', NULL, '47249363', 'Attractive 5-bedroom apartment |Itedo estate,off freedom way ikate', 'Apartment', NULL, '1572', 2, 120000.00, 144000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supported with generator\r\n\r\n1 day booking not allowed\r\n\r\nCleaning is done every 2 days depending on length of stay.(Towel are changed on a daily basis and extra toiletries are available\r\n\r\nNo parties and loud music are not allowed\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\n\r\nCommercial videoshoot are not allowed\r\n\r\nSpreading of clothings on the balconies is strictly prohibited kindly make use of the in house laundry services for your quick wash and ironing\r\n\r\nDecember is 150k\r\n\r\n120k payout rate (9/1/2023', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 5 bedrooms and has capacity for 10 people.&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), balcony, air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, 6 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils, toaster and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL,