(201, 'short', NULL, '40780990', 'Beautiful 2-Bedroom Apartment | Ikate Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1354', 2, 65000.00, 78000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'full address: Terrace 8 Asher court 3, Donatus close off kunsela road ikate chisco lekki\r\n\r\n1 day booking is allowed @ 85k\r\n\r\nit can be list as 1 bedroom for 55k\r\nOne Bed..... 55k\r\n\r\n-No smoking\r\nNo pets\r\n\r\n\r\nBlender available\r\n24/7 check in and electricity\r\nNetflix available\r\nA terrace\r\n\r\n75000 naira as December payout\r\n\r\njust installed solar panels as well\r\n\r\nHost payout price- 65k- MONTHLY RATE IS 55K', '<p>Have fun with the whole family or with friends at our elegantly constructed house.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis 2 bedroom apartment is located in a serene and gated community in Lekki with solar panels installed<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is stylishly designed with great attention to detail and luxurious appeal that will exceed your imagination.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll the rooms in the home are ensuite and featured a 24/7 power supply, clean running water, fast fiber internet, Netflix, and cable.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities:24hr security, washer &amp; dryer, car garage, wine bar, and Play Station.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe space<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA 2 door dedicated car garage will lead you to the entrance of the house for convenience.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe stairs to the living room are adorned with inspirational words to brighten your stay.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur open kitchen floor layout is designed with luxury at the back of our minds ranging from great appliances, carefully selected artworks to our imported contemporary furniture.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe staircase leading to your bedroom does have colored lights to guide your feet and also to reflect your various mood for a relaxed ambiance at night.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe bedrooms are colorful and each tells its own unique story. It comes with a 42-inch television, a closet, and carefully selected pictures for a calm ambiance at night.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a perfect place to unwind from the stress of Lagos City or when vacationing from abroad.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Donatus close off kunsela road ikate chisco lekki, , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4310879', '3.4768567', 'MAY2023/MC4xNTY5OTQwMCAxNjgzODk2MjQ4-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ndGd1ER_ZoA', 'Reserve', 1635, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 09:37:53', '2023-08-10 09:27:23');
