 amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.449999999999999', '3.433333', 'MAY2023/MC45NTQ0ODQwMCAxNjgzNTQ1NDIx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NyQtJat-tng', 'Reserve', 1421, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'WIFI', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 11:30:21', '2023-07-21 11:48:42'),
