ly be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Block 3 flat B1 Adejoke court, No 9 gbenga ashafa street Parkview estate ikoyi, , Parkview, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4588432', '3.4470343', 'MAY2023/MC4zNzk2NTgwMCAxNjgzNTQ2NzU0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=srsg0WUMXNg', 'Reserve', 1283, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 11:52:34', '2023-07-21 11:35:02'),
(219, 'short', NULL, '69687844', 'Lovely 3-bedroom Oceanview apartment with swimming pool and snooker board | Admiralty close lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1584', 2, 110000.00, 132000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Snooker board, Water heater\r\n\r\nHas blender\r\n\r\nHousekeeping; everyday, Netflix is available\r\n\r\n8 for regular stay 15 for get together no DJ\'s no party just get together; 150K PAYOUT\r\nAllows smoking,\r\nYouTube\r\n\r\n-No additional charge for early check in, as long as the apartment is available.\r\n-But additional charge applies for late check out at N5,000 for every hour from the check out time.\r\n-December rate is 130k per night.\r\n-Yes we do allow photo shoots at 150k per night\r\n-One night booking only allowed from Monday through Thursday\r\n\r\n-Normal payout is 110k per night (discount can be considered on long stays);', '<p>This comfortable 3-bedroom house in Admiralty close lekki phase 1 located on the 4th Floor. Made available is an elevator for easy access to the apartment. This home has a maximum occupancy of 6. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with stunning architecture to the gorgeous interior design, Outdoor furniture for relaxation, a refreshing pool, comfortable mattresses with soft natural linens, flowing curtains, and a flawless organization throughout! It has fiber optic internet Wi-Fi with 24-hour electricity, a snooker board for entertainment, children&#39;s play area, fully equipped kitchen with microwave and oven, and a washing machine to help with laundry. The parking space is in the same building, and the automobiles are parked properly. Netflix is an option readily available. Experience would be of advantage. Try it.<br />\r\nCleaning schedule; Every other day</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.447809299999999', '3.4723495', 'MAY2023/MC4wOTg3MzIwMCAxNjgzNTQ2ODEx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1591, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 11:53:31', '2023-07-11 14:59:25'),
