(227, 'short', NULL, '64384445', 'Modest 3-bedroom apartment | Parkview Ikoyi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1507', 2, 140000.00, 168000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'All rooms ensuite\r\n\r\nHave water heater\r\nApartment kitchen has blender\r\n\r\nHost cleans; every 3 days\r\nHave Netflix\r\n\r\nMinimum of 3 Days\r\n\r\n3 Bedrooms Duplex Service Apartments Short Stay: N140,000 Long Stay (7 Days) : N130,000. Refundable caution is 100k', '<p>Lovely minimalist of your dreams is ready to welcome new guests. This three-bedroom apartment is a flat in Parkview, Ikoyi with a maximum guest capacity of six. This elegant home is tastefully decorated and equipped with well-organized artworks that adds elegance to the living room, and a fully equipped kitchen to satisfy all cravings. Each bedroom is ensuite, Wi-Fi access and Netflix available are just a few of the amenities available. This contemporary apartment is ideal for you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note: Host cleans; every 3 days</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '15 Turamiyu Bello Osagie street Parkview estate ikoyi, , Parkview, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5277324', '3.2220736', 'MAY2023/MC4zODgxOTIwMCAxNjgzNTUyNjkw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Awqf7UhAqk', 'Reserve', 1516, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 13:31:30', '2023-07-25 13:58:17');
