(228, 'short', NULL, '92453967', 'Stunning 2-bedroom apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1468', 2, 76500.00, 91800.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Number 10 terraces\r\nBashorun okunsanya street\r\nAt the back of forte oil tantalizers, admiralty way\r\n24/7 Electricity\r\n\r\n76500 payout rate', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC4yNjQ1MTMwMCAxNjgzNTUzNDY5-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1406, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 13:44:29', '2023-07-05 12:55:36'),
(229, 'short', NULL, '72499470', 'Adorable 3-bedroom apartment with swimming pool and gym | off Alfred Rewane road, ikoyi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1550', 2, 130000.00, 156000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Blender\r\n\r\nCleaning scedule; Every other day\r\nHave netflix\r\n\r\nAllows smoking\r\nAllows one day booking at same rate\r\n\r\nNo additional fees for early but we charge 40k for late checkout within 3hrs\r\n\r\nNo additional fees for December\r\n247 power with all appliances and emergency backup inverter.\r\n\r\nNo DJ at all . No party .. Photoshoot allowed with at 30k\r\n\r\nNormal Rate 130k minimum 3 days', '<p>This comfortable 3-bedroom house in Ikoyi located on the 3rd Floor and made available is an elevator for easy access to the apartment. This home has a maximum occupancy of 6. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with stunning architecture to the gorgeous interior design, a gym for cardiovascular training, a refreshing pool, comfortable mattresses with soft natural linens, flowing curtains, and a flawless organization throughout! It has fiber optic internet Wi-Fi with 24-hour electricity, a snooker board for entertainment, children&#39;s play area, fully equipped kitchen with microwave and oven, and a washing machine to help with laundry. The parking space is covered, and the automobiles are parked properly. Netflix is an option readily available. Experience would be of advantage. Try it.<br />\r\nCleaning schedule; Every other day</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 3E Olumegbon road off Alfred Rewane road, ikoyi, , Ikoyi, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4506429', '3.4310914', 'MAY2023/MC4xOTQzMjQwMCAxNjgzNTU0ODk1-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4Ui17km1mgw', 'Reserve', 1535, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Gym/Fitness centre', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 14:08:15', '2023-07-17 13:05:41'),
(230, 'short', NULL, '70741555', 'Adorable 3-bedroom Oceanview apartment with swimming pool and gym | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1496', 2, 135000.00, 162000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Facility manager for property is Paul Joneer; +234 913 288 6806 \r\n\r\nCLEANING SCHEDULE: every other day\r\n\r\nnETFLIX\r\nAllows pARTIES WITH dj at 250k for a max guest of 25\r\nAllows smoking\r\nAllows a day booking\r\n\r\nAlexa smart home, in built Bluetooth ceiling speakers, automated curtains, automated light switch, open plan kitchen\r\n\r\npayout is 135k', '<p>The mansion of your dreams is ready to welcome new guests. Luxurious three-bedroom apartment with ocean view in Lekki phase 1 with a maximum guest capacity of 6. If you&#39;re looking for plenty of space, go no further because your needs will be covered. This magnificent home is tastefully decorated and equipped with modern conveniences, such as a gym that conveniently brings aerobic training to your doorstep to help you maintain a healthy cardiovascular system. An indoor pool to alleviate tension and feel rejuvenated during your stay, well-organized artworks that adds elegance to the living room, and a fully equipped kitchen to satisfy all cravings, Wi-Fi access and Netflix available are just a few of the amenities available. This contemporary apartment is ideal for you.<br />\r\nTo note:<br />\r\nCLEANING SCHEDULE: every other day<br />\r\nAllows smoking<br />\r\nAllows a day booking<br />\r\nAlexa smart home, in built Bluetooth ceiling speakers, automated curtains, automated light switch, open plan kitchen</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC45NzM2ODMwMCAxNjgzNTU1MTMx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=coD-o4DQk24', 'Reserve', 1937, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Open style kitchen plan and alexa smart home', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 14:12:11', '2023-08-14 09:45:02'),
