(238, 'short', NULL, '16443354', 'Lovely 2-bedroom apartment with a Garden | Ilupeju (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1443', 2, 50000.00, 60000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supported by inverter\r\nNetf;ix\r\nPrivate apartment in a complex\r\nGarden recreation by the building\r\nFood order/delivery from parent hotel\r\nHeater, blender\r\n24/7 check in\r\n\r\n50k payout\r\nFor monthly payouts- 20% off -40k payout', '<p>This Beautiful 2-Bedroom Private apartment in a complex at Ilupeju is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 24/7 check in by host. A welcoming terrace with a sense of calm and tranquility. The entrance to this elite flat is a walk in for simple access. The apartment features a beautifully organized living room with flowery decor with a positioned dining within it&rsquo;s little cottage, apartment has a guest toilet to the right entrance to guarantee privacy is not compromised, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a oven, blender, microwave and refrigerator. Presence of a walkway that allows for good ventilation. After a long day of exploring, its en-suite rooms provide exceptionally comfortable king size beds. If serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nGarden recreation by the building<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nNetflix subscription<br />\r\nFood order/delivery from parent hotel<br />\r\nHigh speed Wifi and many more</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellati