(239, 'short', NULL, '29126188', 'Exquisite 3-bedroom apartment | VGC Extension', 'Apartment', NULL, '1562', 2, 81000.00, 97200.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '81K PAYOUT\r\n\r\n1. Once you get to the traffic light for VGC, make a U-turn.\r\n2. Hayden fuel station would be on your right hand side.\r\n3. Take the immediate right after the Hayden gas station (you’ll see a redeem church of God sign board)\r\n4. Follow the road into that turn into the gate (there’s a bit of construction)\r\n5. Keep driving straight down and take the first turn on your right (you\'ll see an estate gate),\r\n\r\n6. Take the immediate left beside that estate into Adekunle Idowu close)\r\n7. Follow the bend to the end of the road, you’ll see an estate with white buildings on your right .. after some buildings under construction.\r\nThat is the estate.', '<p>This apartment in Lekki has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, bath tub, open-air parking the same building, 1 fan, 4 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the independent kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'House 20, Kidscourt 19 estate ADEKUNLE IDowu close, Off Harris drive before Lekki VGC Extension . La, , Victoria garden city, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4660322', '3.5445844', 'MAY2023/MC41NTU1ODIwMCAxNjgzNTYwNDY2-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1680, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 15:41:06', '2023-07-10 13:07:30'),
