an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC41MjQwMzUwMCAxNjgzNTY0OTMx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1725, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Open style kitchen plan', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 16:55:31', '2023-07-05 12:38:07'),
(250, 'short', NULL, '02325813', 'Pleasant 1-bedroom with balcony and pouch swings| Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1318', 2, 57000.00, 68400.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Swimming Pool, Swimming pool not functional at the time of inspection\r\n\r\nHas water heater and blender in kitchen\r\nHousekeeping is every 3 days\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\nFirst floor with a balcony and two pouch swings\r\n\r\n57k payout', '<p>This classy one bedroom is located in Lekki phase 1. This home is a beautifully carved cottage with exquisite organization that screams originality. Has a king-size bed, allowing you to stretch out and relax with little body contact for a restful, uninterrupted night&#39;s sleep, Water heater in the bath, A fully equipped kitchen with a microwave, Oven, and other appliances creates an ideal environment for efficient cooking. This space is a proper representation of divine.<br />\r\nAmenities include;<br />\r\n- 24hours power<br />\r\n- Internet<br />\r\n- Within a secured estate<br />\r\n- Uniformed security<br />\r\n- Laundry service<br />\r\n-DSTV and Netflix<br />\r\n- Housekeeping is every 3 days<br />\r\n-Balcony<br />\r\nPouch swings/Outdoor furniture<br />\r\n- Proximity to supermarkets, pharmacy, and fashion stores, etc.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '15 oluwole street lekki phase 1, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4402693', '3.477257', 'MAY2023/MC40NTk4MjYwMCAxNjgzNTY2MDg4-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1727, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Pouch swings', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 17:14:48', '2023-06-30 06:22:31'),
(251, 'short', NULL, '69400991', 'Fancy 2-bedroom with ps4 and a swimming pool | chisco bus stop Lekki.', 'Apartment', NULL, '1612', 2, 56000.00, 67200.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'All ensuite\r\n\r\nVideo games and ps4, netflix\r\nwater heater, blender\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\nMinimum of 2 days booking\r\n\r\nNo parties\r\n\r\nIf the stay is for more than 1 week and the room is available there will be no early check in and late check out charges\r\n\r\nNo DJ please.\r\n\r\nthere is inverter 24/7 only for TVs, WiFi and lightning.\r\nIt has PS4,\r\n\r\n57k payout', '<p>A premium 2-Bedroom with maximum guest size of 4 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, a fully- kitchen that is fully equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, blender, freezer,toaster and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, rooms are well furnished with a comfortable King size bed and a queen size bed with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided. All rooms are ensuite and guest toilet available.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWi-Fi<br />\r\nDstv,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nChildren playarea<br />\r\nSwimming pool<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nVideo games and PS4</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'H6 Flat 5 Lekki Gardens Estate, 235 kunsela road, chisco bus stop ., , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.434566999999999', '3.492087', 'MAY2023/MC43MDUxODIwMCAxNjgzNTY2MTE2-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1710, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'PS4', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 17:15:16', '2023-07-12 14:11:27');
