(252, 'short', NULL, '05655464', 'Lovely 3-bedroom apartment | Command Road. Ipaja.', 'Apartment', NULL, '1368', 2, 50000.00, 60000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment has a central laundry where guest can wash and iron at discounted price.\"\r\n\r\nAll ensuite\r\nHas water heater\r\ndaily housekeeping\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nDj\'s are allowed\r\nNo smoking\r\nALLOWS PARTIES (80k; maximum of 25 people- Caution fee 100k)\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate - free\r\n\r\nLate check out rate - free\r\n\r\nDecember daily Rate for your apartment- 60k\r\n\r\nDecember party Rate for your apartment- 100k\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot at same daily rate given\r\n\r\none night booking at same daily rate given\r\n\r\n50k payout', '<p>This comfortable 3-bedroom apartment with a maximum occupancy of 6, this home is an intimate walk-in designed home in Ipaja. From the artistic facade of the building with beautiful architecture until the beautiful interior design, lush entrance, comfy beds with soft natural linen, flowing curtains, a perfect organization in all! It features fiber optic internet WiFi with 24/7 electricity, a fully equipped kitchen with microwave and oven, Apartment has a central laundry where guest can wash and iron at discounted price.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Note:&nbsp;daily housekeeping is provided</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5243793', '3.3792057', 'MAY2023/MC42ODQwMDcwMCAxNjgzNTY2MzIy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1420, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Fenced plot', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 17:18:42', '2023-07-03 09:47:45'),
(253, 'short', NULL, '01223094', 'Admirable 2 bedroom smart home | Chisco Busstop Ikate', 'Apartment', NULL, '1538', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'December rate ; 59k payout\r\n\r\n60k payout (17/1)', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), childrens area, air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, garage the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Triangle Apartment Chisco bus stop Ikate Lagos, 23401, Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.434566999999999', '3.492087', 'MAY2023/MC4xMzg5MDEwMCAxNjgzNTY2NTM2-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1339, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 17:21:57', '2023-07-07 15:44:14'),
