modation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Emcel Apartment, 2217 Akinyemi Omoyeni street , chisco bus stop Ikate Lekki, , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4323703', '3.4927236', 'MAY2023/MC40NTcyNzYwMCAxNjgzNTc4OTI3-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1277, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 20:48:28', '2023-07-06 17:09:59'),
(271, 'short', NULL, '99428867', 'Admirable 3-bedroom with tennis and football pitch | Lsdpc Estate,ikate lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1532', 2, 80000.00, 96000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'football pitch\r\nwater heater netflix\r\n\r\nNO DJ ALLOWED AND SMOKING NOT ALLOWED\r\n\r\nEarly Check in rate -\r\nNone\r\n\r\nLate check out rate - 7k per hour\r\n\r\n\r\nPeak period -100k payout\r\nDec - jan\r\nFeb 14th weekend\r\n\r\nYes we allow photoshoot\r\n100k per day\r\n\r\nNo DJ\r\n\r\nNo one night booking. Minimum 2 nights\r\n\r\nNo Inbuilt in speakers\r\n\r\n80K PAYOUT ALLOWED', '<p>An opportunity to live in a magnificent 3-bedroom flat on the ground floor of a building in Ikate,Lekki. You enter a magnificent structure with creative decorations in a tranquil setting. A tastefully decorated living area with plush sofas and decorative pillows. This apartment has a football pitch and tennis court for excitement and pleasant moments. Each room has a Smart TV with great graphics and a very spacious bedroom with queen size beds that makes you feel at home. This apartment includes a fully equipped kitchen, 24/7 electricity, a relaxing balcony, and Wifi access.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Block 5 Flat 2 Lsdpc Estate ikate lekki, , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5046518', '3.3426697', 'MAY2023/MC40NzMxOTMwMCAxNjgzNTc5NDI3-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 909, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 20:57:07', '2023-07-10 13:41:39'),
(272, 'short', NULL, '33018779', 'Lovely 4-bedroom duplex | Unilag estate, Isheri magodo (inverter)', 'House', NULL, '1337', 2, 135000.00, 162000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supply supported with inverter\r\n\r\nThere is the is fan in the apartment\r\n\r\nCleaning is done once in a week\r\n\r\nThere is gym equipment in the house\r\n\r\nParty rate : 200k per night with maximum guest of 35\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate: do not apply if we don’t have any occupant.\r\n\r\nLate check out rate: 8k per hour\r\n\r\nDecember daily and party Rate for your apartment : still the same rate, there is even a 10 percent discount.\r\n\r\none night booking at same as daily rate.\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot @Same rate as per night, but per hours is negotiable\r\n\r\nDj with all equipment allowed outside the compound not inside the duplex.\r\n\r\nIn built speakers available\r\n\r\nPayout :135k', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>house in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 4 bedrooms and has capacity for 8 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), gym / fitness centre, air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cleaning is done once in a week<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '2 Tolulope Cole ,Science road, Unilag estate, isheri magodo lagos, , Magodo, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.565389799999999', '3.2699934', 'MAY2023/MC4xMjI5ODkwMCAxNjgzNTc5NDgw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1535, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 20:58:00', '2023-08-22 13:47:23'),
