(286, 'short', NULL, '32190065', 'Bohemian - 1 Bedroom apartment | Wuse 2', 'Apartment', NULL, '1395', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Host Leneade does not accept children in his apartment and also when trying to get a booking for his apartment, ask guest specific number of guests to be expected so he has that information.\r\n\r\nHOUSEKEEPING FOR GUEST REQUEST; The Inverter cannot carry the Ac\r\nboard GAMES\r\nWATER HEATER\r\n\r\nFree cleaning once a week, Any other cleaning based on guest request (on extra charge)\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\nHalf price for late check out.\r\n\r\nNo photoshoots allowed\r\nNo DJ equipment\r\n\r\nInverter and generator available and they provide 24/7 light. However inverter has limited capacity\r\n\r\nNo smoking inside the building only outside at the designated area.\r\n\r\nNo one night booking. Minimum of 2 nights\r\nDecember rate is same\r\n55k payout', '<p>A functional and personalized home away experience where privacy and tranquillity are most cherished. You are met with smiles and an easily accessible team.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This modern bohe styled one-bedroom apartment with a king size bed, has an open plan kitchen with access to a guest toilet and storage facility.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The &nbsp;property is situated in wuse 2 which is the heart in the city center of Abuja. It is home to the best parks, supermarkets, finest restaurants, hotels and clubs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The property itself comes with a 100 KVA and 8.5 KVA &nbsp;generators, 10 KVA inverter with 16 batteries, Fibre optics internet, intercom units, 24/7 laundry facility, uniformed security, patios, tropical courtyard, lobby with guest toilet, security layers, CCTV, parking, water pressure pump, etc</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported with inverter<br />\r\nlobby<br />\r\nCourtyard<br />\r\nPatio<br />\r\nlaundry room</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 41 Lobito crescent, Wuse 2, , Wuse 2, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0719582', '7.4917122', 'MAY2023/MC44MTgwNTEwMCAxNjgzNTg2OTM1-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UI70m21io8U', 'Reserve', 175, 'Yes', 'outside the property and lobby', NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '20:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-08 23:02:15', '2023-08-11 11:42:11'),
