f cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Unit F4, Praiseville Garden Estate, Ogudu GRA phase 2, , Ogudu, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5775621', '3.3881065', 'MAY2023/MC4zOTg3OTEwMCAxNjgzNjE2MzIx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1446, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'WIFI', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 07:12:01', '2023-07-10 15:28:15'),
