(296, 'short', NULL, '85181242', 'Charming 4-bedroom apartment with swimming pool | Ikate,Lekki(inverter)', 'House', NULL, '1472', 2, 95000.00, 114000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment is a 5 bedroom apartment and can be listed as that.\r\nRooms ensuite\r\n\r\nVideo games, Convertible snooker board, air hockey and table tennis\r\n\r\nJaccuzzi available\r\nWater heater\r\nPS5\r\nblender\r\n\r\nHousekeeping\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate: if available for early check in extra 10k per booking\r\n\r\nLate check out rate: 10K per hour\r\n\r\nSmoking allowed in some area but NO SMOKING IN THE ROOMS. Masters balcony and the relaxation area are smoking areas.\r\n\r\nIn built speakers not working at the moment but will be activated soon\r\nPhotoshoot allowed @ 180k\r\n\r\nNO PARTY only small get together, bridal shower etc for 12-15 max at 150k per night\r\nOne day booking not allowed\r\n\r\nFor dec booking 5bed now becomes 120k for long stay and 130k for short stay and 4bed becomes 100k for 30days and above and 110k for short stay\'\r\n\r\nNormal payout rate (3bed at N80k 4bed at N95k 5bed at 110k (25/1/2023)-used to be 100k\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, on July 8th, our guest experienced poor services during their stay at your property. This included a flooded kitchen due to broken pipes and a mosquito infestation. These issues led our team to request compensation for the guest, but despite our efforts to persuade you, we were unable to reach a resolution', '<p>A stunning destination villa with a contemporary style and well-crafted furniture. This property offers luxurious, air-conditioned accommodation with 24/7 electricity, snooker board and, balcony, tennis and gym. Enjoy the fully equipped kitchen, which includes a blender, microwave, and oven. For an outstanding private vacation, this spacious and modern villa is completely manned and magnificently equipped with sufficient lighting. Large windows and an open floor layout keep the space feeling light and airy. These homes provide a one-of-a-kind opportunity to enjoy a wonderful holiday while taking in the most breath-taking scenery and natural beauty that nature has to offer. Water heater, Netflix, and WIFI connection are among the additional features. This is the ideal place to visit for a vacation. Daily housekeeping is every day<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKindly note;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nApartment is a 5 bedroom apartment and can be listed as that too<br />\r\nRooms ensuite<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVideo games, Convertible snooker board, air hockey and table tennis<br />\r\nJaccuzzi available<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nPS5<br />\r\nblender<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDaily Housekeeping<br />\r\nNetflix</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'C4 unit 2, New Horizon 2 Estate, meadow hall road, Elegushi bus stop, Lekki, , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.428178700000001', '3.4892361', 'MAY2023/MC43MTM2MzgwMCAxNjgzNjIxMjEy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1318, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Children play area', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '18:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NUL