(297, 'short', NULL, '47075167', 'Exquisite 4-Bedroom Duplex | Lokogoma FCT-Abuja (Inverter)', 'House', NULL, '1601', 2, 63000.00, 75600.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supported by inverter\r\nheater\r\nblender\r\n24/7 check in\r\n\r\nNo parties\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate is 20% of the daily rate same as the late check out\r\n\r\nOne night booking is allowed and it is same as daily rate\r\n\r\nNo inbuilt speakers in the premises\r\n\r\nSmoking is not allowed but Shisha is allowed in the compound but not indoors.\r\nPeak period rate will BE Payout of 100K', '<p>This 4-bedroom home located in Abuja let you experience the magic of beauty. You walk into a beautiful well-spaced environ. If a large space is your hunt, do not snooze on this; This apartment is a luxurious one equipped with a king size bed and 3 queen size beds, in two of the bathrooms are tubs to permit a soak in after a long day and allow you to greatly water splashes. To start with, this apartment features an executive dining that can accommodate 4 persons which was next to its well-organized living room furnished with Smart TVs, beautiful scenic lighting, and comfy sofas. Two fully equipped kitchen with microwave, blender, toaster, fridge and other kitchenware&rsquo;s, Apartment enjoys 24/7 electricity supported by inverter for accommodation and ensures an effortless check in. Housekeeping is basically on request.<br />\r\nOther amenities are<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nWi-Fi,<br />\r\nIron<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nOutdoor furniture</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'House 9, Drive A, Sahara Main Estate Lokogoma, 23401, Lokogoma, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '8.978615699999999', '7.458202999999998', 'MAY2023/MC41ODg0MzAwMCAxNjgzNjIxNDg2-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1183, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 08:38:06', '2023-07-12 12:02:01');
