(298, 'short', NULL, '70078491', 'Beautiful 3-Bedroom apartment with a swimming pool and gym | Victoria Island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1460', 2, 85000.00, 102000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 check in and electricity\r\n\r\nDecember payout rate: 100,000/night\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate: Free, Subject to availability.\r\n\r\nLate check out rate: Free, subject to availability.\r\n\r\nMinimum 2nights stay.\r\n\r\nNo smoking allowed within the apartment, balcony is available for smoking.\r\n\r\nNo In-built speakers available\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot is allowed at 50,000\r\nThese apartment has master bedroom ensuite and other 2 bedrooms share one bathroom\r\n\r\nNormal rate is 85k payout', '<p>This comfortable 3 bedroom is a private apartment in a complex in v.i that is an intimately designed home with a maximum occupancy of 6. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with stunning architecture; comfy elevator to the gorgeous flowery interior design, prestigious glassware dining that can accommodate 6 persons, flowing curtains, contemporary chandeliers for lighting, a gym for cardiovascular training, a refreshing pool, children play area can allow family holidays that includes the children, a table soccer for recreational purpose, comfortable mattresses with soft natural linens, turkish made furnitures in living rooms, dining area and bedrooms and a flawless organization throughout! It has fiber optic internet wifi with 24-hour electricity, a balcony for ample light and relaxation, fully equipped kitchen with electric hubs, fancy extractor, microwave, blender and oven, and a washing machine to help with laundry. Bedrooms are with modern designs; carrera marble tiled bathroom with black fittings well furnished with water heater, toiletries- tissue paper, hand soap are generously provided. Housekeeping is done regularly. The parking space is spacious, and the automobiles are parked properly. Netflix is an option readily available. Added is a house chef on request at additional cost. Experience would be of advantage. Try it.<br />\r\nKindly note this 3 bedroom&#39;s has 2 bathroom (hence shared)</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'MAY2023/MC4zNTQwMjMwMCAxNjgzNjIyMzA0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1641, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Gym/Fitness centre', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 08:51:44', '2023-08-22 11:58:50'),
