(300, 'short', NULL, '89499845', 'Beautiful 2 Bedroom haven | Wuse 2, Abuja (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1367', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'water heater, blender\r\nnetflix\r\nThe Inverter cannot carry the AC\r\nBoard games\r\n\r\nAllows smoking\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate 5k per hour\r\n\r\nLate check out rate 5k per hour\r\n\r\nDecember daily Rate for this apartment is 80k if booked for a month it is 70k\r\n\r\none night booking allowed as same daily rate\r\n\r\nIn built speakers available with bluetooth\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot allowed for 150k\r\n\r\nBack up inverter and generator\r\n\r\nparty Rate for this apartment is 150k max 20 guests\r\n\r\nFor normal season ; We can discount 5k per booking on 80k; hence 75k and for long stay we can also discount further to 65k payout', '<p>Lovely two (2) bedroom haven with maximum guest size of 4 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, an open kitchen that is fully equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, blender, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, both rooms are well furnished with a comfortable king size bed each with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported with inverter<br />\r\nBoard games<br />\r\nBalcony</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night 