(302, 'short', NULL, '60264684', 'Beautiful 3-bedroom apartment | Lifecamp, FCT (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1562', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'HEATER\r\nBLENDER\r\n24/7 ELECTRICITY SUPPORTED WITH INVERTER AND GEN\r\n\r\n75k', '<p>The Raid flat is a lovely vacation property located in the beautiful Life Camp neighborhood of Abuja. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, two with king beds and one with a queen bed, as well as a huge living room, fully equipped kitchen, three bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people, and there is also a huge terrace and ample parking space. Check-in is available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, and electricity is provided by an inverter and a generator. Other features include Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, a washer and dryer, and WIFI access. A trial will convince</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0764785', '7.398574', 'MAY2023/MC4xMzUyNjEwMCA