 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'Yes', 'No', NULL, 'B604 Safecourt apartment, off ojulari crescent being house on the rock salem bus stop ikate lekki, , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4366922', '3.493709', 'MAY2023/MC4yOTY1ODcwMCAxNjgzNjMyNDQ2-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1190, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 11:40:46', '2023-07-03 15:57:17'),
