(321, 'short', NULL, '44778284', 'Beautiful 3-bedroom with balcony | Oniru, V.I', 'Apartment', NULL, '1573', 2, 105000.00, 126000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'All rooms ensuite- has water heater\r\n\r\nKitchen has a blender\r\nClean every other day\r\n\r\nHave Netflix\r\nNo smoking, No parties\r\n\r\nwe can do 90k payout', '<p>This homely 3-bedroom apartment is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Oniru, Victoria island. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, with three king size bed each, fully equipped kitchen, three rooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRooms are ensuite; Apartment has a water heater.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHousekeeping schedule ; Clean every other day<br />\r\nit&rsquo;s 24 hours electricity guaranteed.<br />\r\nNo smoking, No parties</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'MAY2023/MC4xMjgwNjEwMCAxNjgzNjM0Njgz-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1357, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Balcony', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 12:18:03', '2023-07-11 10:33:37'),
(322, 'short', NULL, '72045696', 'Beautiful 3-bedroom duplex with balcony and gym | Orchid, Eleganza Lekki (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1343', 2, 90000.00, 108000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Has WATER HEATER\r\n\r\nHousekeeping : every 3 days\r\nHave netflix\r\nFans are to be used during the day when on inverter.\r\n\r\nParties not allowed, No dj\r\nNo smoking \r\n\r\n90k payout', '<p>This is a well-organized 3-bedroom duplex in Orchid road. This home has a tastefully decorated living room and a fully furnished kitchen with all the necessities, including a microwave, blender, toaster, oven, freezer, and refrigerator to give it a homey feel and make cooking simple. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite (Bath shower in all room and a bathtub in the master bedroom) with home having an additional guest toilet available to ensure privacy is not compromised. 3 King-size beds made available in the duplex home. Living room and all bedrooms are furnished with TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided, if serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported with inverter<br />\r\nWater heater,<br />\r\nDSTV subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nWashing machine and iron is provided for ease of laundry<br />\r\ncleaning schedule: every 3 days<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nGym</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'House 3, Emcel Garden Along orchid hotel road Opp Mega one Plaza, Off Eleganza Lekki-Ajah Expressway, , Lekki, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.433992099999999', '3.5423318', 'MAY2023/MC45ODA2NjcwMCAxNjgzNjM0NzEx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1379, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 12:18:31', '2023-06-30 12:17:48'),
(323, 'short', NULL, '59704975', 'Lovely 2-bedroom apartment | Lekki, Epe-expressway (Close to Chevy view estate)-Solar Inverter', 'Apartment', NULL, '1509', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '20000', 'Has water heater\r\n\r\nCleaning schedule- every other day\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\nNo parties\r\nAllows smoking in the balcony\r\nMinimum of 2 days booking\r\n\r\nThe apartment has City view- express\r\n45k payout- Caution fee is 20k for this accommodation (14/8/2023)	\r\nThis apartment uses a SOLAR  inverter and generator as secondary source of  electricity. The inverter  and generator comes on automatically so you don’t have to do anything.\r\n\r\nIn the event there is no power from the national power grid at any point during your stay, the inverter will give you access to low voltage  appliances such as lights, TV and fans.The inverter will NOT work for high voltage electrical appliances such as the air conditioner, microwave ,washing machine\r\n\r\nThis apartment ENJOYS consistent  electricity from the national power grid because of the neighborhood but this is NOT guaranteed as electricity can be inconsistent sometimes , hence the provision of a SOLAR inverter & generator.\r\n\r\n* GEN schedule *\r\n\r\nThe generator powers all the high voltage appliances and  it is normally put on at 12noon - 3pm and 7pm - 5am daily if there is no power from the national grid\r\n\r\n40k payout- Caution fee is 20k for this accommodation\r\n\r\nDecember rate is 60k\r\n\r\nFor monthly booking rate is 5% discount (42750)', '<p>An opportunity to live in a stunning 2-bedroom with city view along lekki-epe expressway close to Chevron. You enter a magnificent structure with creative decorations in a tranquil setting. A tastefully decorated living area with plush sofas and decorative pillows. This apartment has a balcony. Each room has a Smart TV with great graphics and very spacious bedrooms with a king size bed and a queen size bed that makes you feel at home. This apartment includes a fully equipped kitchen, water heater, Netflix, and Wi-Fi access package.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPower arrangement<br />\r\nThis apartment uses a SOLAR inverter and generator as secondary source of electricity. In the event there is no power from the national power grid at any point during your stay, the inverter will give you access to low voltage appliances such as lights, TV and fans. The inverter will NOT work for high voltage electrical appliances such as the air conditioner, microwave, and washing machine. This apartment ENJOYS consistent electricity from the national power grid because of the neighbourhood but this is NOT guaranteed as electricity can be inconsistent sometimes, hence the provision of a SOLAR inverter &amp; generator.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nApartment rules<br />\r\nCleaning schedule- every other day<br />\r\nNo parties<br />\r\nAllows smoking in the balcony only<br />\r\nMinimum of 2 days booking</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Flat8 Icy Grey Apartment 1b ibukun awosika street off Lekki epe expressway Lekki, , Lekki, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4711277', '3.7112543', 'MAY2023/MC43OTczMTUwMCAxNjgzNjM1NDM5-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1446, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'The apartment has City view- express', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 12:30:39', '2023-09-06 11:10:59'),
(324, 'short', NULL, '17171032', 'Dazzling 3 bedroom coffee apartment | Oniru, Victoria Island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1606', 2, 100000.00, 120000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity\r\n\r\nNo in-built speakers\r\nSame rate as daily rate for one day booking\r\n\r\nFor early check in we charge N 10,000 per hour; Same goes with with late check out\r\n\r\nNo party & Smoking\r\n\r\nThe Orchad, 26 chief yesufu abiodun oniru, maroko oniru road, maroko oniru lagos\r\n\r\nDecember Payout is 130k\r\n\r\n100k payout rate;', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), gym / fitness centre, air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, garage the same building, 4 TVs, tv satellite.<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, washing machine, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '26 chief yesufu abiodun oniru, Victoria Island, , Oniru, Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.426321199999999', '3.4465906', 'MAY2023/MC45MDM2NDQwMCAxNjgzNjM1Nzkw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Sha