(329, 'short', NULL, '40227404', 'Admirable 4-bedroom self-compound | Royal pine estate, Orchid', 'House', NULL, '1574', 2, 110000.00, 132000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Water heater available\r\n\r\nKitchen has a blender\r\nCleaning is done-everyday\r\n\r\nApartment has Netflix\r\nWell organized\r\n\r\nAllows 25 guests for parties but no DJ at #200,000\r\nAllows smoking\r\nAllows one day booking', '<p>This is a well-organized 4-bedroom self-compound in Orchid road. This home has a tastefully decorated living room and a fully furnished kitchen with all the necessities, including a microwave, blender, oven, freezer, and refrigerator to give it a homey feel and make cooking simple. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite (Bath shower in all room and a bathtub in the master bedroom) with home having an additional guest toilet available to ensure privacy is not compromised. 2 King-size and 2 Queen-size beds are available in all the duplex home. Living room, lounge and master bedroom are furnished with TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided, if serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWater heater,<br />\r\nDSTV subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nSmart TVs available<br />\r\nAllows parties for 25 guests max but DJ not allowed<br />\r\nWashing machine and iron is provided for ease of laundry<br />\r\ncleaning schedule: every day<br />\r\nBalcony</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'House A block vii, plot 4 ojomu chieftancy family layout, alajapa, royal pine estate orchid road Lek, , Lekki, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4364801', '3.5427866', 'MAY2023/MC4xNjc2OTUwMCAxNjgzNjM4Nzg4-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DPRjC9sjtQc', 'Reserve', 1250, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 13:10:12', '2023-07-21 12:05:25'),
(330, 'short', NULL, '41959949', 'Classy 3-bedroom PARTY apartment with pool | Oniru, V.I', 'Apartment', NULL, '1580', 2, 120000.00, 144000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'In house Chef can be arranged\r\n\r\nAllows one day booking at same daily rate (75k)\r\n\r\nAllows party\r\n\r\nEarly check-in/Late check out rate: 5k per hour\r\n\r\nPeak period daily rate is 85k (naira) per day\r\n\r\nPeak period party Rate is 130k (naira)\r\n\r\nSmoking and Shisha is allowed but caution fee for those clients are higher.\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot is allowed. Rate is 100k (naira)\r\n\r\nNo in built speakers available with Bluetooth\r\n\r\nWe supply 24/7 electricity (generator included) all electrical appliances work\r\n\r\nParty/gathering: 15 guest (100k). \r\n16 guest to 20 guest (110k ) \r\n21 guest to 30 guest Maximum guest (120k)', '<p>The apartment is a lovely vacation and party home located at Oniru. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, with one king size bed each as well as a huge living room, fully equipped kitchen, three bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 30 people only due to risk of damages, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, toaster, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine, Garden, swimming pool, Balcony, gym and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 5 Oba Idowu Abiodun Street Oniru Estate Victoria Island, , Oniru, Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4467879', '3.4340729', 'MAY2023/MC4yNzAwNzkwMCAxNjgzNjM4MTgy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 30, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1437, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Swimming pool', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 13:16:22', '2023-08-07 10:36:24'),
(332, 'short', NULL, '81021219', 'Adorable 2-Bedroom apartment | Guzape (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1486', 2, 65000.00, 78000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'heater\r\nblender, netflix\r\n\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter\r\n\r\n65k payout', '<p>This stunning villa with a contemporary style is completely manned and magnificently equipped with comfortable furniture&rsquo;s which includes one king size bed in each room, Durable wardrobes, well finished, beautifully crafted kitchen cabinets e.tc. This property offers luxurious, air-conditioned accommodation whose 24/7 electricity is supported by inverter. In this home you enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, which includes a blender, microwave, oven alongside other relevant kitchenware&rsquo;. Large luxury styled windows and its blind to offer you privacy and control the light that enters your home. An open floor layout keeps the space feeling light and airy. This home provides a one-of-a-kind opportunity to enjoy a wonderful holiday while taking in the most breathtaking scenery and natural beauty that nature has to offer. Other amenities are Water heater in the bathroom, Balcony for evening relaxation, Netflix, and Wifi connection. This is the ideal place to visit for a vacation.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Block 2 Flat P, 1st Avenue, Federal Housing Estate Guzape. After St Anglican Church, , Guzape, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0038003', '7.505487199999999', 'MAY2023/MC4yMjMxOTAwMCAxNjgzNjM5MTE2-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1278, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 13:31:56', '2023-07-05 18:38:27'),
(335, 'short', NULL, '81573266', 'Exquisite 3-Bedroom with workspace | 1004, Victoria island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1438', 2, 80000.00, 96000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Have water heater and blender\r\n4th floor no elevator\r\n\r\nCleaning is every other day\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\nAllows one day booking\r\nwork space available\r\n\r\n80k payout', '<p>This homely 3-bedroom is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at 1004, Victoria island. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, only master bedroom is ensuite while other rooms have shared bathroom. Apartment has a fully equipped kitchen and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBlender is provided<br />\r\nCleaning schedule: Two days interval<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nWorkspace<br />\r\nNo smoking<br />\r\nAllows one day booking</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Block B5 1004 housing estate Victoria Island, , 1004 Estate, Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.439438', '3.4341034', 'MAY2023/MC4yNDc2MjkwMCAxNjgzNjQwOTI2-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-AZSU4FcQ6A', 'Reserve', 1448, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Work space available', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 14:02:06', '2023-07-07 17:29:38'),
(336, 'short', NULL, '98153487', 'Majestic 3 bedroom PARTY home | Ajah Lagos (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1333', 2, 110000.00, 132000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', '24/7 check in\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter\r\nParty (max 10 guest)\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate ; Same as Standard Rate  (65k) per night\r\n\r\nLate check out rate ; Same as Standard Rate  (65k) per night\r\n\r\nShare your peak period i.e December daily Rate for your apartment ( Same as Standard Rate (65k) per night\r\n\r\nYes One Night Booking is allowed at Standard Price Rate (65k) per night .\r\n\r\n\r\nNo Smoking allowed ,only Shisha .\r\n\r\nIn built speakers available with bluetooth\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot is allowed ; For only Photoshoot without spending the night, that\'s 40,000.\r\n\r\n65k for daily rate (110k Party payout)', '<p>This comfortable 3-bedroom Duplex in Ajah is an intimately designed home with a maximum occupancy of 5. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with stunning architecture; comfy staircase for walk-in to the gorgeous interior design, subtle colored flowing curtains, a gym for cardiovascular training, a refreshing pool, comfortable mattresses with soft natural linens regularly changed, and a flawless organization throughout! It has fiber optic internet wifi with 24-hour electricity supported by inverter, children&#39;s play area, a BBQ site for food grilling, a balcony for ample light and relaxation, fully equipped kitchen with microwave, blender and oven, and a washing machine to help with laundry. Bedrooms are well furnished with water heater, toiletries- tissue paper, hand soap are generously provided. Housekeeping is done regularly. The parking space is covered, and the automobiles are parked properly. Netflix is an option readily available. Apartment also has air hockey, snooker board and table tennis board. Experience would be of advantage. Try it.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 18 Marita court Abraham adesanya Ajah Lagos., , Ajah, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.464587400000001', '3.5725244', 'MAY2023/MC4wNDQ4ODkwMCAxNjgzMTk3NDg2-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 2513, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Children play area', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 14:15:13', '2023-07-31 09:00:28'),
(337, 'short', NULL, '75428458', 'Appealing 3-Bedroom apartment with a swimming pool | Oniru, V.I(inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1517', 2, 85000.00, 102000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Electricity is 16hrs while inverter covers the rest hours\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter\r\nblender\r\n\r\nDecember payout is 95k\r\nNo inbuilt speakers\r\nNo photoshoot allowed', '<p>This Beautiful 3 -Bedroom apartment in Oniru, V.I is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on. It accommodates 6 guests for regular stay and is in an exclusive serene neighborhood. This elegantly styled home features a beautifully organized living room well designed with premium d&eacute;cor and an equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, blender, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In addition, is a marble set dining for 4 persons. Apartment is rooms-ensuite with home having 3 baths, and 1 bathtub. A visitor toilet is provided for convenience. In this home, rooms are furnished with 2 comfortable king size bed and 1 Queen size bed, all white beddings, and plush duvets to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. All rooms are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided. If space is your hunt here is your home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWi-Fi<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nBalcony for relaxation<br />\r\nGym<br />\r\nSwimming pool</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Note-&nbsp;Electricity is 16hrs while inverter covers the rest hours</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'MAY2023/MC45NTI0NTcwMCAxNjgzNjQxODMw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=31KFWWVSUPQ', 'Reserve', 1444, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Gym/ Fitness centre', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 14:17:10', '2023-08-23 12:48:05'),
