: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '5 Abibu Adetoro street, Off Ajose Adeogun victoria island, , Victoria island, Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4301258', '3.4403241', 'MAY2023/MC4zMjI2NjQwMCAxNjgzNjU1ODYx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1328, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'wifi', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-09 18:11:01', '2023-08-24 14:22:53'),
