(355, 'short', NULL, '15504557', 'Elegant 2-Bedroom apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1528', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity\r\n\r\nRequires estate password for entry\r\nParties are not allowed\r\nMax guest for night games (10)\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate :\r\n8am- 12noon - 5k per hour\r\n\r\nLate check out till 6pm would be 15k but that depends on if I don’t have a guest coming in\r\n\r\nDecember daily Rate for your apartment: 75k\r\n\r\nOne night booking @70k\r\n\r\nSmoking allowed but not Shisha\r\n\r\nNO In-built speakers available\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot @ 120k.\r\n60k payout rate', '<p>A modern two-bedroom Private apartment in a complex located along the Novabase Lekki phase 1 axis with assured electricity 24 hours a day, seven days a week. An elevator supports a beautifully carved cottage dwelling with exquisite organization that screams originality. This two-bedroom apartment has a king-size bed in each room, allowing you to stretch out and relax with little body contact for a restful, uninterrupted night&#39;s sleep, Water heater in the baths, A fully equipped kitchen with a microwave, coffee maker, toaster, and other appliances creates an ideal environment for efficient cooking. Professional housekeeping with a washing machine on standby to take care of the laundry. This WIFI and Netflix enabled residence only opens its doors to only mini events of about 10 persons. Living room is a proper representation of divine. JSL NOVA is something you should see.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr /><quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC41NDQ1MjgwMCAxNjgzNjg0NTM0-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1364, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 02:08:54', '2023-07-10 14:37:42'),
