(363, 'short', NULL, '58979430', 'Dazzling 2-bedroom apartment with snooker board | off admiralty way, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1556', 2, 70000.00, 84000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Snooker board\r\n\r\nWater heater available\r\nblender available\r\n\r\nHousekeeping; every other day\r\nNetflix\r\nNo Dj speaker\r\n\r\nAllows smoking\r\n\r\nFor December rate is 70k\r\n\r\nAllows Photoshoot at 100k\r\n\r\n24/7 electricity\r\n\r\nAllows party @ 120k maximum of 10-15\r\nOne night allowed booking at 70k.', '<p>Adorable 2-Bedroom with maximum guest size of 4 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, a fully equipped kitchen well equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, Oven, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, room is well furnished with a comfortable king size bed each with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nSmart TVs<br />\r\nSnookerboard</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Housekeeping; every other day<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Novabase Apartment, 11 olubunmin owa streetoff admiralty way, 23401, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.447809299999999', '3.4723495', 'MAY2023/MC4yODI1MjgwMCAxNjgzNjg4ODk1-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CFFde8GwdV8', 'Reserve', 916, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 03:21:35', '2023-07-21 11:15:44'),
(364, 'short', NULL, '55413699', 'Beautiful 2-bedroom apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1587', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Parties not allowed\r\n\r\n\r\n- Early checking in and Late check out depends on the hours before and after. However we charge 50% of the daily rate. (Reach out to host)\r\n-we have sound bar speakers with Bluetooth in all our apartments\r\n- Smoking is not allowed (no form of smoking is allowed)\r\n-we don’t allow 1night booking\r\n\r\nDecember is 75k and minimum of 7 days', '<p>A tastefully finished 2 bedroom Apartment for Shortlet service with a 4 persons capacity. Apartment is styled with contemporary furnishing in a safe area situated off the most popular street in Lekki phase 1 beside the biggest indigenous chain supermarket Ebeano, a one stop mall -Aaron&#39;s mall and clubs, restaurants, bar &amp; lounges. The Apartment is brand new featuring an Elevator, 24hr Power, 2 Car Parking Spaces, Free Wifi, All Rooms Ensuite, Fully Air Conditioned, Fitted kitchen, Washing Machine, Netflix in all Rooms, 65inch TV &amp; Sound bar &amp; DSTV Premium.<br />\r\nNote: Parties and loud music are not allowed</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Olubunmi Owa Street off Admiralty way, 23401, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4468733', '3.4710386', 'MAY2023/MC43MjUzMDAwMCAxNjgzNjg5Mzcz-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1176, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 03:29:33', '2023-07-11 16:54:48'),
(365, 'short', NULL, '23461147', 'Luxury 5-bedroom Apartment  with private pool | Lekki Phase 1', 'House', NULL, '1353', 2, 190000.00, 228000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'Party for not more than 20 guests at rate 300k\r\n\r\n190k PAYOUT from 2 days upward\r\n\r\none day will be 200k\r\n\r\nDecember payout is 210k', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>villa in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 5 bedrooms and has capacity for 10 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: garden furniture, fenced garden, terrace, barbecue, iron, internet (Wi-Fi), balcony, childrens area, jacuzzi, air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, 5 fans, mosquito nets throughout the accommodation, 8 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, freezer, washing machine, dishwasher, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC41MjgzNjAwMCAxNjgzNzAwNDUy-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Private', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 902, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No',