(366, 'short', NULL, '49806124', 'Dazzling 3-bedroom apartment with swimming pool | Marwa, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1533', 2, 100000.00, 120000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment is ensuite\r\nWater heater\r\n\r\nHousekeeping is everyday\r\nNetflix\r\nNo parties\r\nNo smoking\r\nAllows one day booking at 120k\r\n\r\n100k normal rate;', '<p>This homely 3-bedroom apartment is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Marwa lekki. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. An apartment beautifully styled to a fault. The area features three bedrooms, with two king size bed each and a queen size as well as a huge living room, fully equipped kitchen, two bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\nHas shared swimming pool and Gym<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRooms are ensuite; Apartment has a water heater.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHousekeeping schedule ; every day,<br />\r\nNo smoking, No parties allowed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nit&rsquo;s 24 hours electricity guaranteed.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 3 New creation avenue, off remi olowude street Marwa bus stop, Lekki, 23401, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4311757', '3.4709729', 'MAY2023/MC41MTgyMTMwMCAxNjgzNzAxMDEw-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1368, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 06:43:30', '2023-07-07 16:10:11'),
(367, 'short', NULL, '76056922', 'Attractive 2-bedroom with swimming pool and convertible snooker| Victoria island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1568', 2, 65000.00, 78000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Swimming Pool, There\'s a general snooker board that is convertible into table tennis and air hockey\r\n\r\nKitchen has blender\r\nWifi details is pasted behind the entrance door\r\nHousekeeping is one day on-one day off\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\nThere\'s a laundry man that helps with laundry and dry-cleaning---A basket of clothes- 10kg goes for 2k\r\n\r\n65k payout- Extra 5k for 1 day booking', '<p>We have tastefully furnished apartments in the heart of VI and we love to share details with you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFacilities includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Unlimited internet<br />\r\n- Fully equipped kitchen<br />\r\n- Spacious parking<br />\r\n- Swimming pool<br />\r\n- Relaxation lounge<br />\r\n- 24 hours Power supply<br />\r\n- 24 hours Security<br />\r\n- Serene environment<br />\r\n- Gated estate<br />\r\n- Easily accessible to great spots (5 mins from landmark beach, 3 mins from the shopping mall)<br />\r\n- Netflix and DSTV<br />\r\n- Amazon prime app- (personal login)<br />\r\n- Laundry services- There&#39;s a laundry man that helps with laundry and dry-cleaning---A basket of clothes- 10kg goes for 2k<br />\r\n- Housekeeping and others<br />\r\n<br />\r\nApartment is not ensuite, the 2 bedrooms is not ensuite</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'uploads/property/JUN2023/0539629001686659004-property-JUN2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1613, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Relaxation Lounge', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 07:40:42', '2023-08-07 14:29:09'),
