(378, 'short', NULL, '64989006', 'Alluring 1bedroom apartment | Marwa, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1318', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Water heater\r\nBlender\r\n24/7 electricity\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nRuby; Dec payout is 66k\r\npayout rate =55k (12/Apr/2023)', '<p>This Adorable 1-Bedroom apartment in a storey building along Marwa Lekki axis is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 2 guests and is in a private and safe space. The cottage features a beautifully organized living room, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, boiling kettle, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. After a long day of exploring, Room is ensuite with home having bath shower available. In the room is an exceptionally comfortable king size bed to ensure pleasant rest. Living room and bedroom are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\n24/7 Wifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment<br />\r\nEase of access first floor</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 42 olabanji olajide street, Marwa bus stop lekki, 23401, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4355806', '3.4724503', 'MAY2023/MC45MjUwNzYwMCAxNjgzNzA5Nzcy-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1105, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 09:09:32', '2023-06-30 06:22:40'),
(379, 'short', NULL, '12325849', 'Lovely 2-bedroom with Open-style kitchen | Marwa, lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1389', 2, 70000.00, 84000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment is ensuite\r\nGym, There\'s a provision for gym. But the items aren\'t installed yet\r\nwater heater\r\n\r\nBlender available\r\nHouskeeping is every other day\r\nNetflix available\r\n\r\nA home in a gated estate\r\n70k payout', '<p>This homely 2-bedroom apartment is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Marwa, lekki in a a gated estate. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breath-taking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features two bedrooms, with two king size bed each, fully equipped kitchen, two bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 4 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOpen style kitchen<br />\r\nApartment is ensuite<br />\r\nwater heater<br />\r\nBlender available<br />\r\nHousekeeping is every other day<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA home in a gated estate</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC4xNjY3OTAwMCAxNjgzNzA5OTEy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1259, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Open style kitchen plan', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 09:11:52', '2023-07-03 16:07:09'),
(380, 'short', NULL, '61583411', 'Cozy 3-bedroom ocean-view apartment with swimming pool | Admiralty close, lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1584', 2, 110000.00, 132000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Water heater\r\n\r\nHas blender\r\n\r\nHousekeeping; everyday, Netflix is available\r\n\r\n8 for regular stay 15 for get together no DJ\'s no party just get together; 150K PAYOUT\r\nAllows smoking,\r\nYouTube\r\n\r\nNo additional charge for early check in, as long as the apartment is available.\r\n-But additional charge applies for late check out at N5,000 for every hour from the check out time.\r\n-December rate is 130k per night.\r\n-Yes we do allow photo shoots at 150k per night\r\n-One night booking only allowed from Monday through Thursday\r\n\r\n-Normal payout is 110k per night (discount can be considered on long stays);', '<p>This comfortable 3-bedroom house in Admiralty close lekki phase 1 located on the 2nd Floor. Made available is an elevator for easy access to the apartment. This home has a maximum occupancy of 6. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with stunning architecture to the gorgeous interior design, Outdoor furniture for relaxation, a refreshing pool, comfortable mattresses with soft natural linens, flowing curtains, and a flawless organization throughout! It has fiber optic internet Wi-Fi with 24-hour electricity, children&#39;s play area, fully equipped kitchen with microwave and oven, and a washing machine to help with laundry. The parking space is in the same building, and the automobiles are parked properly. Netflix is an option readily available. Experience would be of advantage. Try it.<br />\r\nCleaning schedule; Every other day.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki Luxury Flats 6 Admiralty close lekki phase 1, 23401, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.459662799999999', '3.4682284', 'MAY2023/MC43NTM3ODkwMCAxNjgzNzEwMjg4-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1376, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 09:18:08', '2023-07-11 12:33:27'),
(381, 'short', NULL, '85375110', 'Exquisite 2-Bedroom Apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1458', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 Electricity supported with generator\r\n\r\nAccepts 1 nights for extra 5K.\r\n\r\nWe don\'t allow parties\r\nNo smoking\r\nPets not allowed\r\n\r\n60,000N Rate.', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: internet (Wi-Fi), air conditioning throughout the house, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the independent kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, washing machine, dishwasher, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Novabase Apartment 11 olubunmi owa street, lekki phase 1,, 23401, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.446383', '3.471349', 'MAY2023/MC41MDA4NTQwMCAxNjgzNzEwOTU1-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1286, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 09:29:15', '2023-07-05 11:37:31'),
(382, 'short', NULL, '45216936', 'Elegant 1-bedroom with swimming pool and convertible snooker| Victoria island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1568', 2, 50000.00, 60000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Swimming Pool, There\'s a general snooker board that is convertible into table tennis and air hockey\r\n\r\nKitchen has blender\r\nWifi details is pasted behind the entrance door\r\nHousekeeping is one day on-one day off\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\n50k payout- Extra 5k for 1 day booking', '<p>We have tastefully furnished apartments in the heart of VI and we love to share details with you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFacilities includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Unlimited internet<br />\r\n- Fully equipped kitchen<br />\r\n- Spacious parking<br />\r\n- Swimming pool<br />\r\n- Relaxation lounge<br />\r\n- 24 hours Power supply<br />\r\n- 24 hours Security<br />\r\n- Serene environment<br />\r\n- Gated estate<br />\r\n- Easily accessible to great spots (5 mins from landmark beach, 3 mins from the shopping mall)<br />\r\n- Netflix and DSTV<br />\r\n- Amazon prime app- (personal login)<br />\r\n- Laundry services - There&#39;s a laundry man that helps with laundry and dry-cleaning---A basket of clothes- 10kg goes for 2k<br />\r\n- Housekeeping and others</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'MAY2023/MC43NzU0MzUwMCAxNjgzNzExNDM4-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1400, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Convertible Snooker', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 09:37:18', '2023-08-07 14:28:43');
