(383, 'short', NULL, '24002943', 'Pearl 3-Bedroom Apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1534', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Our December rate is 90k\r\n\r\nEarly check in is at same rate if the flat is free on time of request\r\nLate check out will attract 5k per hour\r\n\r\nWe allow one night booking at the same rate given\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\nNo in-built speakers available\r\n\r\nwe allow photoshoot\r\n150k normal rate\r\n200k December rate\r\n\r\n24/7 electricity\r\nNormal season Host rate is 75k payout', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC4xMTQyNDMwMCAxNjgzNzExODkx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1410, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 09:44:51', '2023-07-07 16:06:10'),
(384, 'short', NULL, '20031879', 'Exquisite 3-Bedroom Apartment with an outdoor plunge pool | Blue waters Oniru, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1455', 2, 127000.00, 152400.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'For the Blue Waters apartment,it’s 130k with 5% discount off the total sum for bookings over 7 days\r\n\r\n127k payout', '<p>An exceptional 3-bedroom apartment for 6 persons to experience sublime relaxation, Spacious living room. One major highlight is the plunge pool with sitting platforms to relax and have exciting views. The master bathroom provides you a comfortable king bed size, En-suite bathroom with shower and tub to relax after a long day exploring. The apartment includes a snooker board and a table tennis court for indoor recreations, wireless Internet with high speed, contemporary d&eacute;cor, and architectural works in every room that is properly air conditioned. Enjoy the fully equipped kitchen with blender, microwave, hot water kettle, cutleries with furniture&rsquo;s made of beautifully polished wood and a stunning dining table that can accommodate four persons to dine together. Beautiful is your experience in this home.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC42ODM3MjgwMCAxNjgzNzEyMDE1-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X49hq9kUT_0', 'Reserve', 1046, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 09:46:55', '2023-07-11 10:59:41'),
(387, 'short', NULL, '70179293', 'Beautiful 1-bedroom apartment | oniru estate, Victoria island (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1501', 2, 49500.00, 59400.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supported with inverter\r\n\r\nCleaning of the apartment is done every 2 days\r\n\r\n1 day booking is allowed\r\n\r\nNo party allowed\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\n\r\nNo pets allowed\r\n\r\nDecember payout rate; 1 bedroom - 54,000\r\n\r\npayout rate is 49500 per night FOR 2 WEEKS BOOKING- 40500 PER NIGHT;', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 1 bedrooms and has capacity for 2 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, 1 fan, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cleaning of the apartment is done every 2 days<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'MAY2023/MC41NjI2NzIwMCAxNjgzNzEzNzI5-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1555, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'WIFI', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 10:15:29', '2023-07-06 16:20:49'),
(388, 'short', NULL, '26758127', 'Stylish 2-bedroom apartment in Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1317', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment number is No 3. check in process is get to apartment and let the gateman know you have a reservation for the Apartment\r\n\r\nPeak periods\r\nTwo bed N68,000 (November)\r\nTwo Bed N90,000 (December-January)\r\nTwo Bed N70,000(February)\r\n\r\nEarly Check in November to February N10,000 3hrs (11am - 2pm) extra is N5,000\r\nLate check Out N10,000 3hrs (12 - 3) extra is N5,000\r\n\r\nI will not be accepting one day booking in December Minimum is 3 days\r\n\r\nFlat 3 2 bed is 60k weekend rate and Normal rate 65k\r\n\r\nMonthly rate- 2 bed 10k off payout', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air conditioning throughout the house, open-air parking the same building, 1 fan, 3 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the gas open plan kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC42MTgzNTYwMCAxNjgzNzE0Nzc1-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', 5.0, 1, NULL, 'Book_now', 1009, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2023-05-10 10:32:55', '2023-09-05 17:27:01'),
(389, 'short', NULL, '54548694', 'Modern 1-Bedroom Apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1317', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment number is No 1. check in process is get to apartment and let the gateman know you have a reservation for Apartment 1\r\n\r\nPeak periods\r\nOne Bed N58,000(November)\r\nOne Bed N65,000 (December-January)\r\nOne Bed N58,000(February)\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly Check in November to February N10,000 3hrs (11am - 2pm) extra is N5,000\r\nLate check Out N10,000 3hrs (12 - 3) extra is N5,000\r\n\r\nI will not be accepting one day booking in December Minimum is 3 days\r\n\r\nNormal season; One bed green chair flat 1 N55,000 payout 3/4/2023)\r\n\r\nMonthly rate- 1 bed 5k off payout', '<p>This Modern 1 bedroom apartment is a contemporary apartment in the heart of Lekki Phase 1. It is in close proximity to the entertainment and business districts of Victoria Island and Ikoyi alike. it is located in a serene gated estate which assures you of safety at all times. Modern conveniences include 24/7 hours electricity supported by generator, fitted kitchen, WIFI, Smart TVs amongst others. Everything you need for a great stay can be found at this location.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 14 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n13 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTo avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, '8 Yeye olofin street off admiralty way Lekki phase 1, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4439407', '3.4615134', 'MAY2023/MC4zNzQxODMwMCAxNjgzNzE0ODgy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', 5.0, 1, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EmsTijcOVdQ', 'Book_now', 838, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 10:34:42', '2023-09-05 17:24:09'),
(390, 'short', NULL, '54143896', 'Exquisite 3-bedroom apartment | 1004, Victoria Island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1318', 2, 80000.00, 96000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'PARTY NOT ALLOWED\r\n\r\nDecember rate; Obamilla (3 bedroom); payout 80k\r\nCleaning is done every 3 days\r\n\r\nThese apartment has master bedroom ensuite and other 2 bedrooms share one bathroom\r\nTwo 3Bed, 1004 VI Daily Rate- 80,000 As a 2Bed Daily Rate- 70,000 Refundable Caution 50,000', '<p>The apartment in Lagos has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: lift, iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, 3 TVs, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, freezer, washing machine, dryer, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided. These apartment has master bedroom ensuite and other 2 bedrooms share one bathroom</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cleaning is done every 3 days</p>\r\n\r\n<p>note:&nbsp;These apartment has master bedroom ensuite and other 2 bedrooms share one bathroom</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'MAY20