 booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC43NTU2MzgwMCAxNjgzNzIwNzM0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1389, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Alarm', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 12:12:14', '2023-06-30 09:50:15'),
(400, 'short', NULL, '58110120', 'Beautiful 3-bedroom apartment | Oniru, V.I', 'Apartment', NULL, '1394', 2, 81000.00, 97200.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'HOST PAYOUT 81,000;', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), balcony, air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, freezer, washing machine, dishwasher, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'MAY2023/MC43NjU5NjAwMCAxNjgzNzIxMTky-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1403, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'WIFI', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 12:19:52', '2023-07-03 18:52:05'),
(401, 'short', NULL, '67233816', 'Alluring 3-bedroom smart home with PS5 and Video games| Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1459', 2, 90000.00, 108000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Rooms ensuite\r\n\r\nAmenities available: Video games, Board games, Ps5 available\r\n\r\nHas water heater\r\nKitchen has blender\r\n\r\nCleaning: every 3 days\r\nNetflix\r\nFirst floor no elevator\r\nNo smoking\r\nMinimum of 2 days booking\r\n\r\nAutomation(alexa smart home)\r\nResponsible for check in:Patrick- 08032505856 07016377554\r\n\r\ncheck in time is 3pm while Check out time is 12pm\r\n\r\n90,000 payout ; EASTER IS 100K PAYOUT\r\n\r\nFor monthly booking payout- 85k per night/', '<p>This luxury 3-bedroom smart home is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Lekki phase 1. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breath-taking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, with three king size bed each, fully equipped kitchen, Apartment is ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people, with ample parking space. Other features include: Video games, Board games, Ps5, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine and WIFI access. A trial will convince.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRooms are ensuite; Apartment has a water heater.<br />\r\nHousekeeping schedule ; every three days,<br />\r\nNo parties allowed.<br />\r\nit&rsquo;s 24 hours electricity guaranteed.<br />\r\nFirst floor no elevator<br />\r\n<br />\r\nApartment check in time is 3pm while Check out time is 12pm</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Flat 3 The W residence block 79 flat 25 itumo ogbonna street Lekki phase 1, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4435714', '3.4799076', 'MAY2023/MC45MjM3MTkwMCAxNjgzNzIyMjI0-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1474, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Video and Board games,', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 12:37:04', '2023-09-06 09:42:10'),
(402, 'short', NULL, '50286732', 'Beautiful 2-bedroom Apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1379', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supply supported with generator\r\n\r\nDecember payout is 65k\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate - Early check in happens when there is no client in the apartment.\r\n1am to 11am - half of the money paid per day.\r\n11am upwards - free\r\n\r\nLate Check out - 12:30 noon to 1pm - free.\r\nBeyond 1pm is complete 1 day booking payment because we may have lost a request due to that, as clients are not patient enough to check in late afternoon.\r\n\r\nNo speakers available in the apartment\r\n\r\nSmoking not allowed except it extremely controlled and no smoking of substances that will leave a bad smell or stench in the apartment\r\n\r\nIt\'s a minimum of 2 nights.\r\n\r\nWe don\'t allow photoshoot\r\nNormal season Host Payout 60k (9th/dec/2022)', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Novabase Apartments, 17 Olubunmi Owa Street off Admiralty Way Lekki Phase 1. Closest Landmark - Ebeano Supermarket, Chrisland School, CBC Tower, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4463922', '3.470918', 'MAY2023/MC42NTAzODYwMCAxNjgzNzIzMjAw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1287, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 12:53:20', '2023-07-03 14:00:18'),
(403, 'short', NULL, '68826291', 'Admirable 2-bedroom apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1369', 2, 65000.00, 78000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'All ensuite\r\n\r\nwater heater, Netflix\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\nLate checkout is 10k per hour\r\n\r\n24/7 electric supply yes .with ac working\r\n\r\nDecember rate payout is 75k\r\n\r\nPhotoshot yes\r\nCost 90k\r\n\r\nInbuilt speakers or Bluetooth speakers \r\n\r\nPayout 65k', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: lift, iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking, 3 TVs, tv satellite.<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, freezer, washing machine, dishes/cutlery and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '2N Novabase Apartment, 11 olubunmi owa street, by ebeano supermarket lekki phase 1 Lagos, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4463922', '3.470918', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0014993001684495776-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rese