(406, 'short', NULL, '53337890', 'Comfy 1-bedroom apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1475', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'water heater available\r\n\r\nCleaning schedule; every other day\r\nNetflix available\r\n\r\nFirst floor. No elevator\r\n\r\n\r\nDecember rate: 60k\r\n\r\nParty not allowed\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot: 70k\r\n\r\n24/7 power..no inverter\r\n\r\nOne night booking: 70k\r\nPayout 55k', '<p>This comfortable 1 bedroom in Lekki phase 1 that is an intimately designed home with a maximum occupancy of 2. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with stunning architecture to the interior design, lovely curtains, comfortable mattress with soft natural linens, a flawless organization throughout! It has fiber optic internet wifi with 24-hour electricity, fully equipped kitchen with microwave, blender and oven, and a washing machine to help with laundry. Housekeeping is done regularly. Netflix is an option readily available. Experience would be of advantage. Try it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cleaning schedule; every other day<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC42MTk4NTQ