(408, 'short', NULL, '73827089', 'Open Plan Studio Apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1317', 2, 40000.00, 48000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'The bedroom is opened to the living room, light is supported with generator.\r\n\r\nstudio is 3 days booking allowed\r\nNo smoking ; Only Shisha Allowed\r\nFor other smoking guest should step outside\r\nOne day booking is 60k\r\nTwo days rate 45k\r\n\r\nPeak periods\r\nOne Bed N40,000(November)\r\nOne Bed N50,000 (December-January)\r\nOne Bed N45,000(February)\r\nEarly Check in November to February N10,000 3hrs (11am - 2pm) extra is N5,000\r\nLate check Out N10,000 3hrs (12 - 3) extra is N5,000\r\n\r\nI will not be accepting one day booking in December Minimum is 3 days\r\nMonthly rate- 5k off', '<p>This &quot;Open Space&quot; studio apartment is a contemporary apartment in the heart of Lekki Phase 1. The bedroom and living room are in an Open Space. It is in close proximity to the entertainment and business districts of Victoria Island and Ikoyi alike. it is located in a serene gated estate which assures you of safety at all times. Modern conveniences include 24/7 hours electricity supported by generator, fitted kitchen, WIFI, Smart TVs amongst others. Everything you need for a great stay can be found at this location.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, '8 yeye olofin street Lekki phase 1, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4439407', '3.4615134', 'MAY2023/MC44NzkwNzMwMCAxNjgzNzI4NTA3-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', 5.0, 1, NULL, 'Book_now', 1018, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 14:21:47', '2023-09-06 11:58:20'),
(411, 'short', NULL, '22212783', 'Enchanting 1-bedroom apartment | Marwa, lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1389', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'water heater, blender\r\n24/7 electricity supply netflix\r\n\r\nDecember rates ; additional 10k (60k payout)\r\n\r\nwe don’t take 1 night,(minimum of 2 days)\r\n\r\nSmoking is allowed, but on a condition, if anything gets burnt they’ll replace it.\r\n\r\nWe have speakers at the 4 units, but they’re disconnected cos clients make a lot of noise with it. But we can connect it for certain clients on conditions(no noise)\r\n\r\nPhotoshoots are allowed +10k, no crowd and no placing of things on the wall/table/chair that might dent or stain It.\r\n\r\n55K PAYOUT', '<p>This Adorable 1-Bedroom cottage in Marwa, Lekki with maximum guest size of 3 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, an open kitchen that is fully equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, toaster, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, room is well furnished with a comfortable King size bed with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided. We don&rsquo;t take 1 night,(minimum of 2 days)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nBalcony</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'I