(419, 'short', NULL, '06679901', 'Cozy 1-bedroom apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1587', 2, 40000.00, 48000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supply supported with generator\r\n\r\nParties not allowed\r\n\r\n- Early checking in and Late check out depends on the hours before and after. However we charge 50% of the daily rate. (Reach out to host)\r\n-we have sound bar speakers with Bluetooth in all our apartments\r\n- Smoking is not allowed (no form of smoking is allowed)\r\n-we don’t allow 1night booking\r\n\r\nDecember is 60k and minimum of 7 days\r\n\r\n40k payout (21/3/2023)', '<p>A tastefully finished 1 bedroom Apartment for Shortlet service with a 2 person capacity. Styled with contemporary furnishing in a safe area situated off the most popular street in Lekki phase 1 beside the biggest indigenous chain supermarket Ebeano, a one stop mall -Aaron&#39;s mall and clubs, restaurants, bar &amp; lounges. The Apartment is brand new featuring an Elevator, 24/7 electricity supply supported with generator, 2 Car Parking Spaces, Free Wifi, All Rooms Ensuite, Fully Air Conditioned, Fitted kitchen, Washing Machine, Netflix in all Rooms, 65inch TV &amp; Sound bar &amp; DSTV Cable Premium.<br />\r\nNote: Parties and loud music are not allowed</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Olubunmi Owa Street off Admiralty way, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4475067', '3.4670381', 'MAY2023/MC4zOTc1ODAwMCAxNjgzNzM1NzMw-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1470, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 16:22:10', '2023-07-11 16:46:53'),
(420, 'short', NULL, '08492496', 'Classy studio with Open style kitchen plan and a garden | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1318', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Swimming Pool, Swimming pool not functional at the time of inspection\r\n\r\nHas water heater and blender in kitchen\r\nHousekeeping is every 3 days\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\nOpenstyle kitchen\r\n45k payout', '<p>This classy studio is located in Lekki phase 1. This home is a beautifully carved cottage with exquisite organization that screams originality. Has a king-size bed, allowing you to stretch out and relax with little body contact for a restful, uninterrupted night&#39;s sleep, Water heater in the bath, A fully equipped kitchen with a microwave, Oven, and other appliances creates an ideal environment for efficient cooking. This space is a proper representation of divine.<br />\r\nAmenities include;<br />\r\n- 24hours power<br />\r\n- Internet<br />\r\n- Within a secured estate<br />\r\n- Uniformed security<br />\r\n- Laundry service<br />\r\n-DSTV and Netflix<br />\r\n- Housekeeping is every 3 days<br />\r\n- Proximity to supermarkets, pharmacy, and fashion stores, etc.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC41MTczMzAwMCAxNjgzNzM3NTMz-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1542, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Open style kitchen plan', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 16:52:13', '2023-06-30 06:22:50'),
(422, 'short', NULL, '36923562', 'Luxuriously-styled 2 bedroom apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1642', 2, 81000.00, 97200.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '4 for regular stay 20 for parties\r\nblender\r\nwater heater\r\n\r\n24/7 electricity\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nHere is our proposed payout rates for December:\r\n\r\nHouse 1 (2 bedroom Terrace Duplex);\r\nRegular booking: 120k\r\nParty booking: 300k\r\n\r\nDiscount available for only bookings above 7 days.\r\n\r\nA charge of 20k for every 30 minutes for late check out\r\n81K NORMAL PAYOUT (updated party price is 200,000.)', '<p>This Adorable 2-Bedroom apartment in Lekki phase 1 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 4 guests for regular stay. This home is in a private and safe space. The elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room with modern d&eacute;cor and comfortable sofas and furniture&rsquo;s, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, oven, toaster, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite having bath showers. Guest toilet is available to ensure maximum privacy is not bridged. In this home, rooms are furnished with a comfortable king size beds except for a room with a queen size bed to ensure pleasant rest. Living room, bedroom and lounge upstairs are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided. This apartment has a bar area and a DJ boot that can be rented to guests. It is a perfect choice for parties.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\n24/7 Wifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 10 Dr Adewale oshin street off fola osibo lekki phase 1, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4405754', '3.4785237', 'MAY2023/MC43NjI5MTAwMCAxNjgzNzYzMTU4-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1200, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-10 23:59:18', '2023-07-14 13:12:55'),
