tice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '003 Dcs street, U3 Estate, marwa bus stop Lekki, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4311757', '3.4709729', 'MAY2023/MC40OTcyNzQwMCAxNjgzNzY3NTMy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1352, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'open style kitchen', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-11 01:12:12', '2023-07-03 16:24:56'),
(426, 'short', NULL, '73393975', 'Classy 3-bedroom apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1318', 2, 135000.00, 162000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '1 day booking not allowed\r\n\r\n10% discount on a week and above bookings\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot Rate 150k\r\n\r\nCleaning is done every 3 days\r\n\r\nDecember rate is 140k\r\n\r\n3Bed, Lekki Phase 1 (13/1/23) Daily Rate- 135,000 As a 2Bed Daily Rate- 120,000 Caution fee 50,000', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), childrens area, gym / fitness centre, air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC42NDk2MDgwMCAxNjgzNzkzNjEx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1395, 'No',