(428, 'short', NULL, '60332168', 'Lovely 1-bedroom | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1318', 2, 53000.00, 63600.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Has a designated area for smoking\r\n\r\nCleaning is done every 3 days\r\n\r\nDecember payout is 54k\r\n\r\npayout rate =53k (12/apr/2023)', '<p>This Lovely 1 bedroom apartment is a contemporary apartment in the heart of Lekki phase 1. The maximum number of guests is 3. it is located in a serene gated estate which assures you of safety at all times. Modern conveniences include 24/7 hours electricity, fitted kitchen, WIFI, Smart TVs amongst others. Everything you need for a great stay can be found at this location.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cleaning is done every 3 days<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC4zOTczMTUwMCAxNjgzNzk1NjY1-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1497, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-11 09:01:05', '2023-06-30 06:14:33'),
(429, 'short', NULL, '64236621', 'Executive 1-bedroom apartment with an outdoor pool | Lekki phase 1(inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1318', 2, 50000.00, 60000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Heater & blender available.\r\n\r\n24/ 7 check-in & electricity supported by inverter\r\n\r\nNetflix available\r\n\r\npayout rate =50k (1/march/2023); 99-7 is to be booked as a one bed', '<p>A stunning destination villa with a contemporary style and well-crafted furniture. This property offers luxurious, air-conditioned accommodation&nbsp;with 24/7 electricity supported by inverter&nbsp;and a long swimming pool with seating platforms. Enjoy the fully equipped kitchen, which includes a blender, microwave, and toaster.&nbsp;For an outstanding private vacation, this spacious and modern villa is completely manned and magnificently equipped with sufficient lighting. Large windows and an open floor layout keep the space feeling light and airy. These homes provide a one-of-a-kind opportunity to enjoy a wonderful holiday while taking in the most breathtaking scenery and natural beauty that nature has to offer. Water heater, Netflix, and Wifi connection are among the additional features. This is the ideal place to visit for a vacation.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Taiye Olowu street off Victoria Arobieke street lekki phase 1, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4458689', '3.473996', 'MAY2023/MC42MDkyOTgwMCAxNjgzNzk3Nzgw-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 938, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-11 09:36:20', '2023-06-30 06:14:38'),
(431, 'short', NULL, '82758657', 'Beautiful 2-bedroom cottage with snooker | Lekki phase 1 (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1571', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Snooker board\r\nwater heater blender\r\nnetflix\r\nyes, Only living room and master bedroom has smart tv\r\n\r\n\r\nDecember daily Rate for your apartment 70k.\r\n\r\nAllows one night booking at 70k.\r\n\r\nNo smoking.\r\n\r\n24/7 with inverter.\r\n\r\nNo parties allowed. ( can allow Small social gathering, max 10 people)\r\n80k for normal season and 100k for December\r\n\r\nNo DJ with all equipment.\r\n60k payout without commission;', '<p>Adorable 2-Bedroom with maximum guest size of 4 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, a fully equipped kitchen well equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, Oven, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, room is well furnished with a comfortable king size bed and Queen size bed each with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nSmart TVs<br />\r\nSnookerboard</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 25 Ogidi crescent, lekki phase 1 ., , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4535693', '3.4748771', 'MAY2023/MC41Nzc1MjYwMCAxNjgzNzk4OTUw-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1409, 'No', NULL, 'Only living room and master bedroom has smart tv', 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-11 09:55:50', '2023-07-11 10:04:54'),
