(464, 'short', NULL, '13130178', 'Attractive 2 bedroom PARTY apartment | Admiralty Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1513', 2, 120000.00, 144000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', '24/7 electricity\r\nMulti level security system\r\n\r\nparty (10 guests max)\r\nAllows 1 day booking at same daily rate FOR SHORT STAY\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate: - 10k per hour (provided the apartment is vacant)\r\nLate check out rate - 10k per hour (provided the apartment is not booked)\r\n\r\nOur December payout rate is 60k\r\nDecember and January party Rate (130k)\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\n\r\nAre In built speakers available with bluetooth in your apartment? Yes\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot allowed at 90k\r\n\r\nNO Dj allowed\r\nFor monthly booking payout- 55k per night', '<p>This Adorable 2-Bedroom apartment Lekki Phase 1 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 10 guests for parties and is in a private and safe space supported by an elevator (Home allows parties with 20 max). This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room with excellent and modern d&eacute;cor with a touch of sophisticated lightings, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a fitted cooker top, microwave, blender, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook supported by a marble dinning set. Apartment is rooms-ensuite with home having 2 bath and a visitor toilet for convenience. In this home, rooms are furnished with a comfortable king size bed each, all white beddings, and plush duvets to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. All rooms are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment<br />\r\nMulti-level security system<br />\r\nParty home (20 guests max)<br />\r\nWashing machine and dryer<br />\r\nAllows a day booking</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '1c Novabase Apartment 11 olubunmi owa street opposite cbc towers off admiralty way lekki phase 1, 23401, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.446383', '3.471349', 'MAY2023/MC4yMzcwNDUwMCAxNjgzNzI1ODQ4-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uEL73-xHJvg', 'Reserve', 1371, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Multi level security system available', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-19 11:24:38', '2023-09-06 08:05:32'),
(465, 'short', NULL, '92825878', 'Admirable 4 bedroom PARTY apartment | Royal pine estate, Orchid', 'Apartment', NULL, '1574', 2, 200000.00, 240000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'Water heater available\r\n\r\nKitchen has a blender\r\nCleaning is done-everyday\r\n\r\nApartment has Netflix\r\nWell organized\r\n\r\nAllows 25 guests for parties but no DJ at #200,000\r\nAllows smoking\r\nAllows one day booking', '<p>This is a well-organized 4-bedroom self-compound in Orchid road. This home has a tastefully decorated living room and a fully furnished kitchen with all the necessities, including a microwave, blender, oven, freezer, and refrigerator to give it a homey feel and make cooking simple. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite (Bath shower in all room and a bathtub in the master bedroom) with home having an additional guest toilet available to ensure privacy is not compromised. 2 King-size and 2 Queen-size beds are available in all the duplex home. Living room, lounge and master bedroom are furnished with TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided, if serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWater heater,<br />\r\nDSTV subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nSmart TVs available<br />\r\nAllows parties for 25 guests max but DJ not allowed<br />\r\nWashing machine and iron is provided for ease of laundry<br />\r\ncleaning schedule: every day<br />\r\nBalcony</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'House A block vii, plot 4 ojomu chieftancy family layout, alajapa, royal pine estate orchid road Lek, , Lekki, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4364801', '3.5427866', 'MAY2023/MC4xNjc2OTUwMCAxNjgzNjM4Nzg4-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 25, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1390, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-19 13:46:10', '2023-07-11 10:40:25'),
