(472, 'short', NULL, '87516524', 'Ultra-Modern 3-bedroom apartment with an outdoor pool and a Gym | Rumens road, ikoyi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1356', 2, 170000.00, 204000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'Landmark: Ikoyi Marriage Registry Falomo\r\n24/7 electricity\r\nInternational cable stick & Netflix\r\nErrands services, laundry services, catering service\r\n6guest for regular stay\r\n\r\n\r\nSECURITY DEPOSIT FEE: Refundable\r\n\r\nCasual Security Deposit: N100,000\r\n\r\nYou can book as a 3 bed, 2 bed and 1 bed \r\n3bed payout- 170k\r\n2 bed- 130k\r\n1 bed- 100k\r\n\r\nour monthly discount is 20%', '<p>A residence where luxury is offered at pocket-friendly costs. This Luxurious 3 -Bedroom apartment in Ikoyi is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on. It accommodates 6guest for regular stay in an exclusive serene neighborhood. This fully fitted home features an elevator for access, a beautifully organized living room with premium home decor and a touch of sophisticated lightings, super comfy furniture&rsquo;s, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, oven, blender, toaster, juicer, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. Apartment is rooms-ensuite with home having 3 baths and a visitor toilet for convenience. In this home, rooms are furnished with a comfortable king size bed each, all white beddings, and plush duvets to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. All rooms are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nInternational cable stick &amp; Netflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment<br />\r\nMulti-level security system<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nDaily housekeeping<br />\r\nPlay area for kids<br />\r\nBoard games,<br />\r\nTable soccer<br />\r\nGym<br />\r\nSwimming pool<br />\r\nBalcony for relaxation<br />\r\nServices available on request; Errands services, laundry services, catering service</p>\r\n\r\n<p>N; B Has an office space&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.449999999999999', '3.433333', 'MAY2023/MC45NzA2MDYwMCAxNjgzNTQ5MzA5-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1341, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'International cable stick, Table soccer', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-23 04:37:26', '2023-09-01 10:49:52'),
