(484, 'short', NULL, '87074831', 'Elegant 1-bedroom apartment| Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1389', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'water heater, blender\r\ncard entry kind of lock\r\n24/7 electricity supply and netflix\r\n\r\nwe don’t take 1 night,(minimum of 2 days)\r\n\r\nSmoking is allowed, but on a condition, if anything gets burnt they’ll replace it.\r\n\r\nWe have speakers at the 3 units, but they’re disconnected cos clients make a lot of noise with it. But we can connect it for certain clients on conditions(no noise)\r\n\r\nPhotoshoots are allowed +10k, no crowd and no placing of things on the wall/table/chair that might dent or stain it\r\n\r\n1 openstyle kitchen\r\nHousekeeping ; every 3 days\r\n\r\n55k/night', '<p>This Adorable 1-Bedroom in Marwa, Lekki with maximum guest size of 2 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, an open style kitchen that is fully equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, toaster, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, room is well furnished with a comfortable King size bed with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided. We don&rsquo;t take 1 night,(minimum of 2 days). Room is ensuite<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nBalcony</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking wi