(485, 'short', NULL, '38246001', 'Exquisite 4-Bedroom with swimming pool and gym | Eleganza lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1447', 2, 90000.00, 108000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '8 guest for regular stay 20 for parties no DJ\r\nblender netflix\r\n\r\nApartment has water heater\r\nCleaning schedule is everyday\r\n\r\nYes allows smoking\r\n\r\nDJ isn’t allowed at all\r\n\r\none night booking at same daily rate given\r\n80k monthly rate\r\n\r\n90k for daily rate and 150k for party', '<p>This is a well-organized 4-bedroom terrace in Orchid road. This home has a tastefully decorated living room and a fully furnished kitchen with all the necessities, including a microwave, blender, toaster, , freezer, and refrigerator to give it a homey feel and make cooking simple. After a long day of exploring, Rooms are ensuite (Bath shower in all room and a bathtub in the master bedroom) with home having an additional guest toilet available to ensure privacy is not compromised. 4 King-size beds made available in the duplex home. Living room and all bedrooms are furnished with TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided, if serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment include.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWater heater,<br />\r\nDSTV subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nWashing machine and iron is provided for ease of laundry<br />\r\ncleaning schedule: every day<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nSwimming pool<br />\r\nGym</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0167294001685102404-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=llpeSCtJnVM', 'Reserve', 1096, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 12:00:04', '2023-07-10 12:14:09'),
(486, 'short', NULL, '04204867', 'Elegant 2-bedroom Apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1379', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supply with generator\r\n\r\nDecember payout rate is 65k\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate - Early check in happens when there is no client in the apartment.\r\n1am to 11am - half of the money paid per day.\r\n11am upwards - free\r\n\r\nLate Check out - 12:30 noon to 1pm - free.\r\nBeyond 1pm is complete 1 day booking payment because we may have lost a request due to that, as clients are not patient enough to check in late afternoon.\r\n\r\nNo speakers available in the apartment\r\n\r\nSmoking not allowed except it extremely controlled and no smoking of substances that will leave a bad smell or stench in the apartment\r\n\r\nIt\'s a minimum of 2 nights.\r\n\r\nWe don\'t allow photoshoot\r\n\r\nNormal season Host Payout 60k (9th/dec/2022)', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong>&nbsp;has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Novabase Apartments, 17 Olubunmi Owa Street off Admiralty Way Lekki Phase 1. Closest Landmark - Ebeano Supermarket, Chrisland School, CBC Tower, 23401, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4463922', '3.470918', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0056427001685103410-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1081, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 12:16:50', '2023-07-03 14:00:07'),
