(489, 'short', NULL, '59293124', 'Enchanting 1-bedroom apartment | Freedom way ikate lekki (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1402', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Landmark ; VFS Lekki\r\nNetflix & YouTube\r\n\r\nEstate has tennis and basketball pitch.\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter & check in\r\n\r\n21 hrs uninterrupted supply.. if NEPA comes between the 3hrs there would be light.\r\n\r\nminimum of 2 days booking\r\n\r\nMaximum number of guests is 2\r\n\r\nDecember 1 bed - N60k\r\n\r\n45k payout rate', '<p>This Beautiful 1-Bedroom private apartment at Freedom way ikate lekki is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 24/7 check in by host and accommodates 3 persons. The cottage features a beautifully organized living room, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a, microwave, oven, blender, and refrigerator. After a long day of exploring, room provides exceptionally comfortable king size bed. Living room and bedroom is furnished with smart Tv hence viewing is made easy. If serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.<br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported by inverter (21 hrs uninterrupted supply. if NEPA comes between the 3hrs there would be light)<br />\r\nNetflix &amp; YouTube<br />\r\nEstate has tennis and basketball pitch<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nHigh speed Wifi and many more</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Flat 10 Lsdpc Housing Estate, Freedom way by ikate bus stop lekki, 23401, Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.434178999999999', '3.4909571', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0840143001685104477-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1095, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Basketball pitch', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 12:34:37', '2023-07-04 07:14:43');
