(491, 'short', NULL, '62995616', 'Beautiful 3-bedroom apartment with balcony and estate gym | 1004 Estate, Victoria Island', 'Apartment', NULL, '1424', 2, 70000.00, 84000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Has water heater\r\n\r\nBlender is provided\r\nCleaning schedule: Twice a week\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nThe tv at the lounge is not smart\r\nLandmark is :Law school\r\n\r\nthe estate has a tennis/basketball court\r\n\r\nSmoking is allowed as far as nothing is damaged within the property.\r\n3 days minimum\r\n\r\nCan list as 1, 2 and 3 bed\r\n1 bed - 50k\r\n2 bed - 60k\r\n3 bed - 70k\r\n\r\nNormal payout is 70k', '<h2>Accommodation</h2>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>Description</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We each need a place to call home and for comfort, we need a place of safety for good health and for this life to really be good - a heaven rather than a hell. This homely 3-bedroom is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Victoria island. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, only master bedroom is ensuite while other rooms have shared bathroom. Apartment has a fully equipped kitchen and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people. Other features include Netflix with 4 smart TVs in the apartment (The TV at the lounge is not smart) Washing machine and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBlender is provided<br />\r\nCleaning schedule: Twice a week<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\nThe estate has a pool and tennis/basketball court</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0737520001685106478-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1036, 'No', NULL, 'The tv at the lounge is not smart', 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Basketball court,', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 13:07:58', '2023-07-04 12:03:52'),
(492, 'short', NULL, '32687671', 'Comfy 2-bedroom apartment | Marwa, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1464', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Open style kitchen\r\n\r\nRooms are ensuite; Apartment has a water heater and blender and Netflix\r\n\r\nHousekeeping; every other day,\r\nNo smoking, No parties\r\nOne day booking at same rate\r\n\r\n80k december rate\r\n\r\nLate check out/ Early check in—Like 10k it depend how late.\r\n\r\nDecember is 80k, — normal season - 75k\r\n\r\n— We dnt have inverter yet only generator and light in our area is very ok.\r\n\r\nit’s 24 hours , internet , smart tv and dstv.\r\n75000 normal payout', '<p>This homely apartment is a lovely vacation and shortstay home located at Marwa lekki. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. An apartment so spacious to a fault. The area features two bedrooms, with one king size bed each as well as a huge living room, fully equipped kitchen with an open style design, two bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 4 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and master bedroom, washing machine, Children play area and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\nOpen style kitchen<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRooms are ensuite; Apartment has a water heater and blender.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHousekeeping schedule ; every other day,<br />\r\nNo smoking, No parties allowed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nit&rsquo;s 24 hours electricity guaranteed.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0818456001685107019-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', '2023-05-26', '2023-05-27', 'None', '2023-05-26', '2023-05-31', 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1103, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Open style kitchen plan', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 13:17:00', '2023-07-05 12:38:28'),
(493, 'short', NULL, '86538640', 'Stunning 2-Bedroom Apartment | Elf bus stop, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1484', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supply supported with generator\r\n\r\nCleaning is done once a week or as requested by guest\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\nNo pets\r\nNo party\r\n\r\nDecember rate is 72k\r\n\r\npromo -45k(8/8/23)\r\nFor monthly payout- 40k per night which is 1.2M monthly', '<p>This apartment in Lekki has 2 bedrooms but shares toilet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), gym / fitness centre, air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the gas kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven, freezer, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils, toaster and kettle are provided.<br />\r\nThis apartment is a 2 bed with a shared bathroom (kindly note)</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 30 ayodele odubiyi street off oriwu street elf bus stop lekki., , Lekki, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.431765299999999', '3.4749734', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0652073001685108052-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', '2023-05-27', '2023-05-31', 'None', '2023-05-27', '2023-05-30', 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1041, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Gym/ Fitness centre', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 13:34:12', '2023-09-06 07:59:38'),
(494, 'short', NULL, '90509836', 'Beautiful 2-Bedroom Apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1458', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Host Payout : 60k per night', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lekki</strong> has 2 bedrooms and has capacity for 4 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: internet (Wi-Fi), air conditioning throughout the house, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0105649001685108942-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1006, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '18:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 13:49:02', '2023-07-05 11:37:15'),
(499, 'short', NULL, '49674425', 'Lovely 2 bedroom apartment | Orchid, Eleganza lekki (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1141', 2, 50000.00, 60000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'has blender and water heater\r\n\r\ncleaning is every other day\r\n\r\nNETFLIX\r\nHOUSEKEEPING- EVERY OTHER DAY\r\nLiving room and masters bedroom HAS tv\r\n\r\nNo smoking, No party\r\nAllows a day booking\r\nSmart curtains, smart door lock, smart TV, broadband internet and fully equipped kitchen', '<h2>Accommodation</h2>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h3>Description</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>An opportunity to live in a stunning 2-bedroom in Eleganza, lekki. You enter a magnificent structure with creative decorations in a tranquil setting. A tastefully decorated living area with plush sofas and decorative pillows. This apartment has a balcony. Living room and masters bedroom has a Smart TV with great graphics and a very spacious bedroom with king size beds that makes you feel at home. This apartment includes a fully equipped kitchen, inverter-powered electricity, Netflix, and Wi-Fi access package.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCleaning is every other day<br />\r\nNo smoking, No party<br />\r\nAllows a day booking<br />\r\nSmart curtains and smart door lock are features available</p>', NULL, NULL, 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Cluster A E4 Dunvale Estate Coleman nwafor street off orchid road eleganza bus stop lekki, 23401, Select Area, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4470037', '3.5444611', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0622086001685110019-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1000, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '15:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2023-05-26 14:06:59', '2023-05-26 14:09:28'),
(500, 'short', NULL, '21376925', 'Elegant 2-bedroom duplex | Parkview, Ikoyi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1507', 2, 120000.00, 144000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'All rooms ensuite\r\n\r\nHave water heater\r\nApartment kitchen has blender\r\n\r\nHost cleans; every 3 days\r\nHave Netflix\r\n\r\nMinimum of 3 Days .\r\nTelevision is in master bedroom has TV, Living room has tv, Only living room has a Smart tv\r\n\r\nPlease find the new rate: 2 Bedrooms Duplex Service Apartments Short Stay: N120,000 Long Stay: (7 Days) : N110,000- Refundable caution is 100k (25/7/2023)', '<p>Please scroll down to view the features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n✅Power Supply<br />\r\n✅Spacious Living Room<br />\r\n✅Security<br />\r\n✅Treated Water<br />\r\n✅Cleaning Services<br />\r\n✅Fitted Kitchen<br />\r\n✅Free Car Park<br />\r\n✅Smart Tv<br />\r\n✅Dstv<br />\r\n✅Unlimited WiFi<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKitchen Features:<br />\r\n✅Electric Kettle<br />\r\n✅Frezer<br />\r\n✅Treated Water<br />\r\n✅Blender<br />\r\n✅Microwave<br />\r\n✅Kitchen Utensils<br />\r\n✅Electric Iron<br />\r\n✅Rooms All Ensuite<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '15 Tiramiyu Bello Osagie street Parkview estate ikoyi Lagos, , Parkview, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4613825', '3.4439779', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0816471001685111206-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I33KHK6U9Xw', 'Reserve', 1423, 'No', NULL, 'Television is in master bedroom has TV, Living room has tv, Only living room has a Smart tv', 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 14:26:46', '2023-07-25 13:26:19'),
(501, 'short', NULL, '28147430', 'Adorable 1_Bed Apartment | Marwa, Bus-stop Lekki (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1491', 2, 35000.00, 42000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Water heater\r\nThere is iron but no ironing board\r\nblender netflix\r\n\r\nNo Dj allowed; no party too\r\nAllows smoking\r\nOne day booking not allowed\r\nEarly check in and late check out is 5k per hr\r\n\r\nDecember rates will not change from the regular rates\r\nNo built in speakers.\r\n\r\nPower supply is supported by inverter. Air conditioning/ refrigerator and microwave are not connected to the inverter. The generator that services the building comes on daily when there’s no power supply between 12-2pm and 6pm to 7am.\r\n\r\nPhoto shoot is fine. (45,500 payout)\r\n\r\n35k payout', '<p>We are ecstatic to present our lovely 1-bedroom flat in Marwa bus stop Lekki, of maximum occupancy 2 guests. This beautiful flat is a delight has a Living room with a designer furniture, The apartment is powered by an inverter. On request, toiletries are given. The bedroom is well-equipped, with a king-size bed The bathroom has a heater. This house has a fully equipped kitchen to meet your culinary needs. Smart TVs in the living area and bedroom are connected to a Netflix subscription. The setting is tranquil and pets friendly.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0094172001685112650-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 998, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '18:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 14:50:50', '2023-07-07 19:21:34'),
(502, 'short', NULL, '49631914', 'Luxury 1-bedroom apartment with Snooker | Opposite Atican Beach Ajah', 'Apartment', NULL, '1506', 2, 54000.00, 64800.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '1 bedroom apartment ajah it\'s a terrace in a closed street, there is an hourly code to open the apartment, there is someone standby to receive guest, 1 day booking is allowed with extraa charges, mini party is allowed but with maximum number of 6 guest, discount is allowed for stay from 10 nights, cleaning is done everyday, a fully serviced apartment with 24/7 electricity and washing machine available.\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly check in & Late check out rate is extra 5k per hr\r\nOne night booking is allowed at the same daily rate\r\nShisha is allowed\r\nYes, there’s Bluetooth speakers\r\nPhoto shoot is allowed at 80k per night\r\nDecember rate is 65k\r\n\r\nNormal season Host Payout 54K\r\n\r\n10% off FOR Monthly rate hence 48600 payout', '<p>This is a serviced apartment with 24/7 electricity supply in Lagos. It is a 1 bedroom and has capacity for 3 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, open-air parking the same building, 1 TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine, dishwasher, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'The Gilpins, Wale Alimi street opposite Atican Beach Okun Ajah., 23401, Ajah, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4281851', '3.5967952', 'uploads/property/SEP2023/0630341001693847209-property-SEP2023.png', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1004, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Fireplace', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 15:05:37', '2023-09-05 17:44:51'),
(505, 'short', NULL, '45482731', 'Appealing 2 Bedroom apartment | Katampe', 'Apartment', NULL, '1503', 2, 80000.00, 96000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Heater\r\nLaundry man\r\n24/7 electricity and check in\r\nnetflix\r\nSNOOKER\r\n\r\nminimum booking days are 3\r\n\r\nDecember rate is same\r\n\r\n2 bedroom is a combination of two 1 bedrooms- they have double of all features in the 1bedroom\r\nThere is a door linking to the rooms and also to the rooftop \r\n\r\n80k payout rate', '<p>This Beautiful 2-Bedroom apartment in a complex at Katampe is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 24/7 check in by host. The cottage features a beautifully organized living room, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave and refrigerator. After a long day of exploring, room provides exceptionally comfortable king size bed. If serene is your major hunt, then this should be your home.&nbsp;2 bedroom is a combination of&nbsp;two&nbsp;1&nbsp;bedrooms- they have double of all features in the&nbsp;1bedroom, with&nbsp;a door linking to the rooms and also to&nbsp;the&nbsp;rooftop&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nAmenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nSmart TV<br />\r\nSnooker board<br />\r\nLaundry man on request<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nNetflix subscription<br />\r\nChildren play area<br />\r\nHigh speed Wifi and many more</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0764785', '7.398574', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0460780001685115268-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 994, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '18:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 15:34:28', '2023-07-06 15:21:27'),
(506, 'short', NULL, '76598321', 'Breathtaking 3-bedroom apartment | LIFECAMP (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1562', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Heater and blender is available\r\n24/7 check in and electricity supported by inverter and generator\r\nNetflix\r\nterrace\r\n\r\n75k', '<p>The Retro flat is a lovely vacation property located in the beautiful Life Camp neighborhood of Abuja. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, two with king beds and one with a queen bed, as well as a huge living room, fully equipped kitchen, three bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people, and there is also a huge terrace and ample parking space. Check-in is available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, and electricity is provided by an inverter and a generator. Other features include Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, a washer and dryer, and WIFI access. A trial will convince</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Flat Retro , House 2, Aco Estate Lifecamp, , Lifecamp, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0920221', '7.388224199999999', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0330616001685115271-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 987, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '15:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 15:34:31', '2023-07-10 13:01:31'),
