ancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Plot 17, 3F Nova base Apartment, Olubunmi Owa street,off admiralty way, lekki phase 1 ,Lagos, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4463922', '3.470918', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0015980001685116521-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 992, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'WIFI', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 15:55:21', '2023-07-07 15:47:47'),
