\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0282590001685118190-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 980, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-26 16:23:10', '2023-08-07 14:28:25'),
