(526, 'short', NULL, '45435407', 'Admirable 4-bedroom PARTY home with an outdoor pool and gym | Banana island road, Ikoyi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1318', 2, 250000.00, 300000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'blender\r\n24/7 electricity\r\npets are allowed\r\nnetflix\r\n\"Beautiful space..\r\nNice interiors..\r\n\r\nParty home allows a maximum guests of 25\r\nA notice has to be sent to the estate management\r\n\r\nSo such bookings or inquiries have to be made with prior notice\r\n\r\nTwo 4Bed Ikoyi, Banana (13/1/23) Daily Rate- 180,000 As a 3Bed Daily Rate- 150,000 Refundable Caution Fee 75,000 Party Rate 250,000 Caution Deposit 100,000', '<p>This Beautiful 4-Bedroom apartment along Banana Island Road in Ikoyi is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it allows 8 guests and is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a, beautifully organized living room with nice decors and fittings and a touch of sophisticated lightings, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, oven, blender, fridge, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. Apartment is rooms-ensuite with home having a bathtub and 4 showers. Available also is a visitor toilet for convenience. In this home, rooms are furnished with a comfortable king size bed each, all white beddings, and plush duvets to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. All rooms are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix subscription<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment<br />\r\nWashing machine<br />\r\nPlay area for kids<br />\r\nSwimming pool<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nGym<br />\r\nPets Friendly<br />\r\n<br />\r\nN:B ; Home can be listed as 3 bed</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Apartment D4, Marion Apartment, Banana island road, Ikoyi, , Banana island road, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.461065199999999', '3.4509595', 'MAY2023/MC4wMTkyODcwMCAxNjgzMTg5MDAz-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 25, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1659, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-30 07:25:29', '2023-06-30 06:15:22'),
(527, 'short', NULL, '07880350', 'Attractive 3-bedroom Duplex | Osapa london', 'House', NULL, '1613', 2, 80000.00, 96000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'water heater, blender, netflix\r\nthe property allows for hosting mini events like bridal shower, game night\r\n\r\nAllows smoking\r\nOne booking not allowed\r\n\r\nEarly check in rate 10,000 per hour\r\n\r\nLate check out rate 10,000 per hour\r\n\r\nDecember daily Rate for your apartment (125,000)\r\n\r\nNo In-built speakers available\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot allowed at 110,000\r\n\r\n24/7 with generator\r\nmax of 2 nights\r\n\r\nNormal payout is 80k (9/3/2023) Hangout payout 180k', '<p>This Attractive 3-Bedroom duplex with maximum guest size of 6 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, a fully furnished kitchen that is well-equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, oven, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, each room are well furnished with a comfortable King size bed with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided. Home is pet friendly and has guest toilet hence privacy is not compromised<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWell airconditioned apartment<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix<br />\r\n24/7 electricity (generator provided)<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nSmart TVs (4; One in each room)</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 29 Chief Waheed Eletu way, cannal west residence Osapa London Lekki, 23401, Osapa London, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4457489', '3.5124844', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0418914001685436134-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 973, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-30 08:42:14', '2023-07-12 14:18:57'),
(529, 'short', NULL, '07143634', 'Enticing 4-bedroom duplex | Wuse 2, Abuja', 'Apartment', NULL, '1591', 2, 200000.00, 240000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'Contact +234 803 085 1866 this is the property facility manager\r\n\r\nwater heater\r\nblender\r\n24/7 check in and electricity\r\nnetflix\r\n\r\nOne night booking is at same rate as daily rate given (200K)\r\n\r\nNo early check in rate but we pay full rate for late checkout\r\n\r\nFor peak periods we maintain same rates\r\n\r\nSmoking or Shisha is not allowed\r\n\r\nwe don\'t allow DJ or loud music as it\'s a residential area\r\nHouse payout for normal season 200k', '<p>Our beautiful 4-bedroom duplex private apartment in Wuse has the following features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&bull; High Profile &amp; Secure Neighborhood (a healthy concentration of embassies and diplomatic residencies).<br />\r\n&bull; Strategically located in the city centers for easy commute to engagements.<br />\r\n&bull; All rooms fully en-suite.<br />\r\n&bull; 24/7 electricity<br />\r\n&bull; Party home (for max of 20 guests)<br />\r\n&bull; Pets are allowed<br />\r\n&bull; Daily housekeeping<br />\r\n&bull; All rooms equipped with Smart TV&#39;s and modern fittings.<br />\r\n&bull; Fast free Wi-Fi and Outdoor Lounge Area.<br />\r\n&bull; Fully Equipped Kitchen (Self Service).<br />\r\n&bull; Laundry Services (On Request)<br />\r\n&bull; Car Hire (On Request).<br />\r\nAs an additional way of making your experience seamless, we are offering our value-add concierge services which include flight travel agent services, client reminder systems to ensure you are updated on scheduled flights, airport pickups and inter-city logistics, to make sure that your stay is stress-free.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0764785', '7.398574', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0656724001685437120-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 971, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-30 08:58:40', '2023-07-12 11:04:09'),
(530, 'short', NULL, '83064800', 'Lovely 1 Bedroom Apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1318', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supply\r\nCleaning is done every 3 days\r\n\r\nDecember payout is 54k\r\n\r\npayout rate =55k (11/Apr/2023)', '<p>This Lovely 1 bedroom apartment is a contemporary apartment in the heart of Lekki phase 1. The maximum number of guests is 3. it is located in a serene gated estate which assures you of safety at all times. Modern conveniences include 24/7 hours electricity, fitted kitchen, WIFI, Smart TVs amongst others. Everything you need for a great stay can be found at this location.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, '42 Olabanji Olajide street, Lekki Phase 1 .Lagos., , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4355806', '3.4724503', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0655678001685438575-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 961, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-30 09:22:55', '2023-