(531, 'short', NULL, '58855338', 'Beautiful 1-bedroom apartment | Katampe extension (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1588', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', '24/7 electricity supported with inverter\r\nNetflix and youtube\r\n\r\nMini events of 5 persons not party\r\nDaily housekeeping\r\n\r\nAllows one day booking at same rate\r\n\r\nWater heater\r\nblender\r\n\r\n* No charges for early check in rate especially when a previous client has already checked out and the apartment has been cleaned.\r\n* We can only consider extra 1 hour added to the initial checking out time for a concrete reason but if not every hour we charge N20,000 except client is extending.\r\n* Our peak period, we still charge the same rate\r\n* No inbuilt speakers but we have a speaker.\r\n* Smoking is allowed but as long as there are no damages of our property e.g cigarette burning the couch, bedsheets, etc which implies that all the caution fee deposited will be taken.\r\n\r\n55k', '<p>This abode is an appealing terrace with a maximum occupancy of 2. This 1-bedroom apartment is an intimate walk-in with spiral staircase designed in FCT along Katampe extension. From the artistic fa&ccedil;ade of the building with a beautiful architecture until the beautiful interior design and artistic designs, comfy king size bed with soft natural linen, flowing curtains, smart TVs, and well air-conditioned accommodation, inverter carries AC in the bedroom 24/7; a perfect organization in all! It features fiber optic internet WiFi. Parking area is available, and cars are right in place. Netflix and Youtube is also available.<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\n24/7 electricity supported with inverter<br />\r\nNetflix and youtube<br />\r\nAllows Mini events of 5 persons (not party)<br />\r\nDaily housekeeping<br />\r\nAllows one day booking<br />\r\nA balcony for relaxation<br />\r\nFull furnished Kitchen with; blender, electric kettle, toaster, refrigerator e.tc.<br />\r\nPets friendly</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '68, Buhari Bala Fairview Residence Katampe extension, , Katampe extension, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.1225594', '7.4236131', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0685281001685439215-property-MAY2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1148, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-05-30 09:33:35', '2023-07-11 17:00:58'),
(534, 'short', NULL, '85345401', 'Adorable 3-bedroom Oceanview PARTY apartment with swimming pool and gym | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1496', 2, 250000.00, 300000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'Facility manager for property is Paul Joneer; +234 913 288 6806 \r\n\r\nCLEANING SCHEDULE: every other day\r\n\r\nnETFLIX\r\nAllows pARTIES WITH dj at 250k for a max guest of 25\r\nAllows smoking\r\nAllows a day booking\r\n\r\nAlexa smart home, in built Bluetooth ceiling speakers, automated curtains, automated light switch, open plan kitchen\r\n\r\npayout is 135k', '<p>The mansion of your dreams is ready to welcome new guests. Luxurious three-bedroom apartment with ocean view in Lekki phase 1. If you&#39;re looking for plenty of space, go no further because your needs will be covered. This magnificent home is tastefully decorated and equipped with modern conveniences, such as a gym that conveniently brings aerobic training to your doorstep to help you maintain a healthy cardiovascular system. An indoor pool to alleviate tension and feel rejuvenated during your stay, well-organized artworks that adds elegance to the living room, and a fully equipped kitchen to satisfy all cravings, Wi-Fi access and Netflix available are just a few of the amenities available. This contemporary apartment is ideal for you.<br />\r\nTo note:<br />\r\nCLEANING SCHEDULE: every other day<br />\r\nAllows pARTIES WITH DJ for a max guest of 25<br />\r\nAllows smoking<br />\r\nAllows a day booking<br />\r\nAlexa smart home, in built Bluetooth ceiling speakers, automated curtains, automated light switch, open plan kitchen</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC45NzM2ODMwMCAxNjgzNTU1MTMx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 25, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=coD-o4DQk24', 'Reserve', 1855, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Open style kitchen plan', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-06-02 11:11:13', '2023-08-14 09:49:56'),
