ng amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Plot 549 Freedom way, Cluster 5 River Park Estate Lugbe, , Lugbe, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '8.9705206', '7.350711800000001', 'MAY2023/MC4zNjA1MTQwMCAxNjgzNjI4MDI5-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1384, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-06-13 16:36:47', '2023-07-03 07:11:10'),
