.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Opposite Plot 15 Africa lane, Lekki phase 1,., , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4564793', '3.4739589', 'MAY2023/MC43NTQ2MjcwMCAxNjgzNjg3OTAw-property.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1715, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-06-15 10:21:22', '2023-08-15 12:37:06'),
