(603, 'short', NULL, '30948108', 'Stunning 3 bedroom Apartment | Allen Avenue Ikeja', 'Apartment', NULL, '1429', 2, 90000.00, 108000.00, NULL, NULL, '500000', 'Party/get together/game night/bridal showers rate is 180k\r\nRefundable Caution fee of 100k\r\n\r\nMaximum of 15guests \r\nNo smoking/Shisha allowed inside the apartment 🚭 \r\nNo loud noise \r\nParty or gatherings ends at \r\n10pm\r\nSleep over guest must not exceed 6 in number \r\nNo dj, as sound system has been made available in the apartment.\r\nSwimming is free for only two guests and host \r\n\r\n\r\nShould your guest insist on smoking, we’ll make available chairs and a table outside their apartment.\r\n\r\nShould the guest breach any of this policies, they risk the forfeiture of their 100k caution fee and upon any damage, extra charges applies for replacement. Kindly note Check in is 1pm while Check out is 11am for all Eds Luxe Apartment\r\n\r\nDecember rate is 99k; No party booking is accepted in december kindly note.', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>apartment in Lagos</strong>&nbsp;has 3 bedrooms and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, open-air parking the same building, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, freezer, washing machine, dishes/cutlery, kitchen utensils and kettle are provided.</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Ikeja, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.601838', '3.3514863', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0768598001688645009-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 1267, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '13:00', '14:00', '11:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-06 11:37:33', '2023-08-01 09:32:23'),
(606, 'short', NULL, '32337513', 'Cozy 1-bedroom apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1317', 2, 50000.00, 60000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment number is No 6. check in process is get to apartment and let the gateman know you have a reservation for Apartment 6\r\n\r\nPeak periods\r\nOne Bed N50,000(November)\r\nOne Bed N58,000 (December-January)\r\nOne Bed N55,000(February)\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly Check in November to February N10,000 3hrs (11am - 2pm) extra is N5,000\r\n\r\nLate check Out N10,000 3hrs (12 - 3) extra is N5,000\r\n\r\nI will not be accepting one day booking in December Minimum is 3 days \r\n\r\nNormal season rate is One bed Green chair 48500 payout (3/4/2023)\r\n\r\nMonthly rate- 1 bed 5k off payout', '<p>Our Cozy apartment in the heart of lekki phase 1 gives you a memorable experience you won&#39;t be quick to forget. Experience privacy, peace and tranquility just steps away from everything you need, there are restaurants, super markets, bars, clubs within a short drive. This is the best of Lekki phase 1 living!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe can&rsquo;t wait to welcome you to our city and our home!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition to the prime location, this quaint apartment has been stylishly appointed with all of the amenities to make your stay comfortable. There is a full kitchen with all of the equipment needed to prepare an amazing meal.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGuests have complete access to the entire apartment and the electricity supply is 24/7 supported with generator.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.447809299999999', '3.4723495', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0746586001688714426-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book_now', 878, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-07 07:03:51', '2023-09-05 17:23:38'),
(607, 'short', NULL, '26802359', 'Serene 1-bedroom apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1317', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Apartment number is No 4. check in process is get to apartment and let the gateman know you have a reservation\r\n\r\nPeak periods\r\nOne Bed N58,000(November)\r\nOne Bed N65,000 (December-January)\r\nOne Bed N58,000(February)\r\n\r\nMinimum booking 2 nights\r\n\r\nAnd one night N5,000 more (6/7/2023)\r\n\r\nMonthly rate- 1 bed 5k off payout', '<p>This 1 bedroom apartment is a contemporary apartment in the heart of Lekki Phase 1. It is in close proximity to the entertainment and business districts of Victoria Island and Ikoyi alike. it is located in a serene gated estate which assures you of safety at all times. Modern conveniences include 24/7 hours electricity supported by generator, fitted kitchen, WIFI, Smart TVs amongst others. Everything you need for a great stay can be found at this location.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, '8 Yeye Olofin Street, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4439407', '3.4615134', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0915408001688715924-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book_now', 545, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-07 07:25:40', '2023-09-05 17:23:26'),
