e arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'No 27 Atinuke Olabanji street off allen Avenue ikeja lagos, , Allen avenue, Ikeja, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.6012887', '3.3460278', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0768598001688645009-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 15, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 716, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '13:00', '14:00', '11:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-07 11:18:32', '2023-08-01 09:35:29'),
(615, 'short', NULL, '49617190', 'Lovely 2 bedroom apartment | Orchid, Eleganza lekki (inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1483', 2, 60000.00, 72000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'has blender and water heater\r\n\r\ncleaning is every other day\r\n\r\nNETFLIX\r\nHOUSEKEEPING- EVERY OTHER DAY\r\nLiving room and masters bedroom HAS tv\r\n\r\nNo smoking, No party\r\nAllows a day booking\r\nSmart curtains, smart door lock, smart TV, broadband internet and fully equipped kitchen \r\nMonthly booking payout - 10% discount(54k/night)  \r\n\r\n60k payout', '<p>An opportunity to live in a stunning 2-bedroom in Eleganza, lekki. You enter a magnificent structure with creative decorations in a tranquil setting. A tastefully decorated living area with plush sofas and decorative pillows. This apartment has a balcony. Living room and masters bedroom has a Smart TV with great graphics and a very spacious bedroom with king size beds that makes you feel at home. This apartment includes a fully equipped kitchen, inverter-powered electricity, Netflix, and Wi-Fi access package.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCleaning is every other day<br />\r\nNo smoking, No party<br />\r\nAllows a day booking<br />\r\nSmart curtains and smart door lock are features available</p>\r\n\r\n<p>N.B-&nbsp;Guest cannot be 4 males in the apartment</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Cluster A E4 Dunvale Estate Coleman nwafor street off orchid road eleganza bus stop lekki, , Lekki, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0775765001688733968-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 674, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-07 12:21:26', '2023-09-06 10:41:11'),
(621, 'short', NULL, '85109396', 'Lovely 3-Bedroom apartment | Freedom way, Ikate Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1521', 2, 85000.00, 102000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'water heater\r\nblender\r\n24/7 electricity\r\nnetflix\r\nEstate has a lawn tennis court\r\n\r\n\r\nA valid ID card is required for booking.\r\nPlease note this is a non-smoking apartment.\r\nThis apartment is rented out for residential purposes only and any illegal activity is strictly prohibited.\r\n\r\nIT\'S IMPORTANT TO OBEY SECURITY ON ARRIVAL. BLOCKING THE GATE BRINGS THE SHORTLET A FINE OF N50,000. Please call us to handle any issues.\r\n\r\nPlease park in block 9 ( LSDPC ESTATE )\r\n\r\nSMOKING OF WEED AND RECREATIONAL DRUGS IS STRICTLY PROHIBITED IF CAUGHT THEY WILL BE DESTROYED AND LEAD TO CANCELLATION OF RENTALS WITHOUT ANY REFUND\r\n\r\nLOUD MUSIC AND PARTIES ARE NOT ALLOWED.\r\n\r\nHarassment of fellow residents, estate staff and security carries a fine, please desist from this.\r\n\r\nHost allows 8 persons for 3 beds at any particular time.\r\n\r\nSpreading of clothes on the railings is not allowed, kindly use the cloth dryer provided.\r\n\r\nCheck-out is 11 am and check-in starts at 3 pm. Check-out after noon attracts a penalty of N10,000 and at 6 pm, a full day\'s rental is charged.\r\n\r\nThe apartment comes with smart TV and Netflix is free.\r\n\r\nA blender, coffee maker, electric kettle and oven are available in the apartment', '<p>This Elegant 3-Bedroom cottage with maximum guest size of 6 is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on as it is in a private and safe space. This beautifully designed home features a beautifully organized living room, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, blender, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, every room is well furnished with a comfortable king size bed each with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathrooms furnished with showers and which toiletries and wash fluids are provided.&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi&nbsp;<br />\r\nDstv subscription,&nbsp;<br />\r\nNetflix&nbsp;<br />\r\n24/7 electricity&nbsp;<br />\r\nEstate has a lawn tennis court&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'MAY2023/MC41MDM0ODMwMCAxNjgzNTY4MTQx-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gqN0kIpazc0', 'Reserve', 1182, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-07 21:38:23', '2023-08-10 12:27:52'),
(626, 'short', NULL, '75582254', 'Admirable 2-bedroom apartment with swimming pool | Ikate, Lekki', 'Apartment', NULL, '1517', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Minimum of 2 nights\r\n\r\nNo smoking indoors\r\n\r\nWater heater\r\n\r\nCleaning is every other day', '<p>This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, fully furnished&nbsp; kitchen that is fully equipped with essential conveniences such as a microwave, blender, freezer, toaster and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. In this home, their rooms are well furnished with a comfortable Queen size bed each with white beddings, and plush duvet to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided. All rooms are ensuite with an extra bath and guest toilet available.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Plot 19 adesegun okunuga street, off amore street, off freedom way, lekki, , Ikate, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4432731', '3.4817271', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0158543001688809653-property-JUL2023.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 433, NULL, NULL, '2 bedrooms and living room', 'No', '30mins max', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Host', '14:00', '14:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-08 00:25:50', '2023-08-07 17:06:16'),
(628, 'short', NULL, '52293681', 'Sapphire 3 Bedroom Apartment | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1534', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Our December rate is 90k\r\n\r\nEarly check in is at same rate if the flat is free on time of request\r\nLate check out will attract 5k per hour\r\n\r\nWe allow one night booking at the same rate given\r\n\r\nNo smoking\r\nNo in-built speakers available\r\n\r\nwe allow photoshoot\r\n150k normal rate\r\n200k December rate\r\n\r\n24/7 electricity \r\n\r\nNormal Host rate is 75k', '<p>This is a Lovely 3 bedroom Apartment in Lekki Phase 1 and has capacity for 6 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), air-conditioned, TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the independent kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, washing machine and kettle are provided.<br />\r\nAll rooms ensuite,Ante room, 2 balconies, Water heaters ,Ironing board and iron,Smart TVs ,Dstv , Gas cooker and oven ,Bread toaster ,Spacious compound</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Plot 9 esther adeleke street, off Jeremiah ugwu street, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4518786', '3.