(629, 'short', NULL, '15163349', 'Bubbly 5-bedroom duplex with BBQ | Wuse 2 (Inverter)', 'Apartment', NULL, '1564', 2, 200000.00, 240000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Host allows party for a maximum of 30 guest for 300k.\r\n\r\nHost can allow 15 guests for a daily stay\r\nHave NETFLIX\r\n\r\nCleaning is every other day\r\nHas water heater\r\nNo smoking\r\nNo smoking\r\nAllows a day booking', '<p>Spacious 5 bedroom terrace apartment suitable for family staycation or individual holiday in the heart of wuse 2&nbsp;allows maximum guest size of 10. This elegantly designed home features a beautifully organized living room, and a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences to give a home aura and easy means to cook. It allows party for a maximum of 30 guests</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Other amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWi-Fi<br />\r\nDSTV,<br />\r\nNetflix</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Barbecue<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nDaily housekeeping</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'House T8, Makuru close, wuse2. Abuja, 900288, Wuse 2, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0794621', '7.4740839', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0488478001688998880-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None',