(630, 'short', NULL, '40588149', 'Classy 3-bedroom apartment with pool | Oniru, V.I', 'Apartment', NULL, '1580', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'In house Chef can be arranged\r\n\r\nAllows one day booking at same daily rate (75k)\r\n\r\nAllows party\r\n\r\nEarly check-in/Late check out rate: 5k per hour\r\n\r\nPeak period daily rate is 85k (naira) per day\r\n\r\nPeak period party Rate is 130k (naira)\r\n\r\nSmoking and Shisha is allowed but caution fee for those clients are higher.\r\n\r\nPhotoshoot is allowed. Rate is 100k (naira)\r\n\r\nNo in built speakers available with Bluetooth\r\n\r\nWe supply 24/7 electricity (generator included) all electrical appliances work\r\n\r\nNew rate: 75k normal stay (regular stay) Party/gathering: 20 guest (100k). 30 guests which is maximum (120k) for higher risk of damages(5/7/2023)', '<p>The apartment is a lovely vacation home located at Oniru. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, with one king size bed each as well as a huge living room, fully equipped kitchen, three bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 6 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, toaster, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine, Garden, swimming pool, Balcony, gym and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nP;S; This 3 bed can be used as a 2 bed too at a different rate.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4280556', '3.4219444', 'MAY2023/MC4yNzAwNzkwMCAxNjgzNjM4MTgy-property.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h0MwZ5_olBk', 'Reserve', 1099, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Swimming pool', NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-11 11:27:36', '2023-07-25 11:56:48'),
(631, 'short', NULL, '39578450', 'Stunning 2-bedroom apartment | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1587', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Parties not allowed\r\n\r\n\r\n- Early checking in and Late check out depends on the hours before and after. However we charge 50% of the daily rate. (Reach out to host)\r\n-we have sound bar speakers with Bluetooth in all our apartments\r\n- Smoking is not allowed (no form of smoking is allowed)\r\n-we don’t allow 1night booking\r\n\r\nDecember is 75k and minimum of 7 days', '<p>A tastefully finished 2 bedroom Apartment for Shortlet service with a 4 persons capacity. Apartment is styled with contemporary furnishing in a safe area situated off the most popular street in Lekki phase 1 beside the biggest indigenous chain supermarket Ebeano, a one stop mall -Aaron&#39;s mall and clubs, restaurants, bar &amp; lounges. The Apartment is brand new featuring an Elevator, 24hr Power, 2 Car Parking Spaces, Free Wifi, All Rooms Ensuite, Fully Air Conditioned, Fitted kitchen, Washing Machine, Netflix in all Rooms, 65inch TV &amp; Sound bar &amp; DSTV Premium.<br />\r\nNote: Parties and loud music are not allowed</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'olubunmi owa street, Novabase Apartment, 23401, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4463922', '3.470918', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0542136001689264818-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 782, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-11 16:57:47', '2023-07-13 16:13:38'),
(640, 'short', NULL, '02195789', 'Comfy 2 bedroom apartment | Magodo', 'Apartment', NULL, '1637', 2, 45000.00, 54000.00, NULL, NULL, '30000', 'host can allow 5 guests\r\n\r\nWater heater\r\n\r\nCleaning is everyday\r\nHas Netflix\r\nmaster bedroom has TV, Living room has tv, Only living room has smart tv \r\n\r\nCaution is 30k', '<p>Stunning views, modern furnishings, and a cozy atmosphere define this stylish apartment in the heart of Magodo. With an open-concept layout, modern and tastefully furnished living space that exudes warmth and tranquility, fully equipped kitchen, and comfortable bedrooms, it offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience. Enjoy the apartment&#39;s amenities, explore the vibrant neighborhood, and experience a peaceful urban retreat. Book your stay today for a memorable and relaxing getaway.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>The space</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Welcome to our exquisite apartment nestled in a highly secure environment. We pride ourselves on providing our guests with a luxurious experience, offering a perfect blend of style, practicality, and convenience. Our modern home design exudes elegance, and every detail has been carefully curated to ensure a comfortable and enjoyable stay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith 24/7 electricity, you can rest assured that your comfort and convenience are our top priorities. Our fully equipped kitchen is ready to cater to your culinary desires, and we even provide complimentary coffee to kickstart your day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt our apartment, safety and security are paramount. We have created a haven where you can feel at ease, knowing that your well-being is our utmost concern. Whether you&#39;re traveling for business or leisure, our space offers the ideal home away from home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIndulge in the opulence of our luxurious apartment and experience a lifestyle that seamlessly combines comfort and security.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Guest access</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Welcome to the prime location of Magodo GRA Phase 2 , where convenience is at your fingertips. Situated in close proximity to major destinations in Lagos, including the Murtala Muhammed International Airport and Ikeja Shopping Mall, our estate offers easy access to everything you need.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the convenience of our strategic location and explore the best that Lagos has to offer.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', 'Yes', '22 Kunle Ogedengbe Crescent Magodo GRA Phase 2 Shangisha, 100248, Magodo, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.6173027', '3.3866871', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0531407001689343599-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 492, 'No', NULL, 'Living room and Master bedroom', 'Yes', 'Within One Hour', NULL, 'Coffee Maker and Washing Machine,', NULL, 'Host', '15:00', '19:30', '11:00', 'Owner', NULL, 'Yes', 'Magodo GRA Phase 2 Shangisha', 'Magodo GRA Phase 2 Estate, Shangisha', 'Yes', NULL, 'None', '4', 1, '2023-07-13 18:21:36', '2023-08-16 13:00:26'),
