(650, 'short', NULL, '81810765', 'Classy 4 bedroom duplex with swimming pool and snooker| Karsana, Aso garden estate', 'Apartment', NULL, '1530', 2, 120000.00, 144000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Video games, board games, Water Heater, Netflix\r\n\r\nPS5\r\nCleaning is every other day\r\n\r\n120K PAYOUT', '<p>This&nbsp;<strong>house in Abuja</strong>&nbsp;has 4 bedrooms and has capacity for 8 people.<br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: lift, garden furniture, barbecue, iron, internet (Wi-Fi), balcony, gym / fitness centre, air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, open-air parking the same building, tv satellite.<br />\r\nthe kitchen, refrigerator and washing machine is provided.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.0764785', '7.398574', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0956914001689692424-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Private', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 624, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Host', '14:00', '14:30', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-18 15:00:25', '2023-08-11 15:35:45'),
(653, 'short', NULL, '96182392', 'Enchanting 3 bedroom with ocean view | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1373', 2, 195000.00, 234000.00, NULL, NULL, '150000', 'Beautiful space\r\nNicely decorated.\"\r\n\r\n1openstyle kitchen\r\nSwimming Pool, Balcony, Outdoor Furniture, Table tennis and snooker board\r\nHas water heater\r\nBlender is available\r\nhousekeeping is every other day\'\r\n\r\nNetflix \r\n\r\nPayout is 195k, for 2 days upward- One day booking is 210k', '<p>This luxurious 3-bedroom apartment is located in the serene neighborhood of Lekki Phase 1, offering a stunning lagoon view. It is designed to provide a lavish and comfortable living experience.<br />\r\nAs you step inside, you are greeted by a spacious living area that exudes elegance and sophistication. The interior is beautifully designed with high-quality furnishings and exquisite finishes. Large windows allow for plenty of natural light and showcase the breathtaking lagoon view.<br />\r\nThe apartment features three well-appointed bedrooms, each offering a peaceful sanctuary. The master bedroom includes a luxurious en-suite bathroom with a jacuzzi and a bathtub, providing a perfect space for relaxation and rejuvenation. For your convenience and entertainment, a waterproof smart tv is placed in front of the jacuzzi, allowing you to watch your favorite shows or movies while enjoying a luxurious bath.<br />\r\nOne of the standout features of this apartment is the outdoor area. A large swimming pool awaits you, offering a refreshing escape from the heat and a place to unwind.<br />\r\nAdditionally, Bluetooth speakers are installed in all the rooms, providing a seamless and immersive audio experience throughout the apartment.<br />\r\nThe location of this apartment in Lekki Phase 1 offers a serene and secure environment, perfect for those seeking tranquility and privacy. Lekki Phase 1 is known for its upscale amenities, including fine dining restaurants, shopping centers, and entertainment options, ensuring that all your needs are easily met.<br />\r\nIn summary, this luxurious 3-bedroom apartment offers a serene lagoon view, a large swimming pool, a jacuzzi and bathtub, a waterproof smart TV for your comfort, and Bluetooth speakers in all the rooms. It is situated in the tranquil neighborhood of Lekki Phase 1, providing an opulent and relaxing living experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On-site facilities<br />\r\n1. Jetty access for boat cruise<br />\r\n2. Secured and beautiful estate<br />\r\n3. Ample Parking Space<br />\r\n4. Swimming Pool<br />\r\n5. Waterfront<br />\r\n6. Elevators<br />\r\n7. Central to restaurants, bars, clubs, beaches, kids play centers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Services attached:<br />\r\n1. 24 hours electricity<br />\r\n2. On site Security<br />\r\n3. WiFi, PS5, Dstv and Netflix with 70&rdquo; TV<br />\r\n4. Balcony with sea view overlooking the Banana Island<br />\r\n5. Smart Home with ceiling speakers and smart curtains<br />\r\n6. Fully equipped open plan modern kitchen with marble top island.<br />\r\n7. All rooms en suite with smart TVs and 5 Stars luxury bathrooms with jacuzzi, hot tub, waterproof smart TV, shower seat with body jets.<br />\r\n8. Daily house keeping with fresh towels.<br />\r\n9. Washing machine and much more</p>', NULL, NULL, 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.447809299999999', '3.4723495', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0750943001689783445-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 632, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', 'Immediately', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Host', '14:00', '14:00', '12:30', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2023-07-19 16:02:44', '2023-08-08 13:52:30'),
(656, 'short', NULL, '98054443', 'Serene 3-bedroom PARTY apartment | Alexander, Ikoyi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1400', 2, 250000.00, 300000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'Has snooker board\r\n\r\nHas water heater\r\n\r\nHousekeeping is everyday\r\n\r\nDSTV AND nETFLIX Available\r\n6 for regular stay 20 for parties no DJ allowed - at 250k', '<p>3 Bedroom luxury Apt in Ikoyi, off bourdillon road.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Facilities include:<br />\r\n- Swimming pool<br />\r\n- Snooker table&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Superfast WI-FI<br />\r\n- 24/7 Support&nbsp;<br />\r\n- 24/7 Electricity&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Air Conditioning&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Elevator&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Housekeeping<br />\r\n- Netflix&nbsp;<br />\r\n- DSTV<br />\r\n- Fully equipped kitchen&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Free parking Space&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Top notch security&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Gym<br />\r\n- Access to Restaurant&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Access to Luxury&nbsp;Boutique</p>\r\n<quillbot-extension-portal></quillbot-extension-portal>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Bf-2 Avenue Montaigne No 37 cooper road off Alexander road ikoyi, , Ikoyi, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4454566', '3.4480945', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0415845001688422029-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 228, 'Yes', 'Public area outdoor', 'Living room and bedrooms', 'Yes', 'Asap', '300000', NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '14:00', '15:30', '12:00', 'Agent', NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, 'mini_events', '20', 1, '2023-07-20 13:04:22', '2023-07-27 14:49:12'),
(666, 'short', NULL, '12027320', 'Cute studio with swimming pool and gym/ Banana island estate', 'Apartment', NULL, '1706', 2, 40000.00, 48000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Housekeeping is every 2 days\r\n\r\nHas water heater\r\nNetflix\r\n\r\nNo parties\r\nNo smoking\r\n\r\n40k payout', '<p>The studio in Lagos has 1 bedroom and has capacity for 1 person.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThe accommodation is equipped with the following items: iron, internet (Wi-Fi), gym / fitness centre, air-conditioned, communal swimming pool, open-air parking the same building, 1 TV, tv satellite (Languages: English).<br />\r\nIn the gas independent kitchen, refrigerator, microwave, oven and dishes/cutlery are provided.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked.', 'YES', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Happy haven estate 107close 1st avenue banana island estate, Ikoyi Lagos, , Banana Island, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4661127', '3.4498402', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0757084001690372451-property-JUL2023.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 225, 'No', NULL, 'Bedroom ( it is a studio ; no living room area)', 'No', '20-30 minutes', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Host', '14:00', '14:30', '12:00', 'Owner', NULL, 'Yes', 'Banana island', 'Bourdillion court', 'Yes', NULL, 'None', NULL, 1, '2023-07-26 11:56:14', '2023-08-07 17:34:35'),
(669, 'short', NULL, '90408450', 'Cozy 3 bedroom apartment with swimming pool and gym | Lekki phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1712', 2, 200000.00, 240000.00, NULL, NULL, '150000', 'Water heater is available\r\n\r\nBlender\r\nHousekeeping is every other day, NETFLIX\r\n\r\n6 for regular stay 20 for get together- 400k\r\n\r\nWe don\'t allow parties, just get together but no loud parties\r\nCaution fee (We give returning clients 100k but fresh clients go from 150k)\r\n\r\nWe have an onsite staff who does the housekeeping everymorning or whenever he is needed\r\nWe also have a car attached to the apartment with a driver but the client fuels the vehicle only\r\n\r\nDiscount- For a week stays we charge 1.3M which will be paid upfront\r\n\r\nAllows one night booking\r\n\r\n200k payout\r\nFor Monthly rate- 30 night stay goes for 4m \r\n1.5M for 10 night stay', '<p>Your Ultimate Destination for an Exceptional Experience in the Heart of Lagos.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our exquisite 3-bedroom waterfront apartment is tailored to meet the refined tastes of corporate executives and expatriates like you. Whether you&rsquo;re planning a short business trip or an extended stay, our lavish apartment promises a serene sanctuary and a taste of true luxury</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Special amenities<br />\r\n- Oceanview<br />\r\n-Workspace<br />\r\nSwimming pool<br />\r\nGym and much more</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Joneer Court, Admiralty Way Lekki 1 beside DHL, , Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.431540699999999', '3.4610513', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0724869001690473304-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ejhaBmct-Mw', 'Reserve', 681, 'No', NULL, 'Sitting room, dinning and bedrooms', 'No', 'Immediately', '400000', 'A jetty', NULL, 'Host', '12:00', '12:30', '13:00', 'Facility_manager', NULL, 'Yes', 'Joneer', 'DHL Lekki 1', 'Yes', NULL, 'mini_events', 'Minimum of 20 guests for get together and 6 guests for stays.', 1, '2023-07-27 15:58:28', '2023-08-31 14:24:44'),
(670, 'short', NULL, '78377116', 'Comfy 3-bedroom PARTY apartment with swimming pool, gym and snooker board | Ajiwe Ajah', 'Apartment', NULL, '1331', 2, 100000.00, 120000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'HAS Swimming Pool, Playarea for kids, Gym, Balcony, Snooker board \r\n(Water heater available)\r\n\r\nHas blender\r\nCleaning schedule is daily\r\nNetflix available\r\nInverter powers AC\r\n\r\nTVS ARE NOT SMART -Only living room is smart\r\nNO SMOKING\r\nAllows party but No DJ- For Events/Photoshoots/Party Get-together N100k (Access to whole Apartment up to 20 Guests maximum)\r\n\r\n\r\n1. As a One Bedroom Apartment - \r\n👉🏾 King-sized Bedroom Apartment N50,000\r\nIf booked as a King-sized One Bedroom Apartment (Access to King-size Bedroom upstairs only, both sitting rooms, kitchen & toilet downstairs)\r\n\r\n👉🏾 Double-sized Bedroom Apartment N45,000\r\nIf booked as a Double-sized One Bedroom Apartment (Access to Double size Bedroom upstairs only, both sitting rooms, kitchen, toilet downstairs)\r\n\r\n👉🏾 Single-sized Bedroom Apartment N40,000\r\nIf booked as a Single-sized One Bedroom Apartment (Access to Single Bedroom downstairs, sitting room, kitchen & toilet downstairs)\r\n\r\nCan be listed as a 3 bedroom for 65k/night, 2 bed is 55k', '<p>This homely 3-bedroom apartment that can be sold as a 2-bedroom is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Ajah, lekki. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breathtaking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features three bedrooms, with One king size bed and one queen size bed, and one single size bed. A fully equipped kitchen, two bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 20&nbsp; people for parties, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHAS Swimming Pool, Playarea for kids, Gym, Balcony, Snooker board<br />\r\nWater heater available<br />\r\nHas blender<br />\r\nCleaning schedule is daily<br />\r\nNetflix available<br />\r\nInverter powers AC<br />\r\nNO DJ<br />\r\nNO SMOKING</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'House 13 Marita court, Metro homes, general paint bus stop ajiwe Ajah., , Ajah, Lagos, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5243793', '3.3792057', 'uploads/property/MAY2023/0802691001685099649-property-MAY2023.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 20, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xmXNUJlBH0o', 'Reserve', 751, 'No', NULL, 'TVS ARE NOT SMART -Only living room TV is smart', 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-28 09:00:13', '2023-07-31 11:29:21'),
(673, 'short', NULL, '30640134', 'Elegant 2-Bedroom Apartment with snookerboard | Lekki Phase 1', 'Apartment', NULL, '1642', 2, 90000.00, 108000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Snooker board\r\n\r\nHas water heater, Blender\r\nCleaning is every other day\r\n\r\nNETFLIX\r\nNo parties allowed in both apartments. Just regular stay bookings.\r\nAllows 1 day booking\r\n90K', '<p>This homely apartment is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Lekki phase 1. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breath-taking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. An apartment so spacious to a fault. The area features two bedrooms, with one king size bed and one queen-size each as well as a huge living room, fully equipped kitchen, two bathrooms ensuite, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 4 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Netflix with smart TVs in the living area and bedrooms, washing machine, snooker board, balcony and WIFI access. A trial will convince<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo note;<br />\r\nOpen style kitchen<br />\r\nRooms are ensuite; Apartment has a water heater and blender.<br />\r\nHousekeeping schedule ; every other day,<br />\r\nNo smoking, No parties allowed.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'uploads/property/JUL2023/0923014001690560037-property-JUL2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OHdONV0eMvdBDPWpiLFZvHt6qgNYlEbG/view?usp=drive_link', 'Reserve', 128, 'Yes', 'Outside the Homes', 'Living Room and Bedrooms', 'No', 'Immediately', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Host', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-07-28 16:00:38', '2023-08-10 15:56:16'),
