(678, 'short', NULL, '22801494', 'Lovely 2 bedroom apartment | Jahi, Galimore', 'Apartment', NULL, '1729', 2, 65000.00, 78000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Nice Wall arts.\r\n\r\nWater heater is available\r\nBlender\r\n\r\nHousekeeping is 2 days interval\r\nNETFLIX\r\nLandmark- The Pink bridge supermarket\r\nAllows one day booking\r\nNo party\r\nNo smoking\r\n\r\n65k payout', '<p>This beautiful apartment located in Jahi, Abuja has 2 bedrooms and can comfortably accommodate up to 4 people. It&#39;s also suitable for small gatherings with a maximum of 10 guests. The apartment&#39;s contemporary style and magnificent furnishings, including two queen-size beds, sturdy wardrobes, well-crafted bedside lockers, and beautifully designed kitchen cabinets, create an inviting atmosphere. Every aspect of this property is well-organized with nice walls arts, from the living room to all the rooms, and it benefits from efficient air-conditioning powered by 24/7 electricity supply. The fully equipped kitchen features an open floor layout, providing a bright and spacious ambiance.<br />\r\nMoreover, the apartment comes with modern amenities such as water heaters in the bathrooms, ensuite rooms, a balcony with a stunning view; kids&#39; play area, and housekeeping services available upon guest request. Additionally, there is open-air parking within the building, and each room, as well as the living room, is equipped with smart TVs, Netflix, and Wi-Fi connection.<br />\r\nThis place offers a unique opportunity to experience an unforgettable holiday while immersing yourself in breath-taking scenery and the natural beauty of the surroundings. For an ideal vacation destination, look no further than this remarkable apartment</p>\r\n\r\n<p>N;B-&nbsp;Housekeeping is 2 days interval</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '9 fola Daniel Crescent. Jahi, Gailmore -Adjacent Rovis gas plant, , Jahi, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.1098494', '7.4302967', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0853524001690893882-property-AUG2023.png', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 714, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '15:00', '16:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-08-01 12:44:43', '2023-08-11 15:19:32'),
(683, 'short', NULL, '48422618', 'Unique - 2 Bedroom  apartment with patio and private entrance | Wuse 2', 'Apartment', NULL, '1395', 2, 75000.00, 90000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'When trying to get a booking for his apartment, ask guest specific number of guests to be expected so he has that information.\r\n\r\nHOUSEKEEPING Based on GUEST REQUEST;\r\nThe Inverter cannot carry the AC\r\n\r\n\r\nRooms are ensuite\r\nWATER HEATER\r\n\r\nOnce a week free cleaning, cleaning any other day extra charge\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\nOne in the living room (Smart Tv) one in the Room (Not Smart)\r\n\r\nBoard games\r\n\r\nHalf price for late check out.\r\n\r\n75k for 2 bedroom apartments\r\n\r\nNo photoshoots allowed\r\n\r\nNo DJ equipment\r\nInverter and generator available and they provide 24/7 light. However inverter has limited capacity\r\n\r\nNo smoking inside the building only outside at the designated area.\r\n\r\nNo one night booking. Minimum of 2 nights\r\n\r\n75k payout( december is same)', '<p>A functional and personalized home away experience where privacy and tranquillity are most cherished. You are met with smiles and an easily accessible team.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This &nbsp;two-bedroom apartment with a king and queen size beds , has large size area, &nbsp;an open plan kitchen, a backyard and outdoor patio.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The &nbsp;property is situated in wuse 2 which is the heart in the city center of Abuja. It is home to the best parks, supermarkets, finest restaurants, hotels and clubs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The property itself comes with a 100 KVA and 8.5 KVA &nbsp;generators, 10 KVA inverter with 16 batteries, Fibre optics internet, intercom units, 24/7 laundry facility, uniformed security, patios, tropical courtyard, lobby with guest toilet, security layers, CCTV, parking, water pressure pump, etc</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter,', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, '436, 900288, Wuse 2, Abuja, FCT, Nigeria', '9.078672599999999', '7.4701181', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0871986001691077691-property-AUG2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 184, 'Yes', 'outside the property', NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Patio', NULL, 'Host', '12:00', '20:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2023-08-03 12:37:30', '2023-08-11 11:32:40'),
