(686, 'short', NULL, '16873769', 'Exquisite 4 Bedroom with swimming pool and gym | Atlantic mall, Chevron', 'House', NULL, '1706', 2, 110000.00, 132000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'water heater\r\n\r\nHousekeeping- every other day\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\n170k for movie shoots\r\nMinimum of 2 days\r\n\r\nHouse Rules & Guidelines\r\n• Smoking within the estate is not allowed\r\n• No hard drugs of any sort is allowed\r\n• Parties are strictly prohibited\r\n• Pets of any kind are not allowed\r\n• Loud Music in or outside the flat is not permitted. A violation of this will lead to disconnection of power\r\n• Driving into and within the premises should be at parking pace of 5km/hr\r\n• Cars should be parked within the flats parking lot\r\n• Guests must respect the peace of other residents\r\n• Not more than 3 persons can use the estate public facility at a time.\r\n• Airbnb guests would be required to undergo proper entry and exit checks. Kindly note that the security operatives have been mandated at the main gate to ensure the number of guests for the apartment is not exceeded.\r\n• Airbnb guests would not be giving the security gate number at any time.\r\n• Guests are entitled to housekeeping 3 times a week\r\n\r\n110k payout (7/8/2023', '<p>This homely 4-bedroom apartment is a lovely vacation and short stay home located at Chevron, lekki. It provides a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to enjoy a delightful vacation surrounded by cutting-edge contemporary architecture and the most breath-taking landscape and beauty nature has to offer. The area features four bedrooms that are ensuite, with four king size bed each, fully equipped kitchen, and a guest toilet. The location is great for 8 people, with ample parking space. Other features include microwave, Water heater, Netflix with smart TVs, and WIFI access. A trial will convince</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', NULL, 'Chevron, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4604419', '3.530303', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0611434001691591014-property-AUG2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 126, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '14:00', '14:30', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-08-09 14:23:34', '2023-08-11 14:50:35'),
(687, 'short', NULL, '51520420', 'Classy 4 bedroom duplex with swimming pool l Ologolo, Lekki', 'House', NULL, '1602', 2, 100000.00, 120000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'water heater\r\n\r\nCleaning is every other day\r\nNETFLIX\r\nCaution fee is 100k refundable\r\n\r\nNo smoking apartment. Quiet residential estate. please no get together or party.', '<p>This stunning apartment in Ologolo lekki has 4 bedrooms and has capacity for 8 people. An apartment with a contemporary style with High End Furniture&rsquo;s which includes a king and queen size bed in the room, durable wardrobes, well finished bedside lockers, beautifully crafted kitchen cabinets e.tc. This property is well organized from living room to all rooms in the property and properly air-conditioned. In this home you enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, which includes a blender, microwave, toaster, oven alongside other relevant kitchenware&rsquo;. An open floor layout keeps the space feeling light and airy. This home provides a one-of-a-kind opportunity to enjoy a wonderful holiday while taking in the most breath-taking scenery and natural beauty that nature has to offer.<br />\r\nOther amenities are<br />\r\nSmart TVs,<br />\r\nNetflix, and Wi-Fi connection.<br />\r\nSwimming pool.<br />\r\nGarden<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nThis is the ideal place to visit for a vacation</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0045077001691674650-property-AUG2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', '2023-08-14', NULL, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 210, 'No', NULL, 'Parlor, lounge and rooms', 'No', '5mins', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Host', '14:00', '15:00', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2023-08-10 11:12:50', '2023-08-24 14:17:24'),
(688, 'short', NULL, '61147487', 'Attractive 3 Bedroom with snooker | JAHI, FCT', 'Apartment', NULL, '1486', 2, 120000.00, 144000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', 'Snooker available\r\n\r\nMinimum of 2 days booking\r\n\r\n24/7 check in & electricity\r\n\r\n\r\nWater heater, blender\r\nHousekeeping is every other day\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\n120k payout', '<p>This stunning house with a contemporary style is completely manned and magnificently equipped with comfortable furniture&rsquo;s which includes one king size bed in each room, Durable wardrobes, well finished, beautifully crafted kitchen cabinets e.tc. This property offers luxurious, air-conditioned accommodation with 24/7 electricity. In this home you enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, luxury styled windows and its blind to offer you privacy and control the light that enters your home. An open floor layout keeps the space feeling light and airy. This home provides a one-of-a-kind opportunity to enjoy a wonderful holiday while taking in the most breathtaking scenery and natural beauty that nature has to offer. Other amenities are Water heater in the bathroom, Balcony for evening relaxation, snooker, Netflix, and Wifi connection. This is the ideal place to visit for a vacation.</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'NO', NULL