(696, 'short', NULL, '70735108', 'Charming Penthouse Overlooking Quaint Rooftops', 'Apartment', NULL, '1765', 2, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '30000', NULL, '<p>Welcome to Our Rooftop Penthouse Retreat</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Escape to our charming penthouse nestled in the heart of the city. Experience the warmth of a residential neighborhood with a unique rooftop view of neighboring houses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Space:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our penthouse offers a cozy and inviting atmosphere. The open living area is flooded with natural light, making it the perfect place to relax after a day of exploring. The fully equipped kitchen is a chef&rsquo;s dream, and the dining area is perfect for enjoying meals with family or friends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Amenities:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;High-speed Wi-Fi<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Smart TV with streaming services<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Private rooftop terrace with seating<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Washer and dryer<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Air conditioning and heating<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Neighborhood:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our penthouse is located in a vibrant neighborhood with local shops, cafes, and restaurants just a short walk away. Explore the charm of the area or easily access the city&rsquo;s main attractions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Additional Information:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Free parking available<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Self-check-in for convenience<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;We provide fresh linens and towels</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Come and experience the comfort and tranquility of our rooftop penthouse. Whether you&rsquo;re here for business or leisure, our space offers the perfect retreat.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Book your stay with us today and make your trip unforgettable.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', '1.	Check-In/Check-Out: Check-in is at 1:00 PM, and check-out is at 12:00 PM. Please adhere to these times to allow for cleaning and preparation for the next guests.\r\n	2.	Minimum Stay: We require a minimum stay of [2 days] for reservations.\r\n	3.	Guest Count: The maximum number of guests allowed is 4 . Please inform us in advance if you plan to have additional guests.\r\n	4.	Pets: allowed\r\n\r\n	6.	Smoking: Smoking  permitted inside the penthouse. You', 'We understand that plans can change, but please be aware of our cancellation policy:\r\n\r\n	•	Full refund for cancellations made within 48 hours of booking: If you cancel within 48 hours of booking and at least 14 days before your check-in date, you will receive a full refund.\r\n	•	50% refund for cancellations made at least 7 days before check-in: If you cancel at least 7 days before your check-in date, you will receive a 50% refund of the total accommodation fee.\r\n	•	No refund for cancellations made less than 7 days before check-in: If you cancel within 7 days of your check-in date, no refund will be provided.\r\n	•	Early Departure: If you decide to leave the penthouse earlier than your reserved dates, no refund will be provided for the unused nights.\r\n\r\nWe recommend considering travel insurance to protect your booking in case unforeseen circumstances arise.\r\n\r\nBy booking our penthouse, you agree to these booking conditions and our cancellation policy. We appreciate your understanding, and we’re here to assist you with any questions or concerns you may have.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4698419', '3.5851718', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0411898001692630353-property-AUG2023.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 536, 'No', NULL, 'Living room bed room', 'Yes', 'We will fix it', '75000', NULL, NULL, 'Host', '13:00', '13:00', '12:00', 'Owner', NULL, 'Yes', 'BRIDGEGATE', NULL, 'Yes', NULL, 'mini_events', NULL, 0, '2023-08-21 15:14:44', '2023-08-22 11:56:02'),
(697, 'short', NULL, '92230201', 'Stunning 4 Bedroom Penthouse with swimming pool and gym | Parkview, Ikoyi', 'Apartment', NULL, '1390', 2, 195000.00, 234000.00, NULL, NULL, '200000', 'Water heater\r\n\r\nHousekeeping is every other day\r\nNETFLIX\r\n\r\nCaution fee is 200k \r\n195k payout\r\nMontly payout rate-4.5m', '<p>This Beautiful 4-Bedroom Penthouse in Ikoyi is one you don&#39;t want to miss out on. This elegantly designed home features a, beautifully organized living room with nice decors and fittings and a touch of sophisticated lightings, a fully equipped kitchen with essential conveniences such as a microwave, oven, blender, fridge, freezer, and refrigerator to give a home aura and easy means to cook. Apartment is rooms-ensuite with home having a bathtub and 4 showers. Available also is a visitor toilet for convenience. In this home, we have 2 king size beds and 2 Queen size beds, all white beddings, and plush duvets to ensure pleasant rest is not compromised after a long day of explore. All rooms are furnished with Smart TVs hence viewing is made easy. Comfortable bathroom with toiletries and wash fluids provided.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther amenities in this apartment includes.<br />\r\nWater heater<br />\r\nWifi<br />\r\nDstv subscription,<br />\r\nNetflix subscription<br />\r\n24/7 electricity<br />\r\nWell air-conditioned apartment<br />\r\nHousekeeping is every other day<br />\r\nSwimming pool<br />\r\nBalcony<br />\r\nGym<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nN:B ; Caution fee is 200k</p>', 'To avoid loosing any money paid, you can move your check in date to another date that fits your schedule with the same accommodation booked. Notice must be given minimum 3 days before check in date. If you fail to give notice within this time, an equivalent of one night booking will be removed from your payment.', 'In case of cancellation the following charges will apply:\r\n\r\n– Up to 15 days before the arrival date, free cancellation.-\r\n\r\n14 days before the arrival date, 50% of the booking amount.-\r\n\r\nIn case of a no show: the full amount of the booking\r\n\r\nFor Bookings that fall during festive periods, (Valentine, Easter, Christmas, ) 50% of booking amount will only be refunded if cancelled regardless of when it was booked', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', NULL, 'A4 Adejoke court 9b gbenga ashaffa street parkview Estate ikoyi Lagos, , Parkview, Ikoyi, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4589915', '3.4469909', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0627638001692699183-property-AUG2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Accept', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserve', 591, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Admin', '14:00', '14:30', '12:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2023-08-22 10:13:03', '2023-08-31 15:09:17'),
(698, 'short', NULL, '85799851', 'Kess Apartment', 'Apartment', NULL, '1767', NULL, 55000.00, 66000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', NULL, '<p>Luxurious 1 bedroom apartment with a swimming pool .&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Location : Lekki phase 1</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Features :&nbsp;<br />\r\n- swimming pool&nbsp;<br />\r\n- WiFi&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Netflix&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Smart Tv ( living room and bedroom )<br />\r\n- Microwave&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Clean water&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Fridge&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Mirror&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen cabinet&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Top notch security&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For reservation call : <a href=\"tel:08105349008\">08105349008</a></p>', NULL, '24hrs notice after payment has been made', 'YES', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Adetola Ayeni , 105102, Lekki phase 1, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4470075', '3.4852886', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0333695001692783264-property-AUG2023.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book_now', NULL, 'No', NULL, 'Living room and bedroom', 'No', 'It will be resolved before the end of 24hrs', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Host', '02:00', '02:00', '00:00', 'Owner', NULL, 'Yes', 'Dej Apartment', 'Amore Gardens off freedom way', 'Yes', NULL, 'None', NULL, 0, '2023-08-23 09:37:43', '2023-08-23 11:01:01'),
(699, 'short', NULL, '15706860', 'Rose', 'Apartment', NULL, '1772', NULL, 70000.00, 84000.00, NULL, NULL, '50000', NULL, '<p>This apartment is home away from home. Located in a serene and secure estate with 24/7 power and top-notch security.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is within close proximity to malls, stores, pharmacies, restaurants, LSP; the No.1 paintball arena and sports park in Nigeria, and major roads within Lekki.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Features:<br />\r\n- 24 hour power<br />\r\n- 24 hour security<br />\r\n- Dedicated management&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Treated water<br />\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen<br />\r\n- Washing machine&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Air-conditioning<br />\r\n- Smart TV<br />\r\n- Fast WI-FI<br />\r\n- Netflix and Cable TV<br />\r\n- Swimming pool<br />\r\n- Kids&#39; playground&nbsp;<br />\r\n- Restaurant and lounge<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, 'YES', NULL, 'Yes', 'No', 'No', 'Yes', ', , Select Area, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.5243793', '3.3792057', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0787738001693252300-property-AUG2023.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', '2023-09-01', NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book_now', NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', 'We are always available', '150000', NULL, NULL, 'Host', '14:00', '14:00', '12:00', 'Facility_manager', NULL, 'Yes', 'Prime Water Garden Estate 2', 'Freedom Way', 'Yes', NULL, 'mini_events', 'We allow a maximum of 20 guests for house parties', 0, '2023-08-28 19:56:14', '2023-08-28 20:28:44'),
(700, 'short', NULL, '83047070', 'Luxury 3-bedroom Modern-Style Apartment', 'Apartment', NULL, '1777', 2, 130000.00, 156000.00, NULL, NULL, '100000', 'Host allows 10 guests', '<p>Gerdette Luxury Apartment offers a distinctive experience that evokes the feeling of being right at home.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thoughtfully furnished with contemporary designs and equipped with cutting-edge technology, it promises a craving for more exciting moments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nestled strategically in the prestigious Oniru area of Victoria Island, Lagos, this modern three-bedroom apartment boasts a sleek aesthetic.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Premium security.&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Smart apartment &ndash; fully automated.&nbsp;<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Water view.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Bluetooth ceiling speakers.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Netflix &amp; DSTV.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Free laundry services.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Unlimited WIFI.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Work station.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Steam shower.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Fully equipped kitchen.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Chef available on request.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; House keeping ( 6 a.m &ndash; 11 p.m ) daily.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Ample parking space.<br />\r\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;PS 5 &amp; Snooker game.</p>', NULL, NULL, 'NO', NULL, 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Water Corporation Drive, 101251, Oniru, Victoria island, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4244331', '3.4459952', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0436698001693472905-property-AUG2023.jpg', NULL, NULL, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'None', NULL, NULL, 1, 'None', NULL, NULL, 'https://gerdette.com/advert.mp4', 'Reserve', 50, 'No', NULL, '1 in sitting room, 1 each in room', 'No', '10 minutes', NULL, 'Smart House', NULL, 'Host', '14:00', '21:00', '12:00', 'Owner', NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, 'None', NULL, 1, '2023-08-31 09:13:31', '2023-09-01 13:15:23'),
(701, 'short', NULL, '90989942', 'Luxury 1 bedroom apartment in Lagos in Lekki Phase 2', 'Apartment', NULL, '1778', 2, 42000.00, 50400.00, NULL, NULL, '30000', NULL, '<p>Discover luxury living in Lekki Phase 2, Lagos! Our 1BR apartment offers unmatched comfort in a secure estate. Revel in 24/7 electricity, ensuring a stay free of interruptions.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connect to high-speed Wi-Fi or Netflix for endless entertainment. Step into our fully-equipped gym for a workout, or make a splash in the swimming pool. Rest easy in an AC-enhanced bedroom and modern bathrooms. With round-the-clock security and free parking, we provide a worry-free stay.</p>', NULL, '- Full Refund\r\n    Guests will receive a full refund if they cancel at least 7 days prior to check-in.\r\n- Partial Refund\r\n  Cancellations made within 7 days of check-in will receive a 30% refund \r\n- Last-Minute Cancellations\r\n  No refunds will be issued for cancellations made within 48 hours of check-in.', 'YES', NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Roxbury Leisure Homes, Phase 2/ Kimberly close unit 4, 101245, Ikota, Lekki, Lagos, Nigeria', '6.4325591', '3.4734189', 'uploads/property/AUG2023/0671695001693477083-property-AUG2023.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 'Shared', NULL, NULL, 1, 'None', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book_now', NULL, 'No', NULL, 'Living room and bed room', 'Yes', '1 - 20 mins', '60000', NULL, NULL, 'Host', '12:00', '18:30', '12:00', 'Owner', NULL, 'Yes', 'Roxbury Leisure Homes Estate', 'Mega Chicken', 'Yes', NULL, 'mini_events', '20', 0, '2023-08-31 10:18:05', '2023-09-04 11:34:55'),
